ocused regression coverage for websocket gateway RPC, pending timeout handling, terminal promotion, missing run IDs, and transcript-backed result recovery.","tree":{"sha":"41d08b5ff88b68964c5ac25b9fb4cb138b9fd270","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonochocki/mission-control/git/trees/41d08b5ff88b68964c5ac25b9fb4cb138b9fd270"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonochocki/mission-control/git/commits/b92c23a2e67789343514f5bc80aa19f6e5bb6bed","verification":{"payload":"tree 41d08b5ff88b68964c5ac25b9fb4cb138b9fd270\nparent 53745fd13e5d7609828ca4b3e47c4cf7595f7990\nauthor ChanchoNezz <fernando.nunez0413@gmail.com> 1778127281 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778127281 +0700\n\nfix(tasks): reconcile async gateway dispatch completions (#655)\n\nReplace Mission Control task dispatch gateway calls with the programmatic websocket RPC path and persist async run metadata for deferred reconciliation.\n\nKeep agent.wait timeout results pending, promote terminal completions to review, and recover assistant response text from OpenClaw transcripts when terminal payloads do not include text.\n\nAdd focused regression coverage for websocket gateway RPC, pending timeout handling, terminal promotion, missing run IDs, and transcript-backed result recovery.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp/BGxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXxEQADGMj8TgwAonsVTWEWf6p/4x\na/8lDwHFlsnhc93FyHeIW9I9jBW6QRqhYWf+GV9OrXVKp87LCKij5lNvPHWtUWwf\nQxQvsFtX5819ea1+XJkgtCbcJ/kim6Q/OPzFMLf+uEH/W1Bz6Ib3dWT3bLwNfsbB\nHFp2HD86g0OqSiLVLOTG7o+KhDIS7cmaiBvnijI2u5GRKvr8tU7gM/QzaqCEkE+9\n3ee3paUlZdbhpXeqW3sDonZ/1tkhAYFQjw2MSY4Limzj2jVh1+mThZUI0smVvJE7\nSK46B919irAsyiCYEpxUBwCkwOuMHTckOihs3T1+ZhBWVA5zP3oOsUpHti0df7Hs\nZHIc3wLTPQTY9jpJgdB+Avm45RD0F7dyIljUJNYAz3zX/TmXfqBHGZnoTHrrbBIA\nnTUxA7k5febplWKCAdp/X8KST6Hq64agoBdA20ZhKNctTQ0MDJmhsgjnMOB4VuH/\n1+/x6Hn9JN9J9PQkZfyOTxpXEC7niZQRQRkWGK0mmhLovxkYaO0/4VHOPl/7arXI\nBQHohylgytbWQFVSE0YA3zWKIShEU7YgmdRTTYTeKoX3BaPZ2KqcBauOtZqBT91j\n1d6/vf