owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mxihan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mxihan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonochocki/mission-control/commits/71f01fd3b262b009b02c849de11000e19a7fd348/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T04:11:17Z","email":"1181127934@qq.com","name":"HoshimiRIN"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T04:11:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: resolve CSRF origin mismatch behind reverse proxies (#592)\n\nThe CSRF check only compared the Host header against the browser''s\nOrigin, causing false positives when reverse proxies (e.g. Nginx Proxy\nManager) rewrite or strip the Host header or its port.\n\n- Check all host candidates (x-forwarded-host, x-original-host, etc.)\n  instead of only the Host header\n- Add port-normalized comparison that strips default ports (80/443)\n  before matching","tree":{"sha":"b59b748f7a49a6a756c967cbe2f8f098d3a51a25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonochocki/mission-control/git/trees/b59b748f7a49a6a756c967cbe2f8f098d3a51a25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonochocki/mission-control/git/commits/71f01fd3b262b009b02c849de11000e19a7fd348","verification":{"payload":"tree b59b748f7a49a6a756c967cbe2f8f098d3a51a25\nparent 3c8ef6e5d8909f77b18175e7e7cfec7c6b40c780\nauthor HoshimiRIN <1181127934@qq.com> 1778127077 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778127077 +0700\n\nfix: resolve CSRF origin mismatch behind reverse proxies (#592)\n\nThe CSRF check only compared the Host header against the browser''s\nOrigin, causing false positives when reverse proxies (e.g. Nginx Proxy\nManager) rewrite or strip the Host header or its port.\n\n- Check all host candidates (x-forwarded-host, x-original-host, etc.)\n  instead of only the Host header\n- Add port-normalized comparison that strips default ports (80/443)\n  before matching","reason":"valid","signature":"---