.com/jonochocki/mission-control/commit/549190576bcc08e4a7d2edc6e7839e5ca32efd15","sha":"549190576bcc08e4a7d2edc6e7839e5ca32efd15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonochocki/mission-control/commits/549190576bcc08e4a7d2edc6e7839e5ca32efd15"}],"sha":"3c8ef6e5d8909f77b18175e7e7cfec7c6b40c780","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonochocki/mission-control/commits/3c8ef6e5d8909f77b18175e7e7cfec7c6b40c780"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7302758?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galongin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galongin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galongin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galongin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/galongin","id":7302758,"login":"galongin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMDI3NTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galongin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galongin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galongin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galongin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galongin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/galongin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonochocki/mission-control/commits/549190576bcc08e4a7d2edc6e7839e5ca32efd15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T04:10:13Z","email":"galongin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Gal Longin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T04:10:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(validation): drop default values from updateTaskSchema (#621)\n\n`updateTaskSchema = createTaskSchema.partial()` makes every field\noptional but Zod''s `.partial()` keeps the underlying `.default(...)`,\nso a PUT body that omits e.g. `status` parses to `status: ''inbox''`,\n`tags: []`, `metadata: {}`. The route''s `if (field !== undefined)`\nguards then silently overwrite the stored row — a `PUT {title}` resets\nstatus to ''inbox'' and wipes tags/metadata.\n\nDefine `updateTaskSchema` explicitly with `.optional()` and no defaults.\nExtract the field validators into a shared `taskFields` map so the two\nschemas don''t drift. Defaults remain on `createTaskSchema` only.\n\nAdds regression tests covering empty body, single-field updates,\npass-through, and constraint enforcement.","tree":{"sha":"539b260c959a374cffcce6bf59971283342f7baa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonochocki/mission-control/git/trees/539b260c959a374cffcce6bf59971283342f7baa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonochocki/mission-control/git/commits/549190576bcc08e4a7d2edc6e7839e5ca32efd15","verification":{"payload":"tree 539b260c959a374cffcce6bf59971283342f7baa\nparent d7ad94929c51017fc1d8d152886856f38aa7f6bd\nauthor Gal Longin <galongin@users.noreply.github.com> 1778127013 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778127013 +0700\n\nfix(validation): drop default values from updateTaskSchema (#621)\n\n`updateTaskSchema = createTaskSchema.partial()` makes every field\noptional but Zod''s `.partial()` keeps the underlying `.default(...)`,\nso a PUT body that omits e.g. `status` parses to `status: ''inbox''`,\n`tags: []`, `metadata: {}`. The route''s `if (field !== undefined)`\nguards then silently overwrite the stored row — a `PUT {title}` resets\nstatus to ''inbox'' and wipes tags/metadata.\n\nDefine `updateTaskSchema` explicitly with `.optional()` and no defaults.\nExtract the field validators into a shared `taskFields` map so the two\nschemas don''t drift. Defaults remain on `createTaskSchema` only.\n\nAdds regression tests covering empty body, single-field updates,\npass-through, and constraint enforcement.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp/BClCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdg0QAHnn2X81zfQjEbxA4S2NIs8B\n0NlEtOEkFy5RgWQaKGozKsy5e7IYrO