EWAY_URL = ''mc-gateway-url'')\n- User''s explicit choice takes priority over NEXT_PUBLIC_GATEWAY_URL env\n- Dashboard reads localStorage on boot and sets full mode if present\n- 5s timeout on test connection","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2TaECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAz+YQAB1NhHElqN09Fhk7kyaeC7PB\npOQS2LY+RiWaz8xxMBd85zucJ7avEu1iEcYShohbnsxM8bl9KHp40DHweTorto+4\nlyZl5SBY1PulONJTQuzjZEybuF3OJYVnH02+PeYKMmlSJhrjJymR/eCYELFYkJux\n/1P/TvFs7Zihu6xxOxtvUCyXhCY43VB5Rayo4c3dp9YDZzchPFG2mNfgrhbUcb8+\nQRBzUZDRB2QpRZ4OPaaRb4l093fCKPq4Pdn1Ro+dyBoLu6rjfF1R1YWNk9STS6e2\nbjQfHvcv9yIzbxawDB7NnQ57R7TobvRV03C8lqf+Ztk5ET2O42vvLDBWn9LxAgLg\n010rsc5Dqwf2H2T8PMzJLgks3d3FsJyVbQu43Qs7UfK3IsSvx3oAN5GuN7NXGPlc\n3qh/LXj/ngySiFidfZd/XZPcI1U0Gz1C3Ia1axJbZFdayqh9jz/3zPwYUvv1egm9\n9lefyNbOAFV//g3K4BoAfKvuL11iqR+kuHVVYEsZx5u03V/5T6UDxgFRBqwCrN1Q\nXGrvB7nZeyUcZMkY1CPjCD1lsGCOM3R7jxwa1I9nXLmlS44S9IMDW6BaX3UOWVaQ\nUwGK2rjQMmcsrwWErIYgIzLWfzt75VOJfvp43cfGwUKe9ZK+OphRk08mCZZ4V7/B\nfWnWgS45s3cwDL8x1l9r\n=v2lt\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-10T17:42:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https: