"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: add per-user rate limiting to password change endpoint (#573)\n\nPassword change endpoint previously had no rate limiting — an attacker\nwith a stolen session could brute-force current_password.\n\n- Add createKeyedRateLimiter() for arbitrary string keys (e.g. user IDs)\n- Add passwordChangeLimiter: 5/min per user ID\n- Wire into PATCH /api/auth/me when new_password is provided\n- Separate from login rate limiter so legitimate users aren''t blocked","tree":{"sha":"4830f8dd3544c72846a22594415d326d97c865ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonochocki/mission-control/git/trees/4830f8dd3544c72846a22594415d326d97c865ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonochocki/mission-control/git/commits/c94010d5ebe49af1f41cd3080f037567cd743745","verification":{"payload":"tree 4830f8dd3544c72846a22594415d326d97c865ea\nparent 7f26c000f44130e05b9800b764d3c7c86be801c5\nauthor Alessandro Martini <alessandromartini@gmail.com> 1775842784 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775842784 +0700\n\nfix: add per-user rate limiting to password change endpoint (#573)\n\nPassword change endpoint previously had no rate limiting — an attacker\nwith a stolen session could brute-force current_password.\n\n- Add createKeyedRateLimiter() for arbitrary string keys (e.g. user IDs)\n- Add passwordChangeLimiter: 5/min per user ID\n- Wire into PATCH /api/auth/me when new_password is provided\n- Separate from login rate limiter so legitimate users aren''t blocked","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2TXgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlWIQAA4in3R+Ac1oBs1EuryE5hWI\n+xHzHafRdU9Mg1+AzXzSMw8DoddhGXrLTRo2YaPu9SLBfZurmHakhE5trm/HKSYO\nSqqO+qQF3VYmGXovtbqfW08REtHCELDbOx4IJbDZjrJtjWOREKgcNZfTeKTUQlWz\nU02TcWuOSZxA/jQgvVGOQEhNabbXqe7JzY7dE7CHZPvyC6gNmhz25Oc3jplbk3wt\naPq6iVQ09ai3jo1Gr4BipejJKpDNelWNjxXgCN6/CXEQIUdwYZg0E94NGq3MyWEd\nNP7F7Y9zBniiy91p6tg5oeFuZoMiY0dxLtB7hJ3wH7chOlLlLDh67IkoiXZKGrvF\nWO98699NcwGy6sBNltv6Z+qZ6i+eJ