\nE8 reconcile pilot. Version bump forces core reseed on redeploy, which\nreconciles the live music apps doc groupIds from the hardened seed\n([admins, music_admin, music_editor, music_viewer]) — removing the stale\nEveryone grant. Verified live==seed across apps/windows/dashboards/items.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"01c50667a44932fe0c9cb042b0b708b2c0e4b3ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/trees/01c50667a44932fe0c9cb042b0b708b2c0e4b3ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/commits/238138b8779a5d084016eb5fb228ea7bd856e102","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/238138b8779a5d084016eb5fb228ea7bd856e102","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVGvNoAKDIzODEzOGI4Nzc5YTVkMDg0MDE2ZWI1ZmIyMjhlYTdiZDg1NmUxMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/b49038c1f712a6c4ba96c52ef044221de1a5cc3c","sha":"b49038c1f712a6c4ba96c52ef044221de1a5cc3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/b49038c1f712a6c4ba96c52ef044221de1a5cc3c"}],"sha":"238138b8779a5d084016eb5fb228ea7bd856e102","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/238138b8779a5d084016eb5fb228ea7bd856e102"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/b49038c1f712a6c4ba96c52ef044221de1a5cc3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T08:58:19Z","email":"personal-developer@theitemapp.local","name":"Personal Developer (Claude)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T08:58:19Z","email":"personal-developer@theitemapp.local","name":"Personal Developer (Claude)"},"message":"security: scope Music app off everyone-access (E3 RBAC hardening)\n\nRe-scope all Music models, UI surfaces, and app record off the `everyone`\nbaseline group and onto the per-app tier model (music_admin/editor/viewer\n+ core admins).\n\nModels (items.json):\n- music_tracks: read [admins,admin,editor,viewer], create/edit\n  [admins,admin,editor], delete [admins,admin]. Strips everyone from all\n  4 actions; adds core admins everywhere. x-rls (userId) retained.\n- music_tags: same auth shape. Strips everyone-read; adds admins to all.\n\napps.json: groupIds floor [admins, music_admin] + editor/viewer tiers;\nremoved everyone (authenticated app, no anonymous surface).\n\nRLS records (dashboards x2, windows x11): stamped\n[admins, music_admin, music_editor, music_viewer]; removed everyone so the\napp-admin tier retains visibility.\n\nmusic_tags catalog rows (95): record groupIds stripped of everyone, mirror\nthe read tiers.\n\nmusic-backend functional user keeps music_admin (bypasses row-security for\nbackground generation) + everyone login baseline. Seed-only, no deploy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c976760f7e8322633257af6f56301477b7101d44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/trees/c976760f7e8322633257af6f56301477b7101d44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/commits/b49038c1f712a6c4ba96c52ef044221de1a5cc3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/b49038c1f712a6c4ba96c52ef044221de1a5cc3c","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVGvNoAKGI0OTAzOGMxZjcxMmE2YzRiYTk2YzUyZWYwNDQyMjFkZTFhNWNjM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/219796342a0824c3b59f5106783361e16ea9627b","sha":"219796342a0824c3b59f5106783361e16ea9627b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/219796342a0824c3b59f5106783361e16ea9627b"}],"sha":"b49038c1f712a6c4ba96c52ef044221de1a5cc3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/b49038c1f712a6c4ba96c52ef044221de1a5cc3c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/219796342a0824c3b59f5106783361e16ea9627b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T12:22:59Z","email":"deployment-engineer@theitemapp.local","name":"Deployment Engineer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T12:22:59Z","email":"deployment-engineer@theitemapp.local","name":"Deployment Engineer"},"message":"fix(seed): make manifest idempotent + lossless; sync canonical seed to DB\n\n- groups: add `appId` to exportFields so group→app scoping survives export round-trips\n- apps: remove exportFields (registration-lifecycle-managed; exporter now skips it cleanly)\n- music_tags: sync canonical seed to live DB state (95 tags, alphabetical order, _id included)\n- items: sync auth groupId changes made during RBAC hardening; x-rls on music_tracks confirmed intact\n- prefabs/items: record ordering drift (deterministic exporter sort) — harmless\n- music_tracks: confirmed NOT in manifest (user data stays out of seed)\nDouble-export verified idempotent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6b8b5c39dbab69dba5a48d2eaebcf8deaee8d9c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/trees/6b8b5c39dbab69dba5a48d2eaebcf8deaee8d9c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/commits/219796342a0824c3b59f5106783361e16ea9627b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/219796342a0824c3b59f5106783361e16ea9627b","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVGvNoAKDIxOTc5NjM0MmEwODI0YzNiNTlmNTEwNjc4MzM2MWUxNmVhOTYyN2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/8c652d427ef2612b57511c1ec67c64bb5aa6906e","sha":"8c652d427ef2612b57511c1ec67c64bb5aa