.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/8c652d427ef2612b57511c1ec67c64bb5aa6906e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/23d7474725980fc4ec9e6deede8e21ac02714878/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T15:26:34Z","email":"coding-agent@theitemapp.local","name":"Coding Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T15:26:34Z","email":"coding-agent@theitemapp.local","name":"Coding Agent"},"message":"6507309 chore: bump appVersion to 1.0.1 to force items re-seed on deploy\n\nSquashed 2 commits from rbac/music-app-groups:\n- 6507309 chore: bump appVersion to 1.0.1 to force items re-seed on deploy\n- 4bcf091 security: add app-scoped RBAC groups + per-user row-security for Music","tree":{"sha":"6b27dec2ac6b8afa522ebe76ec7f4b8fa7fc6c6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/trees/6b27dec2ac6b8afa522ebe76ec7f4b8fa7fc6c6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/commits/23d7474725980fc4ec9e6deede8e21ac02714878","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/23d7474725980fc4ec9e6deede8e21ac02714878","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVGvNoAKDIzZDc0NzQ3MjU5ODBmYzRlYzllNmRlZWRlOGUyMWFjMDI3MTQ4Nzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/b1a499b01a2c08a149612d7bee836967fff7f508","sha":"b1a499b01a2c08a149612d7bee836967fff7f508","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/b1a499b01a2c08a149612d7bee836967fff7f508"}],"sha":"23d7474725980fc4ec9e6deede8e21ac02714878","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/23d7474725980fc4ec9e6deede8e21ac02714878"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/650730919462b7e5e3fc093d08381042d3d726df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T15:23:28Z","email":"security-engineer@theitemapp.local","name":"Security Engineer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T15:23:28Z","email":"security-engineer@theitemapp.local","name":"Security Engineer"},"message":"chore: bump appVersion to 1.0.1 to force items re-seed on deploy\n\nThe registration seeder gates the full collection seed on appVersion.\nWithout a version bump the items collection (and x-rls row-security)\nwould not be applied on re-deploy. Bump 1.0.0→1.0.1 forces a re-seed\nso the new music group auth and x-rls config land in the live DB.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6b27dec2ac6b8afa522ebe76ec7f4b8fa7fc6c6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/trees/6b27dec2ac6b8afa522ebe76ec7f4b8fa7fc6c6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/commits/650730919462b7e5e3fc093d08381042d3d726df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/650730919462b7e5e3fc093d08381042d3d726df","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVGvNoAKDY1MDczMDkxOTQ2MmI3ZTVlM2ZjMDkzZDA4MzgxMDQyZDNkNzI2ZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/4bcf0915de0100d087a2eb3b4a638696d5ee365d","sha":"4bcf0915de0100d087a2eb3b4a638696d5ee365d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/4bcf0915de0100d087a2eb3b4a638696d5ee365d"}],"sha":"650730919462b7e5e3fc093d08381042d3d726df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/650730919462b7e5e3fc093d08381042d3d726df"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/4bcf0915de0100d087a2eb3b4a638696d5ee365d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T15:15:08Z","email":"security-engineer@theitemapp.local","name":"Security Engineer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T15:15:08Z","email":"security-engineer@theitemapp.local","name":"Security Engineer"},"message":"security: add app-scoped RBAC groups + per-user row-security for Music\n\n- Add dbseed/groups.json: music_admin/music_editor/music_viewer (OIDs\n  8c...040001/2/3) scoped to appId 8c...0001, systemManaged.\n- Wire groups first in manifest.json so they seed before items/users.\n  Add x-rls to items exportFields so row-security config round-trips.\n- Repoint all model auth off core admins → music groups:\n  music_tracks: read=[admin,editor,viewer,everyone] create/edit=[admin,editor,everyone] delete=[admin,everyone]\n  music_tags:   read=[admin,editor,viewer,everyone] create/edit=[admin,editor] delete=[admin]\n- Add userId field (readonly, x-ref users) to music_tracks schema as\n  the x-rls anchor; auto-stamped from request identity on creation.\n- Add x-rls {field:userId, bypassGroups:[music_admin]} to music_tracks\n  so each user only sees their own tracks while the music-api functional\n  user (music_admin) bypasses row-security for background patching.\n- Remove core admins (7000...0001) and superadmin (7000...0005) from\n  music-backend user; replace with everyone + music_admin only.\n\nSecurity findings fixed: superadmin on functional user (critical),\n  core-admins dependency on app model auth (high), missing row-security\n  on user-owned data (high).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7405e85ba81fc806af02634c60ecc2a70600fb0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/trees/7405e85ba81fc806af02634c60ecc2a70600fb0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/commits/4bcf0915de0100d087a2eb3b4a638696d5ee365d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/4bcf0915de0100d087a2eb3b4a638696d5ee365d","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVGvNoAKDRiY2YwOTE1ZGUwMTAwZDA4N2EyZWIzYjRhNjM4Njk2ZDVlZTM2NWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/b1a499b01a2c08a149612d7bee836967fff7f508","sha":"b1a499b01a2c08a149612d7bee836967fff7f508","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/b1a499b01a2c08a149612d7bee836967fff7f508"}],"sha":"4bcf0915de0100d087a2eb3b4a638696d5ee365d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/4bcf0915de0100d087a2eb3b4a638696d5ee365d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/b1a499b01a2c08a149612d7bee836967fff7f508/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T23:09:08Z","email":"personal-developer@theitemapp.local","name":"Personal Developer (Claude)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T23:09:08Z","email":"personal-developer@theitemapp.local","name":"Personal Developer (Claude)"},"message":"ci: add GAR build-images workflow\n\nBuilds and pushes this app''s image(s) to Artifact Registry\n(europe-central2/theitemapp/theitemapp), mirroring the vanda/snake pattern:\nGCP auth via GCP_DEPLOY_SA_KEY, dorny/paths-filter change detection,\ntags = git SHA + dbseed manifest appVersion + latest.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de30e9fca84137babc7feeff1bc85ee00aab5e98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/trees/de30e9fca84137babc7feeff1bc85ee00aab5e98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/commits/b1a499b01a2c08a149612d7bee836967fff7f508","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/b1a499b01a2c08a149612d7bee836967fff7f508","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVGvNoAKGIxYTQ5OWIwMWEyYzA4YTE0OTYxMmQ3YmVlODM2OTY3ZmZmN2Y1MDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/d67cc21b1e42b8ffff9cfd48ba39f3eb6af3ae10","sha":"d67cc21b1e42b8ffff9cfd48ba39f3eb6af3ae10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/d67cc21b1e42b8ffff9cfd48ba39f3eb6af3ae10"}],"sha":"b1a499b01a2c08a149612d7bee836967fff7f508","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/b1a499b01a2c08a149612d7bee836967fff7f508"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/d67cc21b1e42b8ffff9cfd48ba39f3eb6af3ae10/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T23:29:01Z","email":"personal-developer@theitemapp.local","name":"Personal Developer (Claude)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T23:29:01Z","email":"personal-developer@theitemapp.local","name":"Personal Developer (Claude)"},"message":"refactor(music-api): adopt @loynazkovacs/theitemapp-backend-sdk 0.4.0, drop raw-fetch shims\n\nBump the backend SDK from ^0.2.0 to ^0.4.0 and replace the three raw-`fetch`\nshims in coreApiClient with the SDK''s native user-scoped client. 0.4.0''s\n`asUser({ authorization, cookie }, { keepApiKey: true })` forwards the end\nuser''s credentials AND the functional x-api-key (+ default skip-webhooks header)\non every write, which is exactly what the music app needs so track rows and\naudio files are owned by the originating user:\n\n  - createTrack -> asUser(...).create(''music_tracks'', doc)\n  - patchTrack  -> asUser(...).update(''music_tracks'', id, { $set: patch })\n  - uploadFile  -> asUser(...).uploadFile(bytes, { kind: ''file'', ... })\n\nSame method names, signatures, return shapes and behaviour; the dual-auth\nfallback (functional key only when the user''s token has expired mid-generation)\nis preserved by passing empty creds. Removes the bespoke functionalHeaders /\nrequestHeaders helpers. No raw requests remain in coreApiClient.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f52e46b51040df5257c1bcc987b09217f890a2b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/trees/f52e46b51040df5257c1bcc987b09217f890a2b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/commits/d67cc21b1e42b8ffff9cfd48ba39f3eb6af3ae10","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/d67cc21b1e42b8ffff9cfd48ba39f3eb6af3ae10","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVGvNoAKGQ2N2NjMjFiMWU0MmI4ZmZmZjljZmQ0OGJhMzlmM2ViNmFmM2FlMTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/591410e28db9d8e4ee7ebdbf2fa2be6fdc1c9cfb","sha":"591410e28db9d8e4ee7ebdbf2fa2be6fdc1c9cfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/591410e28db9d8e4ee7ebdbf2fa2be6fdc1c9cfb"}],"sha":"d67cc21b1e42b8ffff9cfd48ba39f3eb6af3ae10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/d67cc21b1e42b8ffff9cfd48ba39f3eb6af3ae10"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/591410e28db9d8e4ee7ebdbf2fa2be6fdc1c9cfb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T16:05:47Z","email":"personal-developer@theitemapp.local","name":"Personal Developer (Claude)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T16:05:47Z","email":"personal-developer@theitemapp.local","name":"Personal Developer (Claude)"},"message":"refactor(music-api): adopt @loynazkovacs/theitemapp-backend-sdk 0.2.0\n\nReplace the hand-rolled registration loop, core API client, and auth\nverification with the shared backend SDK, with zero behaviour change and\nno call-site changes outside the swapped files.\n\n- index.ts: registration/retry/heartbeat/deregister + /app/re-register now\n  driven by startAppRegistration (installSignalHandlers:false; Fastify still\n  closes cleanly in the existing shutdown via registration.stop()+deregister()).\n- coreApiClient.ts: thin adapter over the SDK''s CoreApiClient + verifyUser.\n  updateApiKey/hasApiKey/verifyAuth delegate to the SDK. createTrack/patchTrack/\n  uploadFile stay raw fetch (authenticated via sdk.getApiKey()) because they\n  forward the END USER''s Authorization/Cookie alongside the functional x-api-key\n  — an SDK gap (no createAsUser; updateAsUser strips the functional key and has\n  no cookie/multipart support). $set-wrapped patches and skip-webhooks preserved.\n- package.json: add @loynazkovacs/theitemapp-backend-sdk ^0.2.0 (Dockerfile uses\n  npm install, so no lockfile regen).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"36183697490fb7da1b5e4437890f3e0e01d966cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/trees/36183697490fb7da1b5e4437890f3e0e01d966cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/commits/591410e28db9d8e4ee7ebdbf2fa2be6fdc1c9cfb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/591410e28db9d8e4ee7ebdbf2fa2be6fdc1c9cfb","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVGvNoAKDU5MTQxMGUyOGRiOWQ4ZTRlZTdlYmRiZjJmYTJiZTZmZGMxYzljZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/55b910b331da6ce426603f752eb297ec6b01ce45","sha":"55b910b331da6ce426603f752eb297ec6b01ce45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/55b910b331da6ce426603f752eb297ec6b01ce45"}],"sha":"591410e28db9d8e4ee7ebdbf2fa2be6fdc1c9cfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/591410e28db9d8e4ee7ebdbf2fa2be6fdc1c9cfb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/55b910b331da6ce426603f752eb297ec6b01ce45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T19:09:51Z","email":"personal-developer@theitemapp.local","name":"Personal Developer (Claude)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T19:09:51Z","email":"personal-developer@theitemapp.local","name":"Personal Developer (Claude)"},"message":"feat(music): gold-standard Overview dashboard (KPI band, trees+views, charts, relationship-aware layout)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ca5ebc39c02ce9de390f1c5c78e5015122e0ce7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/trees/1ca5ebc39c02ce9de390f1c5c78e5015122e0ce7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/commits/55b910b331da6ce426603f752eb297ec6b01ce45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/55b910b331da6ce426603f752eb297ec6b01ce45","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVGvNoAKDU1YjkxMGIzMzFkYTZjZTQyNjYwM2Y3NTJlYjI5N2VjNmIwMWNlNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/a4b454481880f1a2dfe27da8edf3d5393ddb38a0","sha":"a4b454481880f1a2dfe27da8edf3d5393ddb38a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/a4b454481880f1a2dfe27da8edf3d5393ddb38a0"}],"sha":"55b910b331da6ce426603f752eb297ec6b01ce45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/55b910b331da6ce426603f752eb297ec6b01ce45"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/a4b454481880f1a2dfe27da8edf3d5393ddb38a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T16:46:29Z","email":"coding-agent@theitemapp.local","name":"Coding Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T16:46:29Z","email":"coding-agent@theitemapp.local","name":"Coding Agent"},"message":"security R2: enforce auth on business/operational endpoints (deployments k8s ops, gaussian/control-freak user actions, billing platform checkout, image-generator core proxies, maxdesign generate), per-resource RBAC ownership gates (chat terminals/personas/contacts), lock CORS to same-origin (origin:false), km-gateway socket JWT-signature verification + tenant authz\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"15635804a16827d56017ccf44ce0e532103450f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/trees/15635804a16827d56017ccf44ce0e532103450f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/commits/a4b454481880f1a2dfe27da8edf3d5393ddb38a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/a4b454481880f1a2dfe27da8edf3d5393ddb38a0","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVGvNoAKGE0YjQ1NDQ4MTg4MGYxYTJkZmUyN2RhOGVkZjNkNTM5M2RkYjM4YTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/69e1579fe4a2e8f784a5f9ea0580c254f9d37868","sha":"69e1579fe4a2e8f784a5f9ea0580c254f9d37868","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/69e1579fe4a2e8f784a5f9ea0580c254f9d37868"}],"sha":"a4b454481880f1a2dfe27da8edf3d5393ddb38a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/a4b454481880f1a2dfe27da8edf3d5393ddb38a0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/69e1579fe4a2e8f784a5f9ea0580c254f9d37868/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T16:23:20Z","email":"coding-agent@theitemapp.local","name":"Coding Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T16:23:20Z","email":"coding-agent@theitemapp.local","name":"Coding Agent"},"message":"security: round-1 hardening — lock services behind core Caddy (internal-only), MongoDB keyFile auth, de-root backend/system-api, input-validation & path-traversal fixes, secrets/.gitignore hygiene\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a4eadfd97d08041c0cce6f03eeaa2d4ce6f175a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/trees/a4eadfd97d08041c0cce6f03eeaa2d4ce6f175a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/commits/69e1579fe4a2e8f784a5f9ea0580c254f9d37868","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/69e1579fe4a2e8f784a5f9ea0580c254f9d37868","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVGvNoAKDY5ZTE1NzlmZTRhMmU4Zjc4NGE1ZjllYTA1ODBjMjU0ZjlkMzc4Njg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/3f027650d04bb0344854d3e5dc02878932c4f365","sha":"3f027650d04bb0344854d3e5dc02878932c4f365","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/3f027650d04bb0344854d3e5dc02878932c4f365"}],"sha":"69e1579fe4a2e8f784a5f9ea0580c254f9d37868","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/69e1579fe4a2e8f784a5f9ea0580c254f9d37868"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/3f027650d04bb0344854d3e5dc02878932c4f365/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T02:44:00Z","email":"coding-agent@theitemapp.local","name":"Coding Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T02:44:00Z","email":"coding-agent@theitemapp.local","name":"Coding Agent"},"message":"188b87c docs(music): reconcile README with shipped reality","tree":{"sha":"d7df60d080eb9534925874df8758d57b1fe2fdd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/trees/d7df60d080eb9534925874df8758d57b1fe2fdd0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/commits/3f027650d04bb0344854d3e5dc02878932c4f365","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/3f027650d04bb0344854d3e5dc02878932c4f365","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVGvNoAKDNmMDI3NjUwZDA0YmIwMzQ0ODU0ZDNlNWRjMDI4Nzg5MzJjNGYzNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/f0bd2adb3b28be9606c6ffc626b1ca3c7db845fe","sha":"f0bd2adb3b28be9606c6ffc626b1ca3c7db845fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/f0bd2adb3b28be9606c6ffc626b1ca3c7db845fe"}],"sha":"3f027650d04bb0344854d3e5dc02878932c4f365","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/3f027650d04bb0344854d3e5dc02878932c4f365"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/f0bd2adb3b28be9606c6ffc626b1ca3c7db845fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T01:21:00Z","email":"personal-developer@theitemapp.local","name":"Personal Developer (Claude)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T01:21:00Z","email":"personal-developer@theitemapp.local","name":"Personal Developer (Claude)"},"message":"feat(music-engine): GPU self-report for the System Monitor\n\nAdd the first-party `app-resources` contract so the monitor can attribute and\noffload HeartMuLa''s GPU use:\n  GET  /app/resources            — reports the HeartMuLa workload + torch VRAM\n                                    only while the model is resident (0/idle when\n                                    lazy-unloaded)\n  POST /app/resources/unload/:k  — drops the pipeline + frees VRAM (torch, so it\n                                    truly releases in-process; reloads on next\n                                    /generate)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de24fbedf5dd97df16a7433aaf4e839ad7ec758d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/trees/de24fbedf5dd97df16a7433aaf4e839ad7ec758d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/commits/f0bd2adb3b28be9606c6ffc626b1ca3c7db845fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/f0bd2adb3b28be9606c6ffc626b1ca3c7db845fe","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVGvNoAKGYwYmQyYWRiM2IyOGJlOTYwNmM2ZmZjNjI2YjFjYTNjN2RiODQ1ZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/dca19c7825d9c5d3c1091d56cfe3ff6cfe957a61","sha":"dca19c7825d9c5d3c1091d56cfe3ff6cfe957a61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/dca19c7825d9c5d3c1091d56cfe3ff6cfe957a61"}],"sha":"f0bd2adb3b28be9606c6ffc626b1ca3c7db845fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/f0bd2adb3b28be9606c6ffc626b1ca3c7db845fe"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/dca19c7825d9c5d3c1091d56cfe3ff6cfe957a61/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T00:02:47Z","email":"personal-developer@theitemapp.local","name":"Personal Developer (Claude)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T00:02:47Z","email":"personal-developer@theitemapp.local","name":"Personal Developer (Claude)"},"message":"feat(music): music_tags lookup model + categorized chip picker in Studio\n\n- New music_tags lookup model (item 8c..030002): key/label/category/order/\n  enabled, seeded with 95 curated tags across genre/mood/instrument/vocal/\n  tempo/production (dbseed/data/music_tags.json, manifest entry).\n- Studio loads enabled tags grouped by category and renders them as toggleable\n  chips; selecting composes the comma-separated tags string the engine needs.\n  Free-typing in the input still works (the string stays the source of truth).\n- Default style set to real chip labels (lo-fi, piano, ambient) so initial\n  selection highlights correctly. Removed the old static presets.\n\nAdd a tag anytime by creating a music_tags row — it appears as a chip live.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d611c8a10895c8dc98e4e767f8bf29b2487b393","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/trees/9d611c8a10895c8dc98e4e767f8bf29b2487b393"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/commits/dca19c7825d9c5d3c1091d56cfe3ff6cfe957a61","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/dca19c7825d9c5d3c1091d56cfe3ff6cfe957a61","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVGvNoAKGRjYTE5Yzc4MjVkOWM1ZDNjMTA5MWQ1NmNmZTNmZjZjZmU5NTdhNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/ac6b91d215e5aa6454c155b678855e74fead9a08","sha":"ac6b91d215e5aa6454c155b678855e74fead9a08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/ac6b91d215e5aa6454c155b678855e74fead9a08"}],"sha":"dca19c7825d9c5d3c1091d56cfe3ff6cfe957a61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/dca19c7825d9c5d3c1091d56cfe3ff6cfe957a61"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/ac6b91d215e5aa6454c155b678855e74fead9a08/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T23:47:37Z","email":"personal-developer@theitemapp.local","name":"Personal Developer (Claude)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T23:47:37Z","email":"personal-developer@theitemapp.local","name":"Personal Developer (Claude)"},"message":"fix(music): create tracks and files in the user''s name via user JWT\n\n- Upload generated audio strictly under the caller''s JWT (ownerId = the user);\n  remove the silent fallback to the app''s functional user so a track is never\n  app-owned.\n- Patch the music_tracks status under the user''s JWT too (caller owns the row),\n  falling back to the app key only if their token expired mid-generation.\n- Drop the forced Everyone group on new tracks — each user owns their own\n  tracks/files (personal library), consistent with file ownership.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6bb6f3ae0690115aeaa6ddf415ee6d5ea60d22ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/trees/6bb6f3ae0690115aeaa6ddf415ee6d5ea60d22ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/commits/ac6b91d215e5aa6454c155b678855e74fead9a08","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/ac6b91d215e5aa6454c155b678855e74fead9a08","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVGvNoAKGFjNmI5MWQyMTVlNWFhNjQ1NGMxNTViNjc4ODU1ZTc0ZmVhZDlhMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/6ededcb2936ae3c32af4897663deed90cb8fd7f2","sha":"6ededcb2936ae3c32af4897663deed90cb8fd7f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/6ededcb2936ae3c32af4897663deed90cb8fd7f2"}],"sha":"ac6b91d215e5aa6454c155b678855e74fead9a08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/ac6b91d215e5aa6454c155b678855e74fead9a08"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/6ededcb2936ae3c32af4897663deed90cb8fd7f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T23:31:39Z","email":"personal-developer@theitemapp.local","name":"Personal Developer (Claude)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T23:31:39Z","email":"personal-developer@theitemapp.local","name":"Personal Developer (Claude)"},"message":"feat: music generation app (HeartMuLa engine + studio + player)\n\nThree-tier TheItemApp app for AI music generation:\n- engine/  : Python FastAPI wrapping HeartMuLa (heartlib, Apache-2.0) on GPU;\n             POST /generate (lyrics+tags -> mp3), /health; resumable, sentinel-\n             gated checkpoint download into a persistent volume; lazy_load frees\n             VRAM after each job so it coexists with ComfyUI/Ollama.\n- backend/ : Fastify music-api; registers with core, async generation (creates a\n             music_tracks row, generates in background, uploads audio to core\n             files, flips status ready/failed).\n- platform/: Angular 21 Native Federation remote; MusicStudio (compose) and\n             MusicPlayer (playlist) prefabs.\n- dbseed/  : music app, music_tracks model, prefabs, dashboards, windows, user.\n\nNo ComfyUI dependency; OID namespace 8c. Generated tracks are stored as core\nfiles owned by the generating user.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"617829987259bb93ce2a9cb989ae45ca3a79dd8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/trees/617829987259bb93ce2a9cb989ae45ca3a79dd8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/git/commits/6ededcb2936ae3c32af4897663deed90cb8fd7f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commit/6ededcb2936ae3c32af4897663deed90cb8fd7f2","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVGvNoAKDZlZGVkY2IyOTM2YWUzYzMyYWY0ODk3NjYzZGVlZDkwY2I4ZmQ3ZjI","parents":[],"sha":"6ededcb2936ae3c32af4897663deed90cb8fd7f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits/6ededcb2936ae3c32af4897663deed90cb8fd7f2"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/LoynazKovacs/TheItemApp_music/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=238138b8779a5d084016eb5fb228ea7bd856e102&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A00%3A41.530Z"}');
