nOcampo05/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanOcampo05/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JonathanOcampo05","id":168589719,"login":"JonathanOcampo05","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx5lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanOcampo05/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanOcampo05/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanOcampo05/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanOcampo05/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanOcampo05/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanOcampo05","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/37a8792f7b50a7abccdfda2c73df66a94b900b7c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T10:32:32Z","email":"20233tn116@utez.edu.mx","name":"JonathanOcampo05"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T10:32:32Z","email":"20233tn116@utez.edu.mx","name":"JonathanOcampo05"},"message":"feat: alexa skill con vux i18n y backend real\n\nSkill de Alexa con soporte de interaccion en ingles y espanol (en-US y\nes-MX), conectada al backend real en vez de datos mock:\n\n- apiClient: llamadas al backend real para las intents.\n- languageStrings: cadenas localizadas en-US/es-MX.\n- speechBuilders: respuestas de voz por locale.\n- dateRange: parseo de rangos de fecha ajustado a los nuevos intents.\n- index: wiring de los handlers al backend real.\n- interactionModels: modelo de interaccion en-US nuevo y es-MX ampliado.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38c8389ba0ac7abd87ee2add69f6839eb29f3e46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/trees/38c8389ba0ac7abd87ee2add69f6839eb29f3e46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/commits/37a8792f7b50a7abccdfda2c73df66a94b900b7c","verification":{"pa