ers/JonathanOcampo05/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanOcampo05/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JonathanOcampo05","id":168589719,"login":"JonathanOcampo05","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx5lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanOcampo05/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanOcampo05/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanOcampo05/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanOcampo05/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanOcampo05/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanOcampo05","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/ea43d1c85bdf35caf0b3d4ea0475a41d4f493ab9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T10:32:07Z","email":"20233tn116@utez.edu.mx","name":"JonathanOcampo05"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T10:32:07Z","email":"20233tn116@utez.edu.mx","name":"JonathanOcampo05"},"message":"chore(infra): excluir ALEXA/lambda del linter de Biome\n\nEl commit 2423119 corrigio los ~473 falsos positivos de formato aplicando\nel autofix de Biome una sola vez sobre ALEXA/lambda, pero no excluyo la\ncarpeta del linter. Al seguir escribiendo codigo nuevo ahi (VUX i18n con\nbackend real), los mismos patrones (ej. `a && a.b` en vez de `a?.b`)\nvuelven a marcar errores. ALEXA/lambda es una Lambda de Node.js aparte del\nmonorepo, con sus propias convenciones; no deberia lintearse con Biome.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5adac1c94a85ce86f68c854580bc625f0819e64c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/trees/5adac1c94a85ce86f68c854580bc625f0819e64c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/commits/ea43d1c85bdf35caf0b3d4ea0475a41d4f493ab9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"un