/JonathanOcampo05/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanOcampo05/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanOcampo05/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanOcampo05/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanOcampo05/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanOcampo05","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/4d8aea37a0b77ba206574d50f7dbd06332ad6dcd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T20:14:27Z","email":"20233tn116@utez.edu.mx","name":"JonathanOcampo05"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T20:14:27Z","email":"20233tn116@utez.edu.mx","name":"JonathanOcampo05"},"message":"feat(solicitudes-mf): formulario en 2 pasos y estado de documentos en el detalle\n\n- Reordena el form de creación/edición (sociedad+área, luego proveedor) y lo\n  divide en 2 pasos: datos de la solicitud y revisión de documentos requeridos\n  antes de crear.\n- El submit ya no se deshabilita antes de interactuar; valida al enviar.\n- Detalle de solicitud: nueva card \"Documentos\" con estado cargado/pendiente\n  por tipo (cruza requeridos vs. GET /documents/:contractId) y botón para ir\n  a documentos-mf con el contrato ya preseleccionado (?contractId=).\n- documentos-mf: DocumentUploadView acepta ese deep-link, y su lista de\n  documentos requeridos pasa a grid de 2 columnas ordenado por más reciente.\n- Botón \"Cancelar\" del detalle se mueve al strip de Estado/SLA.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3bf09eddd7b1b16734a3608e8651bb2999135cae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/trees/3bf09eddd7b1b16734a3608e8651bb2999135cae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/commits/4d8aea37a0b77ba206574d50f7dbd06332ad6dcd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":n