","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commit/de5e02923be6366408ad74156a741df70c2e68bc","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVextoAKGRlNWUwMjkyM2JlNjM2NjQwOGFkNzQxNTZhNzQxZGY3MGMyZTY4YmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commit/464cc69f549391a841dbd2953b806e51f9d1a00f","sha":"464cc69f549391a841dbd2953b806e51f9d1a00f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/464cc69f549391a841dbd2953b806e51f9d1a00f"}],"sha":"de5e02923be6366408ad74156a741df70c2e68bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/de5e02923be6366408ad74156a741df70c2e68bc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/464cc69f549391a841dbd2953b806e51f9d1a00f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T04:48:36Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T04:48:36Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"message":"fix(documents): address final review findings on R2 storage migration\n\nFixes 6 Important findings from the final whole-branch review before\nmerging feature/r2-document-storage:\n\n1. R2 key scoping: getStream/delete now reject any id that doesn''t\n   match this service''s own key pattern (aletheia-*), so a shared\n   bucket can''t be read/deleted by arbitrary key.\n2. Upload size limits: FileInterceptor now caps fileSize at 10MB on\n   both upload endpoints, so oversized bodies are rejected by Multer\n   before being buffered into RAM.\n3. Stream errors: files.controller.ts now attaches an ''error'' handler\n   before piping so a mid-stream failure (R2 abort, EISDIR) can''t\n   crash the gateway; disk-storage.service.ts''s resolvePath rejects\n   degenerate ('''', ''.'', ''..'') sanitized paths up front.\n4. Filename display: adaptVersion now takes the parent document''s name\n   as a fallback and uses it for display instead of deriving a\n   filename from the generated storage key in fileUrl.\n5. Silent storage fallback: storage.module.ts now logs which backend\n   is active, and warns loudly (naming the missing vars) when R2\n   config is partial/missing so a misconfigured deploy isn''t silent.\n6. Viewer auth: added fetchAuthenticatedBlob() to base-api.ts mirroring\n   baseQueryWithReauth''s refresh-and-retry-once flow for blob fetches;\n   file-viewer-modal.tsx now uses it instead of a raw fetch that dead-\n   ends on an expired access token.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"54d18354bda051e8315cceffcd150d7a76cb3474","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/trees/54d18354bda051e8315cceffcd150d7a76cb3474"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/commits/464cc69f549391a841dbd2953b806e51f9d1a00f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commit/464cc69f549391a841dbd2953b806e51f9d1a00f","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVextoAKDQ2NGNjNjlmNTQ5MzkxYTg0MWRiZDI5NTNiODA2ZTUxZjlkMWEwMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commit/78dd9ba0ce02e14a6e60e2cc0b867ffd9a91b6d7","sha":"78dd9ba0ce02e14a6e60e2cc0b867ffd9a91b6d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/78dd9ba0ce02e14a6e60e2cc0b867ffd9a91b6d7"}],"sha":"464cc69f549391a841dbd2953b806e51f9d1a00f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/464cc69f549391a841dbd2953b806e51f9d1a00f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://a