ath\n(infra/docker/compose/), so Compose''s default project-name-from-directory\nfell back to the same value (\"compose\") for both. That made them share\nthe postgres_data volume across two completely different Postgres configs\n(root''s aletheia_postgres vs clm-system''s clm_postgres), silently reusing\nwhichever one initialized the volume first. Naming each project explicitly\ngives them distinct volumes going forward.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2544c553bd8b6b951bfc0740c9176acb88427ba0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/trees/2544c553bd8b6b951bfc0740c9176acb88427ba0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/commits/7c3704a92f7037aa53cd3b7564b2c75a72291a20","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120062171?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Isaacjbar","id":120062171,"login":"Isaacjbar","node_id":"U_kgDOBygA2w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isaacjbar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commit/7c3704a92f7037aa53cd3b7564b2c75a72291a20","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVextoAKDdjMzcwNGE5MmY3MDM3YWE1M2NkM2I3NTY0YjJjNzVhNzIyOTFhMjA","