committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T06:02:23Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"message":"docs: add session changelog for main consolidation and templates flow\n\nCovers today''s work: diagnosing the 4 Abogado-testing bugs, unifying main\nonto the microservices architecture, designing and shipping the templates\n<-> review-flow connection via subagent-driven-development, fixing the\nAPPROVAL_PENDING -> SIGNING dead end, and the dev-environment issues found\nwhile trying to verify it live (stale worktree, missing .env/prisma\ngenerate, Windows memory pressure) — verification deferred to tomorrow\nafter a machine restart, before opening the PR to the team.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3439c6cdb3800e1beed04d5e96dbc4f023889fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/trees/a3439c6cdb3800e1beed04d5e96dbc4f023889fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/commits/a0d1aaeea8e0fd2e0499d88c50f782acf9fd7e54","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commit/a0d1aaeea8e0fd2e0499d88c50f782acf9fd7e54","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVextoAKGEwZDFhYWVlYThlMGZkMmUwNDk5ZDg4YzUwZjc4MmFjZjlmZDdlNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commit/5a45f9c6e9b58a208dd587e81eccdc0bcd24f306","sha":"5a45f9c6e9b58a208dd587e81eccdc0bcd24f306","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/5a45f9c6e9b58a208dd587e81eccdc0bcd24f306"}],"sha":"a0d1aaeea8e0fd2e0499d88c50f782acf9fd7e54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/a0d1aaeea8e0fd2e0499d88c50f782acf9fd7e54"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/5a45f9c6e9b58a208dd587e81eccdc0bcd24f306/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T05:21:13Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T05:21:13Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"message":"fix(workflow): let the Aprobador drive APPROVAL_PENDING -> SIGNING\n\nThe state machine gated that transition behind CONTRACT_SIGN (only\nFirmante holds it), but /firmas only lists contracts already in SIGNING —\nnobody could ever move a contract past APPROVAL_PENDING. The UI already\nhad a distinct label for this (\"Aprobar y enviar a firma\"), which matches\ntreating it as the Aprobador''s own second action, not Firmante''s.\n\n- contract-state-machine.ts: APPROVAL_PENDING''s APPROVE now requires\n  CONTRACT_APPROVE (Aprobador already holds it); LAWYER_REVIEW''s APPROVE\n  now notifies APROBADOR instead of FIRMANTE, since it''s the Aprobador who\n  needs to come back and act on APPROVAL_PENDING, not Firmante.\n- workflow-rules.ts: ROLE_QUEUE.APROBADOR gains APPROVAL_PENDING back.\n- Adding APPROVAL_PENDING to a review queue exposed a second latent bug:\n  ReviewContractCard always rendered \"Devolver\" and gated \"Rechazar\" on\n  status === APPROVAL_PENDING, but neither RETURN nor REJECT exist for\n  that status in the state machine (only for LAWYER_REVIEW) — both\n  buttons would have thrown on click. Added canReturn() and fixed\n  canDefinitiveReject() to key off LAWYER_REVIEW instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1c5e0239e1d0a7b69bf9eb32621b64a0a4d312ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/trees/1c5e0239e1d0a7b69bf9eb32621b64a0a4d312ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/commits/5a45f9c6e9b58a208dd587e81eccdc0bcd24f306","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commit/5a45f9c6e9b58a208dd587e81eccdc0bcd24f306","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVextoAKDVhNDVmOWM2ZTliNThhMjA4ZGQ1ODdlODFlY2NkYzBiY2QyNGYzMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commit/651ca2568968f7ac8f18117454c23bd27019c37c","sha":"651ca2568968f7ac8f18117454c23bd27019c37c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/651ca2568968f7ac8f18117454c23bd27019c37c"}],"sha":"5a45f9c6e9b58a208dd587e81eccdc0bcd24f306","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/5a45f9c6e9b58a208dd587e81eccdc0bcd24f306"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/651ca2568968f7ac8f18117454c23bd27019c37c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T04:49:56Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T04:49:56Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"message":"docs: update QA manual for the main consolidation and templates fix\n\nSection 0 now points at main instead of the unmerged feat/clm-integration\nbranch. Sections 5/6/8 had Abogado and Aprobador''s queues swapped (a\nleftover of the ROLE_QUEUE bug fixed earlier this session) — corrected to\nADMIN_REVIEW/LAWYER_REVIEW respectively, with the document-required-to-\napprove step and the document preview now visible to Aprobador/Firmante.\nAdded the newly-identified APPROVAL_PENDING -> SIGNING dead end (no role\nhas a screen for it yet) to the known-gaps table and the E2E walkthrough,\nso testers don''t mistake it for a new regression.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"77b4bf719cd852922f3265190de10597f8bf528c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/trees/77b4bf719cd852922f3265190de10597f8bf528c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/commits/651ca2568968f7ac8f18117454c23bd27019c37c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commit/651ca2568968f7ac8f18117454c23bd27019c37c","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVextoAKDY1MWNhMjU2ODk2OGY3YWM4ZjE4MTE3NDU0YzIzYmQyNzAxOWMzN2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commit/5bc4571d964901605f9f191de97ba848000adaef","sha":"5bc4571d964901605f9f191de97ba848000adaef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/5bc4571d964901605f9f191de97ba848000adaef"}],"sha":"651ca2568968f7ac8f18117454c23bd27019c37c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/651ca2568968f7ac8f18117454c23bd27019c37c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/5bc4571d964901605f9f191de97ba848000adaef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T04:36:11Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T04:36:11Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"message":"fix(firmas-mf): skip document query until contract is loaded and SIGNING\n\nuseGetContractDocumentQuery ran even before the contract had loaded and\neven when contract.status !== ''SIGNING'', firing an unnecessary request on\nevery visit to the signature canvas regardless of stage. Skips the query\nuntil the contract is loaded and in SIGNING.\n\nAlso deletes the local normalizePageSetup copy in favor of the shared one\nnow exported from @aletheia/frontend-commons (folds in unstaged biome\nformatting from the pre-commit hook on this file — see fix report).","tree":{"sha":"fde0f9f9e0daa44ecc3fe8eff1b673f2948b9469","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/trees/fde0f9f9e0daa44ecc3fe8eff1b673f2948b9469"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/commits/5bc4571d964901605f9f191de97ba848000adaef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commit/5bc4571d964901605f9f191de97ba848000adaef","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVextoAKDViYzQ1NzFkOTY0OTAxNjA1ZjlmMTkxZGU5N2JhODQ4MDAwYWRhZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commit/7413a3389952185191474e396b6576b21368cdc4","sha":"7413a3389952185191474e396b6576b21368cdc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/7413a3389952185191474e396b6576b21368cdc4"}],"sha":"5bc4571d964901605f9f191de97ba848000adaef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/5bc4571d964901605f9f191de97ba848000adaef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/7413a3389952185191474e396b6576b21368cdc4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T04:35:59Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T04:35:59Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"message":"fix(flujo-mf): scope document preview to the Aprobador''s card only\n\nReviewContractCard ran useGetContractDocumentQuery unconditionally for\nevery review role''s card, including Administrador''s and Abogado''s own\nqueues, causing extra requests and a confusing \"El Abogado aún no elabora\nel documento formal\" badge on stages where no document is expected yet.\nOnly the Aprobador should see the integrated preview per the design.\nSkips the query and the whole preview block unless role === ''APROBADOR''.\n\nAlso, while touching this block:\n- Renames the destructured `document` to `contractDocument` — it was\n  shadowing the DOM global, and now matches what firmas-mf already calls\n  the equivalent variable.\n- Unifies the preview max-height with firmas-mf''s SignatureCanvasView\n  (max-h-64 -> max-h-80, more generous for reading a legal document).\n- Deletes the local normalizePageSetup copy in favor of the shared one now\n  exported from @aletheia/frontend-commons.","tree":{"sha":"c675565a3530df4a42a603c9fa1cb7df794eb3eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/trees/c675565a3530df4a42a603c9fa1cb7df794eb3eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/commits/7413a3389952185191474e396b6576b21368cdc4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commit/7413a3389952185191474e396b6576b21368cdc4","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVextoAKDc0MTNhMzM4OTk1MjE4NTE5MTQ3NGUzOTZiNjU3NmIyMTM2OGNkYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commit/30cd4ff789c7babb3aa0e9d9f95abb5a011832a8","sha":"30cd4ff789c7babb3aa0e9d9f95abb5a011832a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/30cd4ff789c7babb3aa0e9d9f95abb5a011832a8"}],"sha":"7413a3389952185191474e396b6576b21368cdc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/7413a3389952185191474e396b6576b21368cdc4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/30cd4ff789c7babb3aa0e9d9f95abb5a011832a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T04:35:44Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T04:35:44Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"message":"fix(contratos-mf): correct stage filter, surface save errors, fix access-gate flash and entry gating\n\n- Critical: the contract picker in \"Elaborar documento\" filtered on\n  LAWYER_REVIEW, disjoint from the Abogado''s own ADMIN_REVIEW review queue\n  — he could never elaborate a document for a contract he was actually\n  reviewing. Filter on ADMIN_REVIEW instead (matches the backend fix).\n- handleSave''s catch block always showed a generic toast regardless of why\n  the save failed. Now policy failures (wrong role, wrong stage) surface\n  the backend''s actual message instead of a one-size-fits-all string.\n- The `role === ''ABOGADO''` access gate rendered NoAccess during the brief\n  window before useRole() reads the aletheia_role cookie (role is null,\n  ready is false), flashing a denial to Abogado users. Gate behind `ready`.\n- The \"Elaborar documento\" entry card on ContratosView had no privilege\n  guard, unlike its sibling cards, so every non-Abogado role could click\n  through to a NoAccess page instead of not seeing the option. Wrapped it\n  in the same CookiePrivilegeGuard(TEMPLATES_MANAGE) pattern its siblings\n  use. Note: TEMPLATES_MANAGE is also held by Administrador (seed matrix),\n  and PrivilegeGuard only accepts a single Privilege — there is no\n  role-exact guard mechanism at this layer, so Administrador will still\n  pass this gate and land on ContractEditorView''s own role===''ABOGADO''\n  check. Flagged in the fix report rather than inventing a new mechanism.\n- Deletes the local normalizePageSetup copy in favor of the shared one now\n  exported from @aletheia/frontend-commons.","tree":{"sha":"e082051c5290e2f7e4d008a3f0ff65b6dbeef476","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/trees/e082051c5290e2f7e4d008a3f0ff65b6dbeef476"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/commits/30cd4ff789c7babb3aa0e9d9f95abb5a011832a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commit/30cd4ff789c7babb3aa0e9d9f95abb5a011832a8","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVextoAKDMwY2Q0ZmY3ODljN2JhYmIzYWEwZTlkOWY5NWFiYjVhMDExODMyYTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commit/f112e28c092eef5005d76247c45e006392dc8ca3","sha":"f112e28c092eef5005d76247c45e006392dc8ca3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/f112e28c092eef5005d76247c45e006392dc8ca3"}],"sha":"30cd4ff789c7babb3aa0e9d9f95abb5a011832a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/30cd4ff789c7babb3aa0e9d9f95abb5a011832a8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/f112e28c092eef5005d76247c45e006392dc8ca3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T04:35:27Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T04:35:27Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"message":"fix(workflow): require the document before ADMIN_REVIEW leaves, not LAWYER_REVIEW\n\nSame critical cross-cutting bug as the previous contracts commit: approve()\nchecked workflow.status === ''LAWYER_REVIEW'' to decide whether to require a\nsaved document, but that''s the Aprobador''s stage. The Abogado''s approve()\n(ADMIN_REVIEW -> LAWYER_REVIEW) was completely ungated, while the\nAprobador''s approve() (LAWYER_REVIEW -> APPROVAL_PENDING) was hit by a\ncheck he had no way to satisfy (PUT :id/document is Abogado-only).\n\nAlso types the workflow RPC result instead of leaving it an implicit `any`,\nso a future shape change in workflow-service''s response fails to compile\nhere instead of silently disabling the gate.","tree":{"sha":"03673dd0b8911405acecb9f4e0218f685ab3c9f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/trees/03673dd0b8911405acecb9f4e0218f685ab3c9f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/commits/f112e28c092eef5005d76247c45e006392dc8ca3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commit/f112e28c092eef5005d76247c45e006392dc8ca3","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVextoAKGYxMTJlMjhjMDkyZWVmNTAwNWQ3NjI0N2M0NWUwMDYzOTJkYzhjYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commit/5a3248b177cdbeabc66f0695788ed9b9c5990703","sha":"5a3248b177cdbeabc66f0695788ed9b9c5990703","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/5a3248b177cdbeabc66f0695788ed9b9c5990703"}],"sha":"f112e28c092eef5005d76247c45e006392dc8ca3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/f112e28c092eef5005d76247c45e006392dc8ca3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/5a3248b177cdbeabc66f0695788ed9b9c5990703/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T04:35:15Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T04:35:15Z","email":"20233tn149@utez.edu.mx","name":"Erick Garcia"},"message":"fix(contracts): gate document elaboration to ADMIN_REVIEW, not LAWYER_REVIEW\n\nCritical bug from the final whole-branch review: the Abogado acts on a\ncontract while it is in ADMIN_REVIEW (his approval is what produces\nLAWYER_REVIEW, which is the Aprobador''s stage per\ncontract-state-machine.ts and workflow-rules.ts''s ROLE_QUEUE). saveDocument\nwas gating on LAWYER_REVIEW, so the Abogado could never elaborate a\ndocument for a contract he was actually reviewing.\n\nAlso types the workflow RPC result instead of leaving it an implicit `any`,\nand builds the rejection message via the shared contractStatusLabel helper\ninstead of a hardcoded stage name.\n\nCorrects the same LAWYER_REVIEW/ADMIN_REVIEW confusion in the source design\ndoc, which was internally self-contradictory (called LAWYER_REVIEW both the\nAbogado''s own stage and the Aprobador''s queue).\n\nCompanion fixes to the workflow approve() gate and the contratos-mf picker\nfilter (same root cause) land in the next two commits.","tree":{"sha":"8c2edbe5176c4d4e920e0715f81a8afeeb9a82b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/trees/8c2edbe5176c4d4e920e0715f81a8afeeb9a82b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/git/commits/5a3248b177cdbeabc66f0695788ed9b9c5990703","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commit/5a3248b177cdbeabc66f0695788ed9b9c5990703","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVextoAKDVhMzI0OGIxNzdjZGJlYWJjNjZmMDY5NTc4OGVkOWI5YzU5OTA3MDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commit/31eb9b3e1e2b4192b2f30f76f531711849871d0e","sha":"31eb9b3e1e2b4192b2f30f76f531711849871d0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/31eb9b3e1e2b4192b2f30f76f531711849871d0e"}],"sha":"5a3248b177cdbeabc66f0695788ed9b9c5990703","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ErickGS28/ALETHEIA/commits/5a3248b177cdbeabc66f0695788ed9b9c5990703"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168589894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErickGarcia28","id":168589894,"login":"ErickGarcia28","node_id":"U_kgDOCgx6Rg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErickGarcia28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.git