verflow-y: auto greift – das Element wuchs unbegrenzt statt zu scrollen.\n\nFixes:\n- body auf height: 100vh (statt nur min-height) damit Flex eine feste Basis hat\n- #editor-panel und #preview-panel: min-height: 0 + flex: 1 1 0%\n  sodass overflow-y: auto korrekt wirkt\n- Explizites height: calc(100vh - 3rem) entfernt (jetzt durch Flex gehandhabt)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"e1c844de47f3ab8dd90cb541585010e4854f2488","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mwaldheim/tailwind-cv/git/trees/e1c844de47f3ab8dd90cb541585010e4854f2488"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mwaldheim/tailwind-cv/git/commits/d931b204b2d88668d155c3429f82b77e80049ece","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31657644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwaldheim/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwaldheim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwaldheim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwaldheim/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mwaldheim","id":31657644,"login":"mwaldheim","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNjU3NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwaldheim/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwaldheim/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwaldheim/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwaldheim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwaldheim/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwaldheim","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mwaldheim/tailwind-cv/commit/d931b204b2d88668d155c3429f82b77e80049ece","node_id":"C_kwDOSuVoA9oAKGQ5MzFiMjA0YjJkODg2NjhkMTU1YzM0MjlmODJiNzdlODAwNDllY2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mwaldheim/tailwind-cv/commit/98216b1dc8ef8307c6b5d8cf5166165a6b63d888","sha":"98216b1dc8ef8307c6b5d8cf5166165a6b63d888","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mwaldheim/tailwind-cv/commits/98216b1dc8ef8307c6b5d8cf5166165a6b63d888"}],"sha":"d931b204b2d88668d155c3429f82b77e80049ece","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mwaldheim/tailwind-cv/commits/d931b204b2d88668d155c3429f82b77e80049ece"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31657644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwaldheim/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwaldheim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwaldheim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwaldheim/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mwaldheim","id":31657644,"login":"mwaldheim","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNjU3NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwaldheim/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwaldheim/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwaldheim/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwaldheim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwaldheim/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwaldheim","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mwaldheim/tailwind-cv/commits/98216b1dc8ef8307c6b5d8cf5166165a6b63d888/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T17:13:43Z","email":"mawa@if.de","name":"Markus Waldheim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T17:13:43Z","email":"mawa@if.de","name":"Markus Waldheim"},"message":"Mobile UI: Füge Editor/Vorschau-Toggle für kleine Bildschirme hinzu\n\n- Füge eine fixe Toggle-Leiste am oberen Rand für Mobilgeräte hinzu (xl:hidden),\n  die zwischen dem Editor-Panel und der CV-Vorschau wechselt\n- Setze ids auf aside (#editor-panel) und main (#preview-panel)\n- Auf Mobilgeräten (< 1280px) ist immer