r}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obryko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obryko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/commits/9f9d370c22f9c1ed0fadd13ed4cc6173303afe69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T09:54:14Z","email":"kacperobrycki@gmail.com","name":"Kacper Obrycki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T09:54:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: template polish — users CRUD example, seed script, rename script, Codecov (#134)\n\n* feat(api): add DATABASE_URL to env schema\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(contracts): add UserSchema and UserListSchema\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(api): add DatabaseModule with Drizzle provider\n\n* feat(api): add UsersService with Drizzle queries\n\nTDD: unit tests mock DB_TOKEN provider; rstest config provides DATABASE_URL\nso database.module.ts side-effects don''t block test runs. Add drizzle-orm\nas direct dep for eq() import.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(api): add UsersController with GET /users and GET /users/:id\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(api): register UsersModule and DatabaseModule in AppModule\n\n* feat(web): add /users route with client-side fetch and Playwright test\n\nAdds a /users page that fetches and renders user cards via useEffect\n(client-side only, so Playwright route mocks can intercept the fetch).\nIncludes e2e test with mocked API response validating card rendering.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(web): add link to /users from home page\n\n* feat(db): add db:seed script with example users\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: add rename.sh script for one-command project rename\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: add Codecov coverage upload to test job\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(db): generate initial users migration\n\n* fix: address PR review feedback\n\n- CI: pin codecov-action to a valid v5 SHA (previous SHA didn''t exist)\n- CI: include @monorepo-template/ui in build:internal (TS2307 in apps/web)\n- migration: enable pgcrypto extension for gen_random_uuid()\n- seed: wrap insert in try/finally to always close DB client\n- users.service: add limit(1) to findOne (PK lookup); update mock chain\n- rename.sh: cd to repo root; validate scope/app-name against npm-naming regex; include .env.example and Dockerfile in find pattern\n- README/CLAUDE.md: replace YOUR_GITHUB_ORG placeholder; document actual file types renamed and remaining manual steps\n\n* fix(api): add DATABASE_URL to rstest e2e env config\n\n* fix: address PR review and Sonar feedback\n\n- DatabaseModule: implement OnApplicationShutdown to close DB client; enable shutdown hooks in main.ts\n- UsersController: validate :id param with ParseUUIDPipe (400 instead of 500 on non-UUID)\n- seed.ts: report actual rows inserted via .returning() (no longer always says \"Seeded 3\")\n- users.tsx: validate API response with UserListSchema\n- rename.sh: redirect error/usage messages to stderr (Sonar shelldre:S7677, lines 27 + 31)\n- ci.yml: include lcov for packages/db, packages/sentry, packages/ui in Codecov upload\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c85db0248edef654bbd6f57143301abbd4fdeff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/git/trees/4c85db0248edef654bbd6f57143301abbd4fdeff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/git/commits/9f9d370c22f9c1ed0fadd13ed4cc6173303afe69","verification":{"payload":"tree 4c85db0248edef654bbd6f57143301abbd4fdeff\nparent 22959b477f4028fc3a4a70bd52feed2b6541bd2d\nauthor Kacper Obrycki <kacperobrycki@gmail.com> 1781