: wrap insert in try/finally to always close DB client\n- users.service: add limit(1) to findOne (PK lookup); update mock chain\n- rename.sh: cd to repo root; validate scope/app-name against npm-naming regex; include .env.example and Dockerfile in find pattern\n- README/CLAUDE.md: replace YOUR_GITHUB_ORG placeholder; document actual file types renamed and remaining manual steps\n\n* fix(api): add DATABASE_URL to rstest e2e env config\n\n* fix: address PR review and Sonar feedback\n\n- DatabaseModule: implement OnApplicationShutdown to close DB client; enable shutdown hooks in main.ts\n- UsersController: validate :id param with ParseUUIDPipe (400 instead of 500 on non-UUID)\n- seed.ts: report actual rows inserted via .returning() (no longer always says \"Seeded 3\")\n- users.tsx: validate API response with UserListSchema\n- rename.sh: redirect error/usage messages to stderr (Sonar shelldre:S7677, lines 27 + 31)\n- ci.yml: include lcov for packages/db, packages/sentry, packages/ui in Codecov upload\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKoXGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAlMQAKJ6TMFb/FoDvXBMvCi20/lT\nUEx+ViyIUaCQCx482+YA7wwP3/yx74LctPKnJPWqC+i5yC3PW1YSno4MZd9E6+sy\nBo3vsQBdWISTpUIgPo5BmmHbda17BNtin/opYGTA5woV6T88xli4K17yUTQeMPJe\ndoj4xUgvakFlUbuMSJhIcWYLahY1lrHUmbsP15SeYlvzHeYR4L1u0LETf1FclvQm\n3YUNf+7GxAu8UgNBQ+2hbfRN89wCZddYDcJRHn8ebd1Ct2m2zWZhHaOTfCDpuhxu\nQmWUbLIvgypaUnpLlKngN8bqwxBapj6C80AdH3lhqmWeoIEtLOVPfqaN9ZKMv6WY\n7+uU0JVIfQqE23HtG/YiRmMsYwue+DIo4xJgV/jOwSx0fFpk7Mi5VxwbkcaYEeE4\nylGzl6hrhNPZfkLh6eh06z5RsbaEF7t4A62cBoz+Winx/7R/1hk1KsRX7WUOD9BT\nY8Wo/yH03jKx2TwaHVJqeTusgZIVd9Mmw7vRQ/zfPcCpmeM3hvkNxbj2LXVn/pxl\nJuC17ihELfkkEyZQV2EjeMMUYdNaa4FwMFRfiQXKqX2WlQhCEw4zE1bCPn2UdebA\nfSSfjYsW4lkNEbf0Ce7p6AUp3EoFcIYiCN/XPdqLrhkUi0I/8x1MwurM2jWm16gv\n7UveuhY2f0jLLssoZUSQ\n=FfMo\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-11T09:54:14Z"}},"committe