yko","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzc3NjU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obryko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obryko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obryko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obryko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obryko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obryko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/commits/22959b477f4028fc3a4a70bd52feed2b6541bd2d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T13:05:45Z","email":"kacperobrycki@gmail.com","name":"Kacper Obrycki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T13:05:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add DevContainer and TestContainers integration tests (#130)\n\n* chore: update .gitignore to exclude docs/superpowers/\n\n* fix(web): rename VITE_ env prefix to PUBLIC_ for Rsbuild\n\nRsbuild exposes PUBLIC_-prefixed env vars to the browser (not VITE_).\nAdd pnpm dev script to start all services together for MF remote to work.\n\n* fix(web): add eager:true to MF shared React to fix loadShareSync error\n\n* feat: add DevContainer and TestContainers integration tests\n\n- .devcontainer/devcontainer.json: Node 24 + Docker-in-Docker (required for TestContainers), auto-start postgres, forward ports, Biome extension\n- packages/db: add @testcontainers/postgresql, rstest.integration.config.ts, users.integration.test.ts demonstrating real-postgres insert/query/constraint tests\n- root: add pnpm test:integration script\n- pnpm-workspace.yaml: set cpu-features/ssh2 allowBuilds to false (testcontainers transitive deps)\n\n* ci: add integration tests job (TestContainers, Docker pre-installed on ubuntu runners)\n\n* fix(db): exclude integration tests from default test config\n\n* fix: address PR review feedback\n\n- DevContainer: drop ESLint extension (Biome-only), use corepack default pnpm (pinned via packageManager), use cp -n to preserve existing .env files\n- packages/db: remove redundant testcontainers dep (@testcontainers/postgresql brings it transitively)\n- Integration test: add CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS pgcrypto for older Postgres; close db client in afterAll to prevent runner hangs\n\n* test(db): make integration tests order-independent (afterEach cleanup, self-contained inserts)","tree":{"sha":"145d5b40fc44d8a95242349691cd2d191af9ee05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/git/trees/145d5b40fc44d8a95242349691cd2d191af9ee05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/git/commits/22959b477f4028fc3a4a70bd52feed2b6541bd2d","verification":{"payload":"tree 145d5b40fc44d8a95242349691cd2d191af9ee05\nparent d93fbcc7f003c9becdefe56c38a8cb7202ca718c\nauthor Kacper Obrycki <kacperobrycki@gmail.com> 1781096745 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781096745 +0000\n\nfeat: add DevContainer and TestContainers integration tests (#130)\n\n* chore: update .gitignore to exclude docs/superpowers/\n\n* fix(web): rename VITE_ env prefix to PUBLIC_ for Rsbuild\n\nRsbuild exposes PUBLIC_-prefixed env vars to the browser (not VITE_).\nAdd pnpm dev script to start all services together for MF remote to work.\n\n* fix(web): add eager:true to MF shared React to fix loadShareSync error\n\n* feat: add DevContainer and TestContainers integration tests\n\n- .devcontainer/devcontainer.json: Node 24 + Docker-in-Docker (required for TestContainers), auto-start postgres, forward ports, Biome extension\n- packages/db: add @testcontainers/postgresql, rstest.integration.config.ts, users.integration.test.ts demonstrating real-postgres insert/query/constraint tests\n- root: add pnpm test:integration script\n- pnpm-workspace.yaml: set cpu-features/ssh2 allowBuilds to false (testcontainers transitive deps)\n\n* ci: add integration tests job (TestContainers, Docker pre-installed on ubunt