xOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Obryko/monorepo-template/commit/8e9183e147f64ef54af9e0b92e658788bbfcd179","sha":"8e9183e147f64ef54af9e0b92e658788bbfcd179","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/commits/8e9183e147f64ef54af9e0b92e658788bbfcd179"}],"sha":"d93fbcc7f003c9becdefe56c38a8cb7202ca718c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/commits/d93fbcc7f003c9becdefe56c38a8cb7202ca718c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20777657?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obryko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obryko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obryko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obryko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Obryko","id":20777657,"login":"Obryko","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzc3NjU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obryko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obryko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obryko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obryko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obryko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Obryko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/commits/8e9183e147f64ef54af9e0b92e658788bbfcd179/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T14:46:28Z","email":"kacperobrycki@gmail.com","name":"Kacper Obrycki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T14:46:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: template improvements phase 2 (#124)\n\n* chore: update .gitignore to exclude docs/superpowers/\n\n* fix(web): rename VITE_ env prefix to PUBLIC_ for Rsbuild\n\nRsbuild exposes PUBLIC_-prefixed env vars to the browser (not VITE_).\nAdd pnpm dev script to start all services together for MF remote to work.\n\n* fix(web): add eager:true to MF shared React to fix loadShareSync error\n\n* chore(web): gitignore @mf-types/; update README and CLAUDE.md docs\n\n* feat(db): add users table example schema\n\nAdded a canonical users table with id, email, name, and timestamp columns to provide a concrete example for projects extending the schema. Includes tests verifying the table exports and expected columns.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(web): add E2E tests for MF remote component and error boundary\n\n* chore: unignore .claude/commands/\n\n* chore: add new-route and new-module slash commands\n\n* feat(sentry): add optional error tracking package with NestJS filter and React client\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: wire Sentry into api, web, and remote apps\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(ui): add Storybook 8 with Button, Card, Input, Badge stories\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review and Web E2E CI failure\n\n- DB schema: drop AnyPgTable annotation (preserve column types); add $onUpdate to updatedAt\n- DB tests: use Drizzle public API (getTableName, getTableColumns); cover updatedAt + unique\n- Sentry filter: support Fastify .send fallback to .json; rethrow on non-HTTP contexts; log msg+stack\n- Sentry config: globals:false, drop strictPropertyInitialization override\n- Playwright: start remote on :3002 alongside web in webServer array\n- E2E: scope route intercept to remote host:port (don''t match shell''s remoteEntry.js)\n- Web root: guard initClientSentry behind typeof window check (SSR safety)\n- UI catalog: move Storybook + Vite deps to pnpm catalog\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"837c2dd350ca1b85e966f1c0ef503703b7ee89ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/git/trees/837c2dd350ca1b85e966f1