ventHandler,\ngetRequestHeaders, setResponseHeader). Adds workspace overrides to\nforce all transitive installs to patched versions.\n\nCloses GHSA-22cc-p3c6-wpvm\nCloses GHSA-3vj8-jmxq-cgj5\nCloses GHSA-wr4h-v87w-p3r7\nCloses GHSA-4hxc-9384-m385\nCloses GHSA-2j6q-whv2-gh6w\nCloses GHSA-q5pr-72pq-83v3\nCloses GHSA-p36q-q72m-gchr\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: cap h3 and srvx override upper bounds\n\nReviewer flagged unbounded \">=…\" ranges; pin h3 to <3.0.0 and srvx to\n<1.0.0 to keep within the currently validated major.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: tighten override upper bounds to exclude next-major pre-releases\n\n* fix: move h3 to pnpm catalog\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"496ba794a8bee20f381b9e7c5b4beb1244a4209b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/git/trees/496ba794a8bee20f381b9e7c5b4beb1244a4209b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/git/commits/1413f58fad1a9ce5b185665d41daf9d39182df81","verification":{"payload":"tree 496ba794a8bee20f381b9e7c5b4beb1244a4209b\nparent 5ad7a4e0e5f38d136f887abeb2954d0969fba88a\nauthor Kacper Obrycki <kacperobrycki@gmail.com> 1780974467 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780974467 +0200\n\nfix(security): bump h3 >=2.0.1-rc.18 and srvx >=0.11.13 (#84)\n\n* fix(security): bump h3 >=2.0.1-rc.18 and srvx >=0.11.13 via overrides\n\nh3 2.x RC <rc.15 has path traversal, SSE injection, and middleware\nbypass vulns. srvx <0.11.13 has middleware bypass via absolute URI.\nBoth are transitive through nitro-nightly and @tanstack/start-server-core.\n\nBumps apps/web direct h3 dep to ^2.0.1-rc.18 (server middleware uses\nonly stable APIs present in both 1.x and 2.x: defineEventHandler,\ngetRequestHeaders, setResponseHeader). Adds workspace overrides to\nforce all transitive installs to patched versions.\n\nCloses GHSA-22cc-p3c6-wpvm\nCloses GHSA-3vj8-jmxq-cgj5\nCloses GHSA-wr4h-v87w-p3r7\nCloses GHSA-4hxc-9384-m385\nCloses GHSA-2j6q-whv2-gh6w\nCloses GHSA-q5pr-72pq-83v3\nCloses GHSA-p36q-q72m-gchr\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: cap h3 and srvx override upper bounds\n\nReviewer flagged unbounded \">=…\" ranges; pin h3 to <3.0.0 and srvx to\n<1.0.0 to keep within the currently validated major.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: tighten override upper bounds to exclude next-major pre-releases\n\n* fix: move h3 to pnpm catalog\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqJ4ODCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAH3sQAKkwh3dEA+V6tN5EIH03D6y4\nOR2cTFMTaGCRlFszoDU3I1BP2hEq49HuD2xSpoB4CPuViTflULeOvFQ+yMGI4aY5\nLMl2m9lVBlt/S8Jbulhwa70TKrdyAQ4cl7+5sUA65xWDZEuH0MoFmR7qjnMCkEmM\nDTsPPjfK4UUyVFQANqyazy9+mPaK8uUujWGAhpiKFwOhNP1gMw2JePu7TP+cYiO0\nSy9wu9egwnzt5Q3F631xM0eIIDDldzgeRVgRDMBCUWnKBugRNet7pdZVAYVNwE2L\nooTJgUmL059CoGoTogpWIYEKuj2H1YmlWY7/HjFIFwS036ejvNnyfbvzT5dMP5dd\nPshrQMBUJJrmp7RcAjKzS0xaa6wEEHPQbvUjmQ5T0oOBYlRtjRc0LFSU9snp0DwR\n9fpVPlzgpWLOWfACsoHpp1YmEzDpxU6L44VIKd+S1ww2DmjXEW+CIsQFkui4cc5u\nPhpaVmNN8Jl6FPEbWHAU8T5wYjqKbQxcyLwE6gcGqWTpFPpfMNTVboaV4l/Eu6Ib\nYbp5WdiTtuDWbBO2AOS1BEDOrLRJg3UHVrtwshAN6h4vOy5Yafqte2rvpe3oEnwO\nUP9W1vMo6Kx8I9Ge7pVlUHoJm2xhJ2W4eds2XdXd/woC8XzGrVtCd1KhUI3voOlP\nhIjKgGdGlP+G0jC6yTPE\n=kivT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-09T03:07:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ