cd41fec8442c6a27e3101813441e678f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T08:27:01Z","email":"kacperobrycki@gmail.com","name":"Kacper Obrycki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T08:27:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(security): bump protobufjs >=8.2.0 via pnpm workspace override (#82)\n\n* fix(security): bump protobufjs to >=8.2.0 via pnpm override\n\nAddresses 8 Dependabot alerts (7.x is vulnerable to DoS, code injection,\nand prototype pollution). Using a workspace override because protobufjs\nis a transitive dep of @grpc/proto-loader.\n\nCloses GHSA-jggg-4jg4-v7c6\nCloses GHSA-2pr8-phx7-x9h3\nCloses GHSA-66ff-xgx4-vchm\nCloses GHSA-fx83-v9x8-x52w\nCloses GHSA-75px-5xx7-5xc7\nCloses GHSA-jvwf-75h9-cwgg\nCloses GHSA-685m-2w69-288q\nCloses GHSA-q6x5-8v7m-xcrf\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: cap protobufjs override upper bound to <9.0.0\n\nReviewer flagged unbounded \">=8.2.0\" range as risking future-major\nbreakage during lockfile refresh.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c1bd6a90da7857f01866e01f2e13452b94dc502b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/git/trees/c1bd6a90da7857f01866e01f2e13452b94dc502b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/git/commits/27e7042cd41fec8442c6a27e3101813441e678f2","verification":{"payload":"tree c1bd6a90da7857f01866e01f2e13452b94dc502b\nparent 88b455f88cf1b8e56bcbcdb80ff21808ea0ef1d5\nauthor Kacper Obrycki <kacperobrycki@gmail.com> 1780734421 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780734421 +0000\n\nfix(security): bump protobufjs >=8.2.0 via pnpm workspace override (#82)\n\n* fix(security): bump protobufjs to >=8.2.0 via pnpm override\n\nAddresses 8 Dependabot alerts (7.x is vulnerable to DoS, code injection,\nand prototype pollution). Using a workspace override because protobufjs\nis a transitive dep of @grpc/proto-loader.\n\nCloses GHSA-jggg-4jg4-v7c6\nCloses GHSA-2pr8-phx7-x9h3\nCloses GHSA-66ff-xgx4-vchm\nCloses GHSA-fx83-v9x8-x52w\nCloses GHSA-75px-5xx7-5xc7\nCloses GHSA-jvwf-75h9-cwgg\nCloses GHSA-685m-2w69-288q\nCloses GHSA-q6x5-8v7m-xcrf\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: cap protobufjs override upper bound to <9.0.0\n\nReviewer flagged unbounded \">=8.2.0\" range as risking future-major\nbreakage during lockfile refresh.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqI9nVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxu4QAF92TtWHv2n3+0/+gsRA2D4n\noqHEuzcbrasNq3DhjHa4XYYyMHm7iZDqZuszlkPbwtWXaeToxeJRDOtGcjHwAVxd\nVh+nqGI5KFAYG3NnHnS42xhKRQLgAXEpezVpJaY1AZu8sc/A6KOyQnqJsmzChFKk\ni8wO6pVJugLxi7MtL64SwfCM7P1EsxG636C1g0ehEN3Pi1bdDw6t448ncJvYxyfY\nQWbYd5J13odsLvFqBdG7tuqyrWDkcBg3kWGZCg30EHEuKPz9CYImyJAAb+Ga/Z+a\n8T/o7y1W8x06lmi+jy15QQB/QDcRpi2wgSd1X8CPIG/bfaf25mMsDjN7PGO5oxzQ\np3ozR0NIn6rLM1OT8awCbrCze6CwyoTpNS7X3KCrYb9UEjWPGfALWlwQiQMj2IQ2\nWbcOd9y4cmyHYLBbynicqaOQNt2hlwIjBWNsOeDejET/q1mBcp5ZreJCk5wQn8GW\nFLhIPEKcxh5qOhzmGj8kBnk5qGl8MPcAhfXnUTPUKKfoNz2Ucym9OJOeS0pq87RD\n0gmQDTgGysybPjWea3Yl1fxLLCLdRdMp6l3LtJc7HiQzxr78PFldOB3Y9Ar39L9R\n2kdZ09fQ9yZBeteXTiQyY8sJLvlSUcF+up3eSNEz3zNGmy/VRVRP27qxNNOP9JgB\neOl/PKyWFQ3LpXDe30GN\n=KDfQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-06T08:27:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6