r_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/commits/88b455f88cf1b8e56bcbcdb80ff21808ea0ef1d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T21:05:30Z","email":"kacperobrycki@gmail.com","name":"Kacper Obrycki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T21:05:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(security): bump drizzle-kit to ^0.31.0 to address esbuild GHSA (#86)\n\ndrizzle-kit 0.30.x pulled esbuild@0.18.20 and @0.19.12 (via\n@esbuild-kit). 0.31.x ships esbuild@0.25.4 as a direct dep (patched).\n\nNote: @esbuild-kit/esm-loader (deprecated, still a drizzle-kit dep) pins\nesbuild@0.18.20 internally, but uses only the transform API — never the\nHTTP dev server that GHSA-67mh-4wv8-2f99 targets. Risk limited to\ndrizzle-kit migration tooling, not production runtime.\n\nCloses GHSA-67mh-4wv8-2f99\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9011026c63cdb5c257314e6141844fceb7a5d25a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/git/trees/9011026c63cdb5c257314e6141844fceb7a5d25a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/git/commits/88b455f88cf1b8e56bcbcdb80ff21808ea0ef1d5","verification":{"payload":"tree 9011026c63cdb5c257314e6141844fceb7a5d25a\nparent 6e3b3f74b46700d163d54c9f32396d242db1ac3e\nauthor Kacper Obrycki <kacperobrycki@gmail.com> 1780693530 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780693530 +0000\n\nfix(security): bump drizzle-kit to ^0.31.0 to address esbuild GHSA (#86)\n\ndrizzle-kit 0.30.x pulled esbuild@0.18.20 and @0.19.12 (via\n@esbuild-kit). 0.31.x ships esbuild@0.25.4 as a direct dep (patched).\n\nNote: @esbuild-kit/esm-loader (deprecated, still a drizzle-kit dep) pins\nesbuild@0.18.20 internally, but uses only the transform API — never the\nHTTP dev server that GHSA-67mh-4wv8-2f99 targets. Risk limited to\ndrizzle-kit migration tooling, not production runtime.\n\nCloses GHSA-67mh-4wv8-2f99\n\nCo-auth