n: 0.45.2\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\n\n* fix: exclude current nitro-nightly from minimum release age check\n\nCI install failed because nitro-nightly@3.0.1-20260604-184855-0a07991c\nwas published within the 24h release-age cutoff. Add it to\nminimumReleaseAgeExclude so this PR can install.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Kacper Obrycki <kacperobrycki@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c33c2e0105d39303fa6f4e2a7c775b5926ccef0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/git/trees/9c33c2e0105d39303fa6f4e2a7c775b5926ccef0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/git/commits/8de751ac0c774716e1ea20d1794ea40dc550952c","verification":{"payload":"tree 9c33c2e0105d39303fa6f4e2a7c775b5926ccef0\nparent 408435ff819df76ba7b6d919a0b16379e758663c\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1780675572 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780675572 +0000\n\nchore(deps): bump drizzle-orm from 0.44.7 to 0.45.2 (#10)\n\n* chore(deps): bump drizzle-orm from 0.44.7 to 0.45.2\n\nBumps [drizzle-orm](https://github.com/drizzle-team/drizzle-orm) from 0.44.7 to 0.45.2.\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/drizzle-team/drizzle-orm/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/drizzle-team/drizzle-orm/compare/0.44.7...0.45.2)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: drizzle-orm\n  dependency-version: 0.45.2\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\n\n* fix: exclude current nitro-nightly from minimum release age check\n\nCI install failed because nitro-nightly@3.0.1-20260604-184855-0a07991c\nwas published within the 24h release-age cutoff. Add it to\nminimumReleaseAgeExclude so this PR can install.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Kacper Obrycki <kacperobrycki@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqIvP0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARioQADQph3C7s1cdV6wnv9LvnGmI\nCwv1dUC1jFcsaacFGs0lJLDSaQoQq9Y3q2YRF23ktP01HdfX+/yfo6VQfvOqLQZO\nY32fXJXj+gT0QGqLr3afPXX+UhHuiTaSjCORzsT3C/LRTToUh07zNzS4CixqYq8u\nK41IZWnFFe3I3OLrgfmu3OItcFbQRDq1RrNPrvw497fUynmhSibGry42IV9oYam5\nEuIJcu3LCFKP3sxxdtaXnxLzAg4uEP+qxMAe16A/Pp3/IveIlHcumlyg2YqhZtCS\nQKPxiUQ7wJvqyCBvsl67NFdjHn9aRH3A/z08PcuVJbcIUEc0LIM290mxeTbrYjWp\n0hf5MjGy+W4sTfsoZkJsmec2XEPj6AHk4VI17VwkNnl5YlTWSJTUjk5X7YP57gdM\nM4xcWAF8lYLR/ssFbbHxjvirqk66/HheETm+iNVJEnF4gh2XryTjbXujyshli7w+\nAB+1fUiaU9APnj1r6AJBDX0WxcoEjx+SxGna/AU6raE57P+78BeUIaxHvvs5KN0v\nQmrlL4nWQcblWBm/0NRy88NwfclOxyfE6I7nl/mKTD2e275toCnr29vEyM1Saqba\n0V7BucLwrOyZxVYu0cwND4Q2MFXL5fsR3vRE6gQXF5CVRL/iVifbD9GPP82B4iet\nokmX5XBEU3rOvj0J2s9z\n=v1kT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-05T16:06:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"st