mits/408435ff819df76ba7b6d919a0b16379e758663c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T13:58:13Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T13:58:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): bump @opentelemetry/sdk-node from 0.57.2 to 0.217.0 (#9)\n\n* chore(deps): bump @opentelemetry/sdk-node from 0.57.2 to 0.217.0\n\nBumps [@opentelemetry/sdk-node](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js) from 0.57.2 to 0.217.0.\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js/compare/experimental/v0.57.2...experimental/v0.217.0)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: \"@opentelemetry/sdk-node\"\n  dependency-version: 0.218.0\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\n\n* fix: bump OTel exporter and auto-instrumentations to match sdk-node 0.217\n\nThe Dependabot bump of @opentelemetry/sdk-node from 0.57.2 to 0.217.0 pulls in\n@opentelemetry/sdk-trace-base@2.7.1, but @opentelemetry/exporter-trace-otlp-http\nand @opentelemetry/auto-instrumentations-node at ^0.57.0 still resolve to\nsdk-trace-base@1.30.1 — producing two incompatible ReadableSpan types and\nbreaking typecheck.\n\n- @opentelemetry/exporter-trace-otlp-http ^0.57.0 -> ^0.218.0\n- @opentelemetry/auto-instrumentations-node ^0.57.0 -> ^0.76.0\n- Regenerate pnpm-lock.yaml to clear minimumReleaseAge violation\n  (stale nitro-nightly entry)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Kacper Obrycki <kacperobrycki@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"91fd340db1f23e698ce1fd728c7382ea5a362ef8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/git/trees/91fd340db1f23e698ce1fd728c7382ea5a362ef8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/git/commits/408435ff819df76ba7b6d919a0b16379e758663c","verification":{"payload":"tree 91fd340db1f23e698ce1fd728c7382ea5a362ef8\nparent 11d5c75b65a1387022c2d5f8b6ca6020dbc3b44e\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1780667893 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780667893 +0000\n\nchore(deps): bump @opentelemetry/sdk-node from 0.57.2 to 0.217.0 (#9)\n\n* chore(deps): bump @opentelemetry/sdk-node from 0.57.2 to 0.217.0\n\nBumps [@opentelemetry/sdk-node](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js) from 0.57.2 to 0.217.0.\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js/compare/experimental/v0.57.2...experimental/v0.217.0)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: \"@opentelemetry/sdk-node\"\n  dependency-version: 0.218.0\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\n\n* fix: bump OTel exporter and auto-instrumentations to match sdk-node 0.217\n\nThe Dependabot bump of @opentelemetry/sdk-node from 0.57.2 to 0.217.0 pulls in\n@opentelemetry/sdk-trace-base@2.7.1, but @opentelemetry/exporter-trace-otlp-http\nand @opentelemetry/auto-instrumentations-node at ^0.57.0 still resolve to\nsdk-trace-base@1.30.1 — producing two incompatible ReadableSpan types and\nbreaking typecheck.\n\n- @opentelemetry/exporter-trace-otlp-http ^0.57.0 -> ^0.218.0\n- @opentelemetry/auto-instrumentations-node ^0.57.0 -> ^0.76.0\n- Regenerate pnpm-lock.yaml to clear minimumReleaseAge violation\n  (stale nitro-nightly entry)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude 