to @opentelemetry/resources 2.x API\n\n`Resource` was removed as a class in the 2.x major bump; use\n`resourceFromAttributes()` factory instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Kacper Obrycki <kacperobrycki@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c8b72904e8a6f755e08b6a91470a21176be16f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/git/trees/3c8b72904e8a6f755e08b6a91470a21176be16f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/git/commits/e9493ee73a2ecb312bafca4ee16e1af3a6dde166","verification":{"payload":"tree 3c8b72904e8a6f755e08b6a91470a21176be16f0\nparent ae2e779ef1d3145078cb755f3fb85626f026f016\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1780611239 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780611239 +0000\n\nchore(deps): bump @opentelemetry/resources from 1.30.1 to 2.7.1 (#17)\n\n* chore(deps): bump @opentelemetry/resources from 1.30.1 to 2.7.1\n\nBumps [@opentelemetry/resources](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js) from 1.30.1 to 2.7.1.\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js/compare/v1.30.1...v2.7.1)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: \"@opentelemetry/resources\"\n  dependency-version: 2.7.1\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-major\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\n\n* fix(observability): adapt to @opentelemetry/resources 2.x API\n\n`Resource` was removed as a class in the 2.x major bump; use\n`resourceFromAttributes()` factory instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude So