"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(web): migrate from Vite/Vitest to Rsbuild/Rstest (#5)\n\n* chore: commit missing packages (contracts, typescript-config, linter, env files)\n\n* feat(web): migrate from Vite to Rsbuild with Module Federation host\n\n- Replace vite.config.ts with rsbuild.config.ts using @rsbuild/core\n- Register apps/web as MF shell host via pluginModuleFederation\n  (remotes: {} — no active remotes yet; React/ReactDOM as eager singletons)\n- Replace @tailwindcss/vite with @tailwindcss/postcss via Rsbuild PostCSS\n- Replace @vitejs/plugin-react with @rsbuild/plugin-react (SWC-based)\n- Replace @rolldown/plugin-babel with @rsbuild/plugin-babel for React Compiler\n  (no SWC Wasm plugin for React Compiler exists on npm; Babel is the documented path)\n- Add @rsbuild/core/types to tsconfig to replace vite/client types\n- Update .gitignore: .vinxi/.tanstack → .rsbuild\n- Vitest and Playwright unchanged\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(web): migrate from Vitest to Rstest\n\n- Replace vitest with @rstest/core (Rspack-based test runner)\n- Rename vitest.config.ts → rstest.config.ts; path aliases inherited from rsbuild.config.ts\n- Update test/setup.ts: vitest imports → @rstest/core\n- Root catalog vitest entry unchanged (used by other packages)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review feedback\n\n- rsbuild.config.ts: ensure babel-plugin-react-compiler is registered even when babelLoaderOptions has no plugins array\n- tsconfig.web.json: drop vite/client types so the shared web base stays bundler-agnostic\n- tsconfig.libs.json: drop noEmit so declaration/declarationMap can actually emit .d.ts\n- apps/web/README.md: replace Vitest reference with Rstest to match the migrated test runner\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review and CI failures\n\n- playwright.config.ts: webServer command uses rsbuild dev (was vite dev,\n  broken after Rsbuild migration — caused Web E2E CI failure)\n- packages/linter/package.json: add files array for biome.base.json\n  (CodeRabbit nit)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6e28646a2bc9bd0553d112f9ff349d74b64b5d38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/git/trees/6e28646a2bc9bd0553d112f9ff349d74b64b5d38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Obryko/monorepo-template/git/commits/ae2e779ef1d3145078cb755f3fb85626f026f016","verification":{"payload":"tree 6e28646a2bc9bd0553d112f9ff349d74b64b5d38\nparent f68b0779cb729a230f2479c1c86114b793b7f9b2\nauthor Kacper Obrycki <kacperobrycki@gmail.com> 1780611010 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780611010 +0200\n\nfeat(web): migrate from Vite/Vitest to Rsbuild/Rstest (#5)\n\n* chore: commit missing packages (contracts, typescript-config, linter, env files)\n\n* feat(web): migrate from Vite to Rsbuild with Module Federation host\n\n- Replace vite.config.ts with rsbuild.config.ts using @rsbuild/core\n- Register apps/web as MF shell host via pluginModuleFederation\n  (remotes: {} — no active remotes yet; React/ReactDOM as eager singletons)\n- Replace @tailwindcss/vite with @tailwindcss/postcss via Rsbuild PostCSS\n- Replace @vitejs/plugin-react with @rsbuild/plugin-react (SWC-based)\n- Replace @rolldown/plugin-babel with @rsbuild/plugin-babel for React Compiler\n  (no SWC Wasm plugin for React Compiler exists on npm; Babel is the documented path)\n- Add @rsbuild/core/types to tsconfig to replace vite/client types\n- Update .gitignore: .vinxi/.tanstack → .rsbuild\n- Vitest and Playwright unchanged\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(web): migrate from Vitest to Rstest\n\n- Replace vitest with @rstest/core (Rspack-based test runner)\n- Rename vitest.config.ts → rstest.config.ts; path aliases inherited from rsbuild.config.ts\n- Update test/setup.ts: vitest imports → @rstest/core\n- Root catalog vitest entry unchanged (used by other packages)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review feedback\n\n- rsbuild.config.ts: ensure babel-plugin-react-compiler is registered even when babelLoaderOptions has no plugins array\n- tsconfig.web.json: drop vite/client types so the shared web base stays bundler-agnostic\n- tsconfig.libs.json: drop noEmit so declaration/declarationMap can actually emit .d.ts\n- apps/web/README.md: replace Vitest reference with Rstest to match the migrated test runner\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review and CI failures\n\n- playwright.config.ts: webServer command uses rsbuild dev (was vite dev,\n  broken after Rsbuild migration — caused Web E2E CI failure)\n- packages/linter/package.json: add files array for biome.base.json\n  (CodeRabbit nit)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqIffCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXNcQAAySat1x7L/Abe+FFIDsLuWk\nrv6Legu1W7v5xsW2ldtO8XPP+iz2M0c6Jdv39EK88NTvKmYX2Dbrij+twvklAnHp\nIUsiu4DN+8idHTzWFDoZCXEcRwFlTe8HnxoHxna6JNPGsml42ltpixIa0ifLQul+\ncqHeohNu/uEl/4trk+1STVsYyoOFWRRjU2RIiKRiwCG1S6ciwrphGf6Tse/ykeML\nyuLnVQrIMfU8ziktGHBJ373XhipFTU2SCTWUa/mn3J7aDppgPER8tGKk8HIIpVTg\nMAPcibckoK39nM1TMV0y0I0x5QDcuIqM4qMgiXjo44vTOY40tTtEqerTjYbZGGmF\nseDr4YxDZFHXHEycyUxqdKKCWZjP0wNsegjac4Ajsy+czq4tg1+6xPCmDCY96f3b\n8RY4BNE+v9FAys9ss2wvKPeAT7tGfaTXCe1sj26HnT8kSBdyWP1FyxHqhljhvrtO\nuq8FZj18UaUDVpQfQYJbqbaDvH3zobhnox1BO3cbPxincJYC5BhdJt60+PDnTtrG\nsId3AsIW/d5ho2E9lDbU112zUK0UrqPHaTG8V5fxKfk/MU7LjjkyRYZp4lOiJEan\nYGyBVP9ACwDL8L6KUYfaz4DLaHJ2hZATfW3k1yKcfzbRoFjfS/0WyOGqlsYIjFih\neXCnTl8kgJhFx9TJKffs\n=C2oS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-04T22:10:11Z"}},"committer":{"