rs/asmitdash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asmitdash/CVS/commits/225425dde89f90cb8b22a7540512ef87f3c6d547/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T04:08:34Z","email":"asmitdash44@gmail.com","name":"asmitdash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T04:08:34Z","email":"asmitdash44@gmail.com","name":"asmitdash"},"message":"feat(cvs): gate dealer document uploads on auditor''s retail-file import\n\nDealers can now only submit per-record documents after the auditor (or admin)\nhas uploaded the retail Excel file at least once. Locked state is surfaced\nexplicitly in the dealer UI instead of failing at upload time.\n\n- Bulk Excel /import is now auditor/admin-only on sales/RTO/claims routes;\n  successful sales import flips SetupState.steps.retailMasterUploaded.\n- New requireRetailMaster middleware blocks dealer first-lot/final-lot\n  uploads with 403 RETAIL_MASTER_MISSING when the flag is off.\n- New GET /api/setup/upload-gate exposes just the boolean for any\n  authenticated user (so the dealer UI can read it without leaking full\n  setup state).\n- New DealerUploadDataPage replaces the auditor-style table for the\n  /dealer/upload-data route — per-record drag-and-drop upload widgets that\n  render a \"Locked — awaiting auditor\" cell until the gate is open.\n- Auditor''s UploadDataPage shows a status hint (\"Dealer uploads enabled\" /\n  \"locked until you import the retail file\") so they know what their action\n  unblocks downstream.","tree":{"sha":"4060e861e9f91adc5b053047ebc069b72a9e5d14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asmitdash/CVS/git/trees/4060e861e9f91adc5b053047ebc069b72a9e5d14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asmitdash/CVS/git/commits/225425dde89f90cb8b22a7540512ef87f3c6d547","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115637270?v=4","events_url":"https://api.g