0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T09:39:40Z","email":"dibyendu@outlook.com","name":"dibyendu das"},"message":"fix(workflow-skills): drop task output shipped inside the to-implement skill\n\nskills/to-implement/tasks/0001-translate-missing-i18n-keys_plan.md was task\noutput from a real run, mirrored here by the old sync-skills-to-repo hook.\nIt shipped to every install of the plugin and cost tokens for nothing. That\nhook has been removed, so it will not come back.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f1bb2698d152d0ea63ec68e99616ec3ac90463f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/magmonium/skills/git/trees/f1bb2698d152d0ea63ec68e99616ec3ac90463f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/magmonium/skills/git/commits/bacd36bbf8b969ae24facc1e3c5d10024ccea556","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/magmonium/skills/commit/bacd36bbf8b969ae24facc1e3c5d10024ccea556","node_id":"C_kwDOSuozGNoAKGJhY2QzNmJiZjhiOTY5YWUyNGZhY2MxZTNjNWQxMDAyNGNjZWE1NTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/magmonium/skills/commit/d5d50a06a84fcb47aef0afc3c26dda59f831e83f","sha":"d5d50a06a84fcb47aef0afc3c26dda59f831e83f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/magmonium/skills/commits/d5d50a06a84fcb47aef0afc3c26dda59f831e83f"}],"sha":"bacd36bbf8b969ae24facc1e3c5d10024ccea556","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/magmonium/skills/commits/bacd36bbf8b969ae24facc1e3c5d10024ccea556"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/magmonium/skills/commits/d5d50a06a84fcb47aef0afc3c26dda59f831e83f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T09:36:08Z","email":"dibyendu@outlook.com","name":"dibyendu das"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T09:39:22Z","email":"dibyendu@outlook.com","name":"dibyendu das"},"message":"feat(skills): adopt nx/angular skills, trim angular-fsd-expert description\n\nThese seven skills had no plugin home and only existed as loose copies under\n~/.claude/skills, so they were lost when the vendored trees were removed.\n\n- add angular-developer, monitor-ci, nx-generate, nx-plugins, nx-run-tasks,\n  nx-workspace and zoom-out to the magmonium-skills plugin\n- trim the angular-fsd-expert agent description from 3677 to 422 chars by\n  dropping five verbose <example> blocks. It was ~1.3k always-on tokens,\n  82% of this plugin''s session cost\n- drop a stray to-implement/tasks/ plan file that had leaked into the repo\n- bump magmonium-skills to 1.1.0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"513eff51da2416388110f009ed6d02a6660ab227","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/magmonium/skills/git/trees/513eff51da2416388110f009ed6d02a6660ab227"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/magmonium/skills/git/commits/d5d50a06a84fcb47aef0afc3c26dda59f831e83f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/magmonium/skills/commit/d5d50a06a84fcb47aef0afc3c26dda59f831e83f","node_id":"C_kwDOSuozGNoAKGQ1ZDUwYTA2YTg0ZmNiNDdhZWYwYWZjM2MyNmRkYTU5ZjgzMWU4M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/magmonium/skills/commit/6e9724c80e6d7a4fd71993a593c490907443362b","sha":"6e9724c80e6d7a4fd71993a593c490907443362b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/magmonium/skills/commits/6e9724c80e6d7a4fd71993a593c490907443362b"}],"sha":"d5d50a06a84fcb47aef0afc3c26dda59f831e83f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/magmonium/skills/commits/d5d50a06a84fcb47aef0afc3c26dda59f831e83f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/magmonium/skills/commits/6e9724c80e6d7a4fd71993a593c490907443362b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T19:14:07Z","email":"dibyendu@outlook.com","name":"dibyendu das"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T19:14:07Z","email":"dibyendu@outlook.com","name":"dibyendu das"},"message":"chore: sync skills+agents workflow-skills