ontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/732da87e627a6767eab3d28f014b016f7bcea509/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:49:49Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:49:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(gpu-host): wait boundedly for Ollama before starting meeting-ai (#351)\n\nAfter a reboot the TEST GPU host''s Ollama boot task (gitops#3807) can still be\ndiscovering the GPU when the meeting-ai task starts; measured 3-21 s. The\nlauncher probed Ollama once with a 3 s timeout and exited non-zero, relying on\nthe Scheduled Task restart policy - but Task Scheduler only retries a failed\nlaunch, not a non-zero exit, so a few seconds of dependency start-up became a\nlasting outage (2026-09-15 reboot: \"refusing mock fallback\").\n\nWait-MeetingAiOllamaReadiness polls /api/tags for a bounded time (default\n600 s, OllamaReadinessTimeoutSec) and still fails closed with the same\n\"refusing mock fallback\" log line; it never selects the mock backend. The wait\nruns after the configuration-only return, so CI validation is unchanged. The\ntranscript-ready permit assertion before it only verifies files and consumes\nnothing.\n\nTests: Windows PS 5.1 behaviour cases (retry until ready, fail closed after the\nbound, real probe on a closed port) and a static launcher contract test.\nLocal: 29 unit tests OK; pwsh parse OK for the three scripts.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ed04b01efbf5ddbf94818d9e7ab3c504abc23a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/trees/0ed04b01efbf5ddbf94818d9e7ab3c504abc23a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/commits/732da87e627a6767eab3d28f014b016f7bcea509","verification":{"payload":"tree 0ed04b01efbf5ddbf94818d9e7ab3c504abc23a5\nparent 13aa7b8303d7e0f85bef94a56b1e5d164d1884ed\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1790272189 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790272189 +0300\n\nfix(gpu-host): wait boundedly for Ollama before starting meeting-ai (#351)\n\nAfter a reboot the TEST GPU host''s Ollama boot task (gitops#3807) can still be\ndiscovering the GPU when the meeting-ai task starts; measured 3-21 s. The\nlauncher probed Ollama once with a 3 s timeout and exited non-zero, relying on\nthe Scheduled Task restart policy - but Task Scheduler only retries a failed\nlaunch, not a non-zero exit, so a few seconds of dependency start-up became a\nlasting outage (2026-09-15 reboot: \"refusing mock fallback\").\n\nWait-MeetingAiOllamaReadiness polls /api/tags for a bounded time (default\n600 s, OllamaReadinessTimeoutSec) and still fails closed with the same\n\"refusing mock fallback\" log line; it never selects the mock backend. The wait\nruns after the configuration-only return, so CI validation is unchanged. The\ntranscript-ready permit assertion before it only verifies files and consumes\nnothing.\n\nTests: Windows PS 5.1 behaviour cases (retry until ready, fail closed after the\nbound, real probe on a closed port) and a static launcher contract test.\nLocal: 29 unit tests OK; pwsh parse OK for the three scripts.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtWK9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3KkQAFMgPudxtzQDl3zUjOsz2Ags\nQGh6soifCiwNc6fAWV22BNlJv5aqwvM6hotv5Zwm8RZkUPbcCH3X49PGsBLShwC5\n2tPJ7dbii0xDfWclcUPAzbXRr3TgBjQya2RcoDXSzDWw42MHrds/F1D40T6s4/eG\n98qSl3Kwkuq0NyrdzLBml2QK9kCaraFrrjWE0OXi098Zyk4IB7juPm51lY0siJAm\nt56s8KV4Y0wOmsfCJztThZ987tLTSoInPyoN899G9CqiQvY9Xw0oexvGLJfAF6oK\nI/eiQecSQw1bRKp0qUFOm8cO/Y7/gNY1U5GtTIoBOJWpeemMVMxkK9eA7vqJ61j6\nq528hfqQqCXmTd+SnvrNsDeaVJUr2Uzh1dGOIc8QilgpebQl1XrdsYw9l9ADGnlo\nuHL93SVnv92r+J1vuJajehhzkyv2oCJhK1L2VS/YB69AGSJ0vrynhZI2Lot+YDrr\n7p0KuS4iZUSbuP3zuGfBru74alNiReNGUw4E26dxOMxZ3uh+Kz90V2TwmNBgNO9A\nWGe2SfewCj5gg1iPaAtxnT+s26rUCuuNWi5etys5CrlRiZTtEn19TOBWUA8krUjy\nojtNaNdBV5oKiZFQuZ0UudWfz9Y/9FaUKB/vGIazceXrjDWxXQNZ3JCToRiLIHdH\nK1i77tOwmRuvxnReU4S1\n=Sh8X\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-24T17:49:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_t