ganizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/ff179d92c8051e3d8d1cf7c4a81e0db15ac3fda7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T07:51:32Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T07:51:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(meeting-ai): collapse line breaks in merged STT sentences before they ship as decisions (#335)\n\n#334 glued unpunctuated STT lines into one sentence but kept the raw transcript\nslice as the sentence text, so the extractive selector shipped decisions such as\n\"Birinci\\nkararımız\\nkonfederasyon\\nçalışmak.\" and \"bitirilecek\\n.\" (live\nmeeting-service rows, runs 1171b556 / 44f66d9d, 2026-09-03).\n\nMerged sentences now collapse whitespace runs to one space and re-attach a lone\npunctuation line to the preceding word. Offsets are untouched: the verifier and\ntimestamping stay offset-based, and both numbering and verification still come\nfrom the same split_sentences call (alignment invariant).\n\nTests: offset test asserts the whitespace-collapsed slice; new test covers the\nlone \".\" line. 14 passed.","tree":{"sha":"2c16786c2d52c801332ab4c49eca31cb8621f748","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/trees/2c16786c2d52c801332ab4c49eca31cb8621f748"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/commits/ff179d92c8051e3d8d1cf7c4a81e0db15ac3fda7","verification":{"payload":"tree 2c16786c2d52c801332ab4c49eca31cb8621f748\nparent 5ce77a0b2d2225259921396a275b6a633180430d\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1788421892 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788421892 +0300\n\nfix(meeting-ai): collapse line breaks in merged STT sentences before they ship as decisions (#335)\n\n#334 glued unpunctuated STT lines into one sentence but kept the raw transcript\nslice as the sentence text, so the extractive selector shipped decisions such as\n\"Birinci\\nkararımız\\nkonfederasyon\\nçalışmak.\" and \"bitirilecek\\n.\" (live\nmeeting-service rows, runs 1171b556 / 44f66d9d, 2026-09-03).\n\nMerged sentences now collapse whitespace runs to one space and re-attach a lone\npunctuation line to the preceding word. Offsets are untouched: the verifier and\ntimestamping stay offset-based, and both numbering and verification still come\nfrom the same split_sentences call (alignment invariant).\n\nTests: offset test asserts the whitespace-collapsed slice; new test covers the\nlone \".\" line. 14 passed.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmScECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARAwQAEb0+odd2DfLLPESOyEQ1un4\nsFtZpqbJnhLuQji72m7yBUgNoPqN2OvHjR5BYXWpyAD2daxVygliO7a0VLuAcSWn\nDRTeVUs56BUPup6YfmjxFXS7xMQniMf//hoVZVwn0mkaZKVl7NO8i2vnJ9EQMzl4\n+Y5FGZhhBq3DxqY+kN9sB6z8qYVq3lpcc043bLth8XAKYuDCHPX6ZxD77PlVakDh\nlOO5tUuzdP+BBFbC0B0T+qflxEMElyGnDDGkazDgKV8+O42gpfSzAgDGaAMbJSC6\nMzPzNVxcmEJ1J/IbutSScMminjg3gCwvw91FaxEST2l9yjsRGamWRR756G49RtVF\nKBsUITVYKp6hq4Fq6GPS/ro84T2E2GW7EMCNqBjf06f6ovDAMVCr0lIkKAm/PlTh\na5lI8WciMKPDwESeL3Qmd4BsC9MeQf2A42FZx1urW/FmsL9by2xz5g/bY8lKZIZJ\nXTWrFI2ZQpCwvB1O79g1oOTLKrMTi/8uER+kUOzqWnI8qYDnnoovutyANsatJyTM\nC7nwFzNPEIZt9EDUcSWMHhLh9UVPvah3x4kZa3KXnitneDyxpIdQIz0Z61dO+c0T\niyxF7fbwBqMpq+DW9+CRv5l1d7gX3QUp0A6pClxAW8g9su99RdItmRLyORrU/dsH\n6kCRonX/vAhq6P9qOHQu\n=MM6B\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-03T07:51:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ai/commit/ff179d92c8051e3d8d1cf7c4a81e0db15ac3fda7","node_id":"C_kwDOSut_MtoAKGZmMTc5ZDkyYzgwNTFlM2Q4ZDFjZjdjNGE4MWUwZGIxNWFjM2ZkYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ai/commit/5ce77a0b2d2225259921396a275b6a633180430d","sha":"5ce77a0b2d2225259921396a275b6a633180430d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/5ce77a0b2d2225259921396a275b6a633180430d"}],"sha":"ff179d92c8051e3d8d1cf7c4a81e0db15ac3fda7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/ff179d92c8051e3d8d1cf7c4a81e0db15ac3fda7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/5ce77a0b2d2225259921396a275b6a633180430d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T07:15:59Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T07:15:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(meeting-ai): glue unpunctuated STT lines into one sentence before extractive selection (#334)\n\nFinalized transcripts carry one STT segment per line, mostly without\nterminal punctuation (\"en geç\" / \"Cuma gününe kadar\" / \"bitirilecek\").\n_SENTENCE_SPLIT treats every line break as a sentence boundary, so the\nextractive selector could only pick a fragment: Zeynep''s 2026-09-03 attended\ntest (meeting b8ca6dbf) shipped the decision \"En geç\" and the action\n\"Sergen Bediroğlu\", while the live path (no line breaks) produced the whole\ndecision. The verifier was blamed; the sentence boundary was the cause.\n\nsplit_sentences now glues fragments that do not end with sentence\npunctuation to what follows (capped at 40 words for punctuation-free\ntranscripts). Punctuated sentences are untouched, offsets stay true to the\ntranscript slice, and the alignment invariant holds because every consumer\ngoes through the same function.\n\nEvidence: real b8ca6dbf transcript (191 lines) -> 32 sentences, median 7\nwords, \"En geç Cuma gününe kadar bitirilecek .\" is one sentence.\nmeeting-ai unit suite 354 passed / 15 skipped; 3 new tests.\n\nRefs: platform-k8s-gitops#3526\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"53438a9c1c44c5841ce68d96cb575ee64e5b3f7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/trees/53438a9c1c44c5841ce68d96cb575ee64e5b3f7b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/commits/5ce77a0b2d2225259921396a275b6a633180430d","verification":{"payload":"tree 53438a9c1c44c5841ce68d96cb575ee64e5b3f7b\nparent 51c2d9e640aa0514c34b97eaceba2daafe70f357\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1788419759 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788419759 +0300\n\nfix(meeting-ai): glue unpunctuated STT lines into one sentence before extractive selection (#334)\n\nFinalized transcripts carry one STT segment per line, mostly without\nterminal punctuation (\"en geç\" / \"Cuma gününe kadar\" / \"bitirilecek\").\n_SENTENCE_SPLIT treats every line break as a sentence boundary, so the\nextractive selector could only pick a fragment: Zeynep''s 2026-09-03 attended\ntest (meeting b8ca6dbf) shipped the decision \"En geç\" and the action\n\"Sergen Bediroğlu\", while the live path (no line breaks) produced the whole\ndecision. The verifier was blamed; the sentence boundary was the cause.\n\nsplit_sentences now glues fragments that do not end with sentence\npunctuation to what follows (capped at 40 words for punctuation-free\ntranscripts). Punctuated sentences are untouched, offsets stay true to the\ntranscript slice, and the alignment invariant holds because every consumer\ngoes through the same function.\n\nEvidence: real b8ca6dbf transcript (191 lines) -> 32 sentences, median 7\nwords, \"En geç Cuma gününe kadar bitirilecek .\" is one sentence.\nmeeting-ai unit suite 354 passed / 15 skipped; 3 new tests.\n\nRefs: platform-k8s-gitops#3526\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmR6vCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1OMQAD8jkWPh/IgYi1n10/x56QPx\nmK5BW3EKQ8rO6c1pmIIavDzw5jYneEiH/dlZ+YrDShqGtTIiQpXNiIncWlOfURIU\nA+fgTPP2e0eTKXU/G/sY0rm83zlqGSflSejKpaUmmdwiuYrcuax5crEgLSURxZa+\nAJB2Q2HD+kc74GmeiQsNMl0av7Q/6Mip+j542