owing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/8c143ddcff0c119c8bf071c820a2c3fe8f923d1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T02:34:11Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T02:34:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(meeting-ai): extractive by construction — model cümle numarası seçer (gitops#3444) (#328)\n\n* feat(meeting-ai): extractive by construction — model selects sentence indices\n\nOlcum onceki hipotezi curuttu: morfoloji katmani gercek uretim verisinde\n89 iddiadan +1 kazandirdi. Gercek kok neden semantik — medyan kapsama 0.33\n(esik 0.65), 53 iddia esigin altinda, 14 fact fusion. Prompt paraphrase''i\nZATEN buyuk harflerle yasakliyordu; llama3.1:8b uymuyor.\n\nCozum: modele duzyazi yazdirmayi birak, numarali transkriptten CUMLE NUMARASI\nsectir; metni servis kendi cumle listesinden materyalize etsin. Secilen iddia\nbir transkript cumlesidir -> kapsama 1.0, paraphrase/fusion temsil edilemez.\n\n- extractive.py: numarali menu + dogrulanmis indeks materyalizasyonu\n  (aralik disi/tekrar/bool/bütçe asimi DUSURULUR, komsuya kaydirilmaz)\n- analyze.py: indeks prompt''u + secim yolu; model sozlesmeyi yok sayarsa\n  eski serbest-metin yolu fallback\n- Hizalama degismezi: numaralandirma ve materyalizasyon citation.split_sentences\n  ile — dogrulayicinin kendi boleni\n\nGercek veriyle giderken bulunan iki kusur da duzeltildi:\n- menu filtresi karakter sayisi yerine citation.is_groundable_evidence (yeni\n  public yardimci) — 15 tek-token span birebir alintida bile LOW_CONFIDENCE''ti\n- ground_claim beraberlikte artik BIREBIR esitligi tercih ediyor: gercek\n  transkriptte \"…bir gun…\" / \"…bir 1 gun…\" ikizinde look-alike secilip sayi\n  kapisina takiliyor, birebir mevcut iddia reddediliyordu\n\nKanit: 23 uretim transkriptinin TUM secilebilir cumleleri 776/776 grounded\n(%97 -> %99.9 -> %100). pytest 365/365; yon dogrulandi.\n\nRef: gitops#3444\n\n* test(meeting-ai): re-runnable grounding-guarantee measurement on real transcripts\n\nUnit testler bilinen basarisizlik sekillerini pinliyor; bu script garantiyi\nuretim metninin KENDISINE karsi tekrar kosturur. Splitter, token filtresi,\npolarite tablosu veya sayi kapisindaki ileri bir degisiklik garantiyi sessizce\n\"egilim\"e dusuremesin diye release kapisi olarak kullanilabilir (ihlalde exit 1).\n\nTranskript metni okunur, asla basilmaz: yalniz sayilar ve sabit dogrulayici\nkelime dagarciğindan olusan neden tablosu stdout''a cikar.\n\nGercek veri: 23 uretim transkripti -> 776/776 (%100), 2 transkript menusu bos\n(legacy yol).\n\nRef: gitops#3444\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: halildeu <gladyatore@hotmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"22995b49c9e3cbc6ee399fa7d8918794ec97eb3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/trees/22995b49c9e3cbc6ee399fa7d8918794ec97eb3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/commits/8c143ddcff0c119c8bf071c820a2c3fe8f923d1f","verification":{"payload":"tree 22995b49c9e3cbc6ee399fa7d8918794ec97eb3c\nparent c14905273efcaba216a08bdc9f522fd6cb7b1b48\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1785897251 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785897251 +0300\n\nfeat(meeting-ai): extractive by construction — model cümle numarası seçer (gitops#3444) (#328)\n\n* feat(meeting-ai): extractive by construction — model selects sentence indices\n\nOlcum onceki hipotezi curuttu: morfoloji katmani gercek uretim verisinde\n89 iddiadan +1 kazandirdi. Gercek kok neden semantik — medyan kapsama 0.33\n(esik 0.65), 53 iddia esigin altinda, 14 fact fusion. Prompt paraphrase''i\nZATEN buyuk harflerle yasakliyordu; llama3.1:8b uymuyor.\n\nCozum: modele duzyazi yazdirmayi birak, numarali transkriptten CUMLE NUMARASI\nsectir; metni servis kendi cumle listesinden materyalize etsin. Secilen iddia\nbir transkript cumlesidir -> kapsama 1.0, paraphrase/fusion temsil edilemez.\n\n- extractive.py: numarali menu + dogrulanmis indeks materyalizasyonu\n  (aralik disi/tekrar/bool/bütçe asimi DUSURULUR, komsuya kaydirilmaz)\n- analyze.py: indeks prompt''u + secim yolu; model sozlesmeyi yok sayarsa\n  eski serbest-metin yolu fallback\n- Hizalama degismezi: numaralandirma ve materyalizasyon citation.split_sentences\n  ile — dogrulayicinin kendi boleni\n\nGercek veriyle giderken bulunan iki kusur da duzeltildi:\n- menu filtresi karakter sayisi yerine citation.is_groundable_evidence (yeni\n  public yardimci) — 15 tek-token span birebir alintida bile LOW_CONFIDENCE''ti\n- ground_claim beraberlikte artik BIREBIR esitligi tercih ediyor: gercek\n  transkriptte \"…bir gun…\" / \"…bir 1 gun…\" ikizinde look-alike secilip sayi\n  kapisina takiliyor, birebir mevcut iddia reddediliyordu\n\nKanit: 23 uretim transkriptinin TUM secilebilir cumleleri 776/776 grounded\n(%97 -> %99.9 -> %100). pytest 365/365; yon dogrulandi.\n\nRef: gitops#3444\n\n* test(meeting-ai): re-runnable grounding-guarantee measurement on real transcripts\n\nUnit testler bilinen basarisizlik sekillerini pinliyor; bu script garantiyi\nuretim metninin KENDISINE karsi tekrar kosturur. Splitter, token filtresi,\npolarite tablosu veya sayi kapisindaki ileri bir degisiklik garantiyi sessizce\n\"egilim\"e dusuremesin diye release kapisi olarak kullanilabilir (ihlalde exit 1).\n\nTranskript metni okunur, asla basilmaz: yalniz sayilar ve sabit dogrulayici\nkelime dagarciğindan olusan neden tablosu stdout''a cikar.\n\nGercek veri: 23 uretim transkripti -> 776/776 (%100), 2 transkript menusu bos\n(legacy yol).\n\nRef: gitops#3444\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: halildeu <gladyatore@hotmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqcqEjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAo3AQACg8tFc+0GRyBSEAXueFkMCv\noxHoHjZGkf30YZn7uJg+vtvH7mEG1AknVzf2tmCzotRDJIC2Av7HA4ic6vGwTpU2\nrKVWUog/OMREiHSiKtWYyso55qhEQQbnb/6GVLpPeTUp9xp7uXVg0JFh7yuu4mD9\nBuxsg9rvpLvK1koDAuKFlTW3GsLf48Dj5IR1iCdrB4kRuIm0qfudVbi0BnkY/TL+\nnE/KU2OZavsI7SbhomHd4FBYQd8Z5PAo9CRzIBmXmmvUTyC8qgU9HUgET/Qfz921\nVqgjyp/i6kRqm/fP8esoamB1PM+7Hpu9jZd8LR/zp8ICYEMUs3/b7gaxLZspGnWK\nqe6ng26UWNO2vPUwhgnDIgIz4NDUWNfbyZR3L14ic/NPWhR/1powjm/VC6Q1VpEk\n7XfRschWBhx+/DKtUB1J20tuvW3ry1bm7T1ET42K0vChUpYqE95zH1ra09eNOOgX\nNBK63wEtdhTNYNX8brEgYdf7574aKuP4Yz7/x1CzXsEn2jOQ1mhYBGcgbg2HGWxU\n4PDfYvumVLnHZoIA/84jbyt+uW6fR4LJH+mF/FNCH+idvhOeuywxiqcrkdYXIGtq\nLBbFnY2JXnU6X1HmpAQsqtRdXpMH93iV0xO6u36PxEUyafuG/LypOIPl43WAq1eX\newYMTdBMuOXqzjlxQV7m\n=SJVV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-05T07:24:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ai/commit/8c143ddcff0c119c8bf071c820a2c3fe8f923d1f","node_id":"C_kwDOSut_MtoAKDhjMTQzZGRjZmYwYzExOWM4YmYwNzFjODIwYTJjM2ZlOGY5MjNkMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ai/commit/c14905273efcaba216a08bdc9f522fd6cb7b1b48","sha":"c14905273efcaba216a08bdc9f522fd6cb7b1b48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/c14905273efcaba216a08bdc9f522fd6cb7b1b48"}],"sha":"8c143ddcff0c119c8bf071c820a2c3fe8f923d1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/8c143ddcff0c119c8bf071c820a2c3fe8f923d1f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/c14905273efcaba216a08bdc9f522fd6cb7b1b48/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T01:13:32Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T01:13:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(meeting-ai): Turkish morphology-aware grounding — %29 boş özet düzeltmesi (gitops#3444) (#327)\n\n* feat(meeting-ai): Turkish morphology-aware grounding — 29% empty-summary fix\n\nk3d-test olcumu (gitops#3444): 76 analizden 22''si (%29) tamamen bos ozetle\ncikiyor. Gercek bar _MAX_UNSUPPORTED_CONTENT_TOKENS=0: ozetin her kelimesi tek\ncumlede birebir yuzey formuyla gecmeli — eklemeli Turkcede paraphrase icin\nimkansiz. _similarity docstring''inin isimlendirdigi v2 yol haritasi maddesi:\ntense-preserving Turkish lemmatizer (Zeyrek — Zemberek portu, sektor standardi).\n\n- morphology.py: kelime-seviyesi _parse (NLTK indirmesi yok), lru_cache,\n  fail-safe fallback (zeyrek yoksa birebir eski davranis)\n- _token_covered iki kapida ayni yuklem: once yuzey, sonra korumali NOMINAL\n  lemma esitligi\n- Kip korumasi: fiil okumasi olan token lemma uretmez -> \"onaylandi\" (olmus)\n  \"onaylanmasi\" (bekliyor) ile asla birlesmiyor\n- Kisa-lemma/turetme korumasi: >=4 karakter + lemma iki yuzeyin oneki\n  (yumusama toleransli: kitap->kitabi) -> \"can\"/\"canli\" koprusu kapali\n- Owner/due-date birebir kaldi (atribusyon metadata''si)\n- PII: zeyrek analiz ettigi kelimeyi WARNING''de logluyor (transkript sizintisi)\n  -> propagate=False + NullHandler + CRITICAL; regresyon testi eklendi\n\nKanit: pytest 345/345 (14 yeni). Yon iki tarafli: ayni girdi morfolojiyle\nPASSED, available()=False iken FAILED.\n\nRef: gitops#3444\n\n* style: CI lint uyumu — Any-tipli analyzer, kısa noqa''lar, black formatı\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: halildeu <gladyatore@hotmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"4caf30b771f9489c95f4e8e350b1dff62a018d5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/trees/4caf30b771f9489c95f4e8e350b1dff62a018d5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/commits/c14905273efcaba216a08bdc9f522fd6cb7b1b48","verification":{"payload":"tree 4caf30b771f9489c95f4e8e350b1dff62a018d5f\nparent 182868161affe5717