912b1dae05be81768b"}],"sha":"c14905273efcaba216a08bdc9f522fd6cb7b1b48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/c14905273efcaba216a08bdc9f522fd6cb7b1b48"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/182868161affe571717ce0912b1dae05be81768b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T08:48:41Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T08:48:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(live-stt): production accepts live-lane VAD off — draft policy, not invariant (#326)\n\nFourth and final seal of the gitops#3419 draft-starvation chain: the\nSettings production validator raised ''stream_live_vad_filter must be\nenabled in production'', so the #324 start-script policy crash-looped the\nservice at boot (observed 2026-08-04 11:33 pid13716: ValidationError at\nuvicorn import; every deploy acceptance timed out on readiness because\nthe app never came up).\n\nDraft-lane VAD is a policy choice, not a durable-transcript invariant:\ndrafts are ephemeral and always superseded by the VAD-gated finals, and\nwith silero on the 2 s live windows the draft lane starves (field data:\n3 drafts in a 2.5-minute meeting; tr-cv17 fixture <3 partials over 2x\nreplays). The final-lane VAD invariant stays fail-closed in production.\n\ntest_config: production now ACCEPTS stream_live_vad_filter=False (value\nasserted) while the final-lane rejection case is unchanged — 13/13.\n\nCompletes #324 (start script) + #325 (updater acceptance contract).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"83c8269f5883790d25b82a7a082850836f188771","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/trees/83c8269f5883790d25b82a7a082850836f188771"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/commits/182868161affe571717ce0912b1dae05be81768b","verification":{"payload":"tree 83c8269f5883790d25b82a7a082850836f188771\nparent dd643187e5e4acfbfaa65e1388d69cdffb7171d7\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1785833321 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785833321 +0300\n\nfix(live-stt): production accepts live-lane VAD off — draft policy, not invariant (#326)\n\nFourth and final seal of the gitops#3419 draft-starvation chain: the\nSettings production validator raised ''stream_live_vad_filter must be\nenabled in production'', so the #324 start-script policy crash-looped the\nservice at boot (observed 2026-08-04 11:33 pid13716: ValidationError at\nuvicorn import; every deploy acceptance timed out on readiness because\nthe app never came up).\n\nDraft-lane VAD is a policy choice, not a durable-transcript invariant:\ndrafts are ephemeral and always superseded by the VAD-gated finals, and\nwith silero on the 2 s live windows the draft lane starves (field data:\n3 drafts in a 2.5-minute meeting; tr-cv17 fixture <3 partials over 2x\nreplays). The final-lane VAD invariant stays fail-closed in production.\n\ntest_config: production now ACCEPTS stream_live_vad_filter=False (value\nasserted) while the final-lane rejection case is unchanged — 13/13.\n\nCompletes #324 (start script) + #325 (updater acceptance contract).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqcadpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2doQAJljo2bJUpp9CoeJr/rAHEH9\nCe2L3T1wD2oiSjbD5b3poMIgsFLFl8wFNgTy+yu9Wc9DQVmvtEvfGzhQZrNTYu9u\nng3p00+n3Cguqiu9VciKEPtvs/4tICPGvKsqPVAOVGDA3IAlZQ5dEDmAiIxP4SAw\nYufPgjTwK6Ahk1ut2p1RpNj3Xc3UcBl7n7ZflNAH8rUmifxZAzQG+4lxBgEy79Gw\n++ouoDIQqF9OnU+xFQTfbc47JosTOXhacrj5kwJpi62UB6HgGSiNkbo60YqbtwqQ\nYI/ZOPvoe/YWsaHfDLZhJyiqRDFeFYe0Lyt5GyrfKblWL7zu5+rvuvLxd60bJoH4\nwqLeNP62Zr3FGvFzapFq7I8peNtPqursLWBipX39w0KTsLOLhxgcW5w00yIsbm1k\nIyObTdsfppPPFr7ZKo+B6AU0gNcYjfpP4UYH9CgVh5/9psAzxkXbWLhg9756Qyck\nqvwWB0y8VB3HwZDTUrfRfY962mcVWTW6oCnblefc/KY3lL08ee3DUG0T6/DmL32d\nH985g8r6ukJ6EuGGJjm4vekaoaSnLXmIAurU4qsqDqkTMbLYFfDbNrSVQJnBLSnS\nRFmFD8b2pC3u7Cdpxf0bLnJNYyl+cqlulnerdZbQ4N1aVBpo/xCVEa3p1LJ51tAX\nm9i5Zid2DzT28YCe0lxK\n=NqKG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-04T09:06:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ai/commit/182868161affe571717ce0912b1dae05be81768b","node_id":"C_kwDOSut_MtoAKDE4Mjg2ODE2MWFmZmU1NzE3MTdjZTA5MTJiMWRhZTA1YmU4MTc2OGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ai/commit/dd643187e5e4acfbfaa65e1388d69cdffb7171d7","sha":"dd643187e5e4acfbfaa65e1388d69cdffb7171d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/dd643187e5e4acfbfaa65e1388d69cdffb7171d7"}],"sha":"182868161affe571717ce0912b1dae05be81768b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/182868161affe571717ce0912b1dae05be81768b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/dd643187e5e4acfbfaa65e1388d69cdffb7171d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T07:30:54Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T07:30:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(gpu-host): align acceptance readiness contract with #324 live-VAD-off policy (#325)\n\n#324 flipped STT_STREAM_LIVE_VAD_FILTER to false in start-live-stt.ps1\nbut the updater''s readiness assertion still required\nspeech_gate.vad.live_enabled == true, so deploying d473d404 hung on\n''waiting for live-stt streaming model readiness'' until the deadline and\nrejected the revision (EXIT=3, old pin restored+reaccepted — observed\nlive 2026-08-04 09:57-10:29).\n\nThe readiness contract now asserts live_enabled == false, matching the\nsingle source of policy in start-live-stt.ps1. Final-lane VAD and every\nother speech-gate assertion are unchanged.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"56ce9aab74389e648006149d3eb4edf154372593","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/trees/56ce9aab74389e648006149d3eb4edf154372593"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/commits/dd643187e5e4acfbfaa65e1388d69cdffb7171d7","verification":{"payload":"tree 56ce9aab74389e648006149d3eb4edf154372593\nparent d473d4046cf0aa8c155c8783287d9a6cdbb24708\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1785828654 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785828654 +0300\n\nfix(gpu-host): align acceptance readiness contract with #324 live-VAD-off policy (#325)\n\n#324 flipped STT_STREAM_LIVE_VAD_FILTER to false in start-live-stt.ps1\nbut the updater''s readiness assertion still required\nspeech_gate.vad.live_enabled == true, so deploying d473d404 hung on\n''waiting for live-stt streaming model readiness'' until the deadline and\nrejected the revision (EXIT=3, old pin restored+reaccepted — observed\nlive 2026-08-04 09:57-10:29).\n\nThe readiness contract now asserts live_enabled == false, matching the\nsingle source of policy in start-live-stt.ps1. Final-lane VAD and every\nother speech-gate assertion are unchanged.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqcZUuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxUYQAGoYwOfTLiu2uaa