u/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/58360ac24092b935060add31c83198ff28eb8b3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T19:35:38Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T19:35:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(gpu-host): persist deploy acceptance evidence and name the gate that refused (#295)\n\nThe acceptance gate proved a deploy and then threw the proof away. The smoke\nsummary is the only place terminal_sequence (eof_ack,drained), coverage and the\nquality gate exist, and it was parsed, judged and dropped. On 2026-07-27 a\nfenced-runtime recovery succeeded and its acceptance text existed nowhere on\ndisk - not in ProgramData, not under deploy\\gpu-host\\logs - so the postcondition\naudit could only be answered by asking the operator to paste from the session\nthat happened to run it.\n\nTwo changes, same region:\n\n* acceptance-receipt.ps1 writes a receipt beside the ledger under the same\n  SYSTEM + Administrators-only ACL, with readback and bounded history. It is a\n  dot-sourced module like deployment-state.ps1 so it can be exercised without\n  running a deploy. Writing evidence is never a gate: a receipt that fails to\n  persist is reported and the verdict is left untouched.\n* The 30-term -and chain became named checks. It short-circuited to a bare\n  $false and printed nothing, so a stream rejected on content was\n  indistinguishable from a crashed interpreter - which is how a deploy stalled\n  on 2026-07-27 while the same fixture passed when run by hand. The refusing\n  term now appears in the console line and in the receipt.\n\nGate semantics are unchanged: every term keeps its threshold and its\nconditional shape. The summary is redaction-safe by construction (counts,\nlatencies, word counts, short hashes - never transcript text), so persisting it\ncarries no KVKK exposure.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9256b6553428257a4d2677a99ce77faa7dc973d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/trees/9256b6553428257a4d2677a99ce77faa7dc973d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/commits/58360ac24092b935060add31c83198ff28eb8b3d","verification":{"payload":"tree 9256b6553428257a4d2677a99ce77faa7dc973d7\nparent d9139cb5b5cd4f7e771482d311e78f3b18f048e0\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1785180938 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785180938 +0300\n\nfix(gpu-host): persist deploy acceptance evidence and name the gate that refused (#295)\n\nThe acceptance gate proved a deploy and then threw the proof away. The smoke\nsummary is the only place terminal_sequence (eof_ack,drained), coverage and the\nquality gate exist, and it was parsed, judged and dropped. On 2026-07-27 a\nfenced-runtime recovery succeeded and its acceptance text existed nowhere on\ndisk - not in ProgramData, not under deploy\\gpu-host\\logs - so the postcondition\naudit could only be answered by asking the operator to paste from the session\nthat happened to run it.\n\nTwo changes, same region:\n\n* acceptance-receipt.ps1 writes a receipt beside the ledger under the same\n  SYSTEM + Administrators-only ACL, with readback and bounded history. It is a\n  dot-sourced module like deployment-state.ps1 so it can be exercised without\n  running a deploy. Writing evidence is never a gate: a receipt that fails to\n  persist is reported and the verdict is left untouched.\n* The 30-term -and chain became named checks. It short-circuited to a bare\n  $false and printed nothing, so a stream rejected on content was\n  indistinguishable from a crashed interpreter - which is how a deploy stalled\n  on 2026-07-27 while the same fixture passed when run by hand. The refusing\n  term now appears in the console line and in the receipt.\n\nGate semantics are unchanged: every term keeps its threshold and its\nconditional shape. The summary is redaction-safe by construction (counts,\nlatencies, word counts, short hashes - never transcript text), so persisting it\ncarries no KVKK exposure.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZ7MKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYSoQAKL4qw5kp/LMWUubCbL+FP4k\nf7ouUJgrslRZxdYlRj0rUlEjB6UpWdCWk3HvsvHoPpVyge7rQqJalPCby5UeYzhH\nAnqc8s27EpYvk+sZvSHrTtBJcrag9gF06HcRoJcZAghfHO+FtoGbaaQY0s2L15vr\n/SSsqm54FBscPfNHRrEPqe+L/O9pMzNqIpV3uKPht3UfNiWLsV5tRKEQtTivy0ta\nwA7DaRBXLdDQ9IB1+O3kK2brPuJ+cTE/h/CCLeRKivSMaGgVphexRPLfNOLssLEv\nPOHMlFoj3xSKi+007ufS1j4OIXJWDZ3VE2ziIolEOU2S4Jf/L8AXnsvJfUfR17o2\nUnTp1u0dCHFaq7Xfp9ptmxRPfcfBVY9N/CTtWo5sB0tFVA7IhlpBTugIWdZ63xK4\nvTBVkZQj3+q2LMLyTIuILYgGk+qypaaORqOyFy+8CFCUv0XLBFzXPV9p3o7qLA2n\n17JHA15eOqva4wIwcqC3tmK28dWUY6UQI66bFTB4L3RZESh6+wS0B32QbXaTe8hj\neZKHr+5XtBf8bUyxBgshtXWLPkrX0Vow99wkz79kA9a6g/T/DPmRkQ5qaWPRNWYN\nJRkuqJntC+Dip1bZzUPUJK66+AcP8ieHj4bbbUIPjrK0kKEOLTA7tkH1HnNyjFfy\nKzs4M19TaWw5OFFnhmPv\n=bOUc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-27T19:35:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"