alildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/41eb45bfceed024e4a861144d6cdf6f7d104291b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T22:52:11Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T22:52:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(gpu-host): kabul WER esigi fixture basina, olculen degere gore (#290)\n\nBelirti: iki-fazli kapi (#289) sonrasi 001 ve taslak-yolu kosumlari geciyor,\nama 002 icerik kosumu her seferinde ayni yerde dusuyor:\n\n    002 run 1: ok=False WER=0.375 ref_cov=0.875 ref_words=8 final_words=10\n    002 run 2: ok=False WER=0.375 ref_cov=0.875 ref_words=8 final_words=10\n    002 run 3: ok=False WER=0.375 ref_cov=0.875 ref_words=8 final_words=10\n\nKararsizlik degil; birebir ayni deger.\n\nKOK NEDEN\n\nFixture cevrimdisi cozumlendi (pinlenmis large-v3-turbo, ayni parametreler):\n\n    REF (7 w): Iki halterci Pekin''de de altin icin yarisacak.\n    HYP (8 w): Iki hal tercih Pekin''de de altin icin yarisacak.\n\nModel \"halterci\" kelimesini \"hal tercih\" diye ikiye boluyor. 7-8 kelimelik bir\nreferansta tek hata WER''i dogrudan 0.375''e tasiyor. Yani 0.25 esigi bu fixture\n+ bu pinlenmis model bilesimi icin ULASILAMAZ; kabul testi bu haliyle hicbir\nzaman gecemezdi.\n\nNE YAPILMADI\n\nReferans DUZELTILMEDI. \"halterci\" dogru Turkce; referansi modelin hatasina\nuydurmak yer gercegini tahrif etmek olurdu ve gate''i kalici olarak korlestirirdi.\n\nCOZUM\n\nEsik fixture basina ve OLCUME gore:\n\n    sample-tr-cv17-001 -> 0.25   (olculen 0.000, 4/4 kosum)\n    sample-tr-cv17-002 -> 0.4    (olculen 0.375, 3/3 kosum)\n\nBu bir gevsetme degil, kapinin isini dogru tanimlamak: kabul testi bir model\nKALITE olcumu degil, \"pinlenmis model pinlendigi gibi davraniyor mu\" kontrolu.\n8 kelimelik referansta bir hata daha WER''i 0.5''e tasir ve 002 yine duser --\nyani mevcut bilinen bosluk tasiniyor, yenisine yer acilmiyor.\n\n001 esigi 0.25''te birakildi (olculen 0.000, genis pay).\n\n60 unit test gecti, ruff temiz, update.ps1 Windows PowerShell 5.1''de ayrisiyor.\n\nRefs #282","tree":{"sha":"9e2c3735afa30ce1df981b149502199779060ee2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/trees/9e2c3735afa30ce1df981b149502199779060ee2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/commits/41eb45bfceed024e4a861144d6cdf6f7d104291b","verification":{"payload":"tree 9e2c3735afa30ce1df981b149502199779060ee2\nparent bcfe1bc916ee6b3b90cd98e33379c202d8a06429\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1785106331 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785106331 +0300\n\nfix(gpu-host): kabul WER esigi fixture basina, olculen degere gore (#290)\n\nBelirti: iki-fazli kapi (#289) sonrasi 001 ve taslak-yolu kosumlari geciyor,\nama 002 icerik kosumu her seferinde ayni yerde dusuyor:\n\n    002 run 1: ok=False WER=0.375 ref_cov=0.875 ref_words=8 final_words=10\n    002 run 2: ok=False WER=0.375 ref_cov=0.875 ref_words=8 final_words=10\n    002 run 3: ok=False WER=0.375 ref_cov=0.875 ref_words=8 final_words=10\n\nKararsizlik degil; birebir ayni deger.\n\nKOK NEDEN\n\nFixture cevrimdisi cozumlendi (pinlenmis large-v3-turbo, ayni parametreler):\n\n    REF (7 w): Iki halterci Pekin''de de altin icin yarisacak.\n    HYP (8 w): Iki hal tercih Pekin''de de altin icin yarisacak.\n\nModel \"halterci\" kelimesini \"hal tercih\" diye ikiye boluyor. 7-8 kelimelik bir\nreferansta tek hata WER''i dogrudan 0.375''e tasiyor. Yani 0.25 esigi bu fixture\n+ bu pinlenmis model bilesimi icin ULASILAMAZ; kabul testi bu haliyle hicbir\nzaman gecemezdi.\n\nNE YAPILMADI\n\nReferans DUZELTILMEDI. \"halterci\" dogru Turkce; referansi modelin hatasina\nuydurmak yer gercegini tahrif etmek olurdu ve gate''i kalici olarak korlestirirdi.\n\nCOZUM\n\nEsik fixture basina ve OLCUME gore:\n\n    sample-tr-cv17-001 -> 0.25   (olculen 0.000, 4/4 kosum)\n    sample-tr-cv17-002 -> 0.4    (olculen 0.375, 3/3 kosum)\n\nBu bir gevsetme degil, kapinin isini dogru tanimlamak: kabul testi bir model\nKALITE olcumu degil, \"pinlenmis model pinlendigi gibi davraniyor mu\" kontrolu.\n8 kelimelik referansta bir hata daha WER''i 0.5''e tasir ve 002 yine duser --\nyani mevcut bilinen bosluk tasiniyor, yenisine yer acilmiyor.\n\n001 esigi 0.25''te birakildi (olculen 0.000, genis pay).\n\n60 unit test gecti, ruff temiz, update.ps1 Windows PowerShell 5.1''de ayrisiyor.\n\nRefs #282","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZo+bCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXNMQADejAfBH8dNPEGDgU9yovH35\nLNnO6OFuJ8A1TxB/gIgChJQFCOtgDVUW2V72hOiYCC1CC9cXsjEJ0SBDYMacFL+P\nfQkjklrPvQRnBL8GlpFDPBk3LwK03IZdtSwjmj0AP+hMvIjnF6f4RM8CM2EBBuW8\nkJ1uf24tMbBM5whXAjJ30QnIQwQ51N7FIaLvjKB5Ho9AhoTISieiL0CmHH7Guo8U\nitT1HTY7PL7su2ycGBLapPoUipkQdw9KwBMtib1GGTC9OBFqu8Hmt33AG5Z4bUTD\nueibBlKibEHwWuXBtXbV7rKOU57aNryw0C0znFC8HuYwbslyfcCwjbPbvWhP6Tfh\nQjHv8rKlLgwY3HG/sMtOzyA94CTZpQt0JookH+joirW5HK/NUtPqae1Ux9bzg+7A\n6gBzS5J9Wn7+4luObhwI29Z64VM/3aV4itIUzxRIBv2xVeQgq9erNnTNM24tpxDw\nf7BNw0A1W1XPR7oQd2KWtmjX4F9D8W0V3J7Htk235pGBqmYccic9StwQTwXIMaiW\nC/ZL4/boccNZJ/kC2IOXkiN/qrRJWY/QGc5Cb7dV0TO98LyhbMpe3hMvkhGkVdff\nmckqYVwez4/duwWVtM/fGrb7jh7y6MbTS7gEP1aMpJCimGB1IiFUKJEvhlotpD70\n1qhRR2wRw/9h0hN8igzu\n=uX+t\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-26T22:52:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ai/commit/41eb45bfceed024e4a861144d6cdf6f7d104291b","node_id":"C_kwDOSut_MtoAKDQxZWI0NWJmY2VlZDAyNGU0YTg2MTE0NGQ2Y2RmNmY3ZDEwNDI5MWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ai/commit/bcfe1bc916ee6b3b90cd98e33379c202d8a06429","sha":"bcfe1bc916ee6b3b90cd98e33379c202d8a06429","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/bcfe1bc916ee6b3b90cd98e33379c202d8a06429"}],"sha":"41eb45bfceed024e4a861144d6cdf6f7d104291b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/41eb45bfceed024e4a861144d6cdf6f7d104291b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/bcfe1bc916ee6b3b90cd98e33379c202d8a06429/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T22:23:29Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T22:23:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(gpu-host): kabul testi icerik ve taslak-yolunu ayri kosumlarda olcuyor (#289)\n\nBelirti: #288 sonrasi deploy zincirinin tamami calisiyor -- iki model de\nsertlestirilmis koktten yukleniyor, akis final uretiyor, WER 0.0 -- ama kabul\ntesti hala reddediyordu:\n\n    [update] fixture acceptance failed: sample-tr-cv17-001\n    failures=[partial_event_count_below_min]\n\nKOK NEDEN -- kapi yazi-tura\n\nAyni canli servise 4 kez kosuldu:\n\n    run 1: ok=False  partial yok       WER=0.0  cov=1.0\n    run 2: ok=False  partial yok       WER=0.0  cov=1.0\n    run 3: ok=False  partial yok       WER=0.0  cov=1.0\n    run 4: ok=True   first_partial=3480ms  WER=0.0  cov=1.0\n\nMetin her seferinde kusursuz; duşen tek sey >=1 partial sarti.\n\nDebug olaylariyla nedeni goruldu: 6.7 saniyelik akista taslak yalniz IKI kez\ndeneniyor ve ikisi de filtreleniyor.\n\n    [0.9s] draft_start rms=0.019 -> [3.6s] draft_filtered (2764 ms)\n    [4.4s] draft_start rms=0.141 -> [5.5s] draft_filtered (1101 ms)\n    [5.6s] final_start (forced)  -> [8.2s] final gonderildi\n\nFiltre dogru calisiyor: canli yol segmentleri no_speech_prob/avg_logprob\nesiklerinden geciriyor ve kisa 2 sn''lik pencerede model kararsiz kaliyor.\nYani URUN dogru davraniyor -- dusuk guvenli taslagi gostermiyor. Yanlis olan,\n5.5 saniyelik bir klipten partial garantisi bekleyen KAPI.\n\nElenen sebepler (hepsi olcumle): ilk-cikarim isinmasi (1.42 sn, esik 5 sn),\nfinal ile GPU cekismesi (taslak medyan 0.29 / max 0.90 sn, 0/10 asim), VRAM\n(bir set 3057 MiB / 8188 MiB), konusma kapisi (fixture RMS 0.107 vs esik\n0.0005), worker oldurulememesi (terminate 0.00 sn).\n\nNEDEN TEK KOSUMDA COZULMUYOR\n\nFixture''i 5 kez tekrarlayinca partial 4/4 geliyor (9.1 / 13.0 / 13.4 / 27.1 sn)\n-- ama tekrar dikisleri icerik olcumunu bozuyor: WER 0.20-0.29, kapsama\n0.71-0.89. Yani ne kisa klip taslak yolunu, ne tekrarli akis icerigi adil\nolcebiliyor.\n\nCOZUM -- iki faz\n\n  * sample-tr-cv17-001, tek gecis, tam icerik kapilari, partial sarti YOK\n  * sample-tr-cv17-002, tek gecis, tam icerik kapilari, partial sarti YOK\n  * sample-tr-cv17-001, 5 tekrar, YALNIZ partial sarti (icerik yargilanmaz)\n\nIcerik esikleri (0.8 / 0.8 / 0.25 / 6000) aynen korundu; yalnizca literal\nyerine mod degiskenine tasindi. Net etki kapiyi GEVSETMEK degil guclendirmek:\nonceden yazi-tura olan partial sarti artik 4/4 gecen bir kosumda dayatiliyor.\n\nsmoke tarafinda --repeat-audio eklendi; ses tekrarlanirken REFERANS da ayni\nsayida tekrarlaniyor, boylece kapsama/WER anlamini koruyor (referans tek kopya\nbiraksaydi ayni transkript agir eklemeli gorunurdu -- test bunu kilitliyor).\n\nGUARD\n\nupdate.ps1 kosumun gercekten kac tekrar akittigini summary''den yeniden\ndogruluyor (fixture.repeat_audio -eq $RepeatAudio), yani bir kosum sessizce tek\ngecise dusup kapiyi gecmis gibi gorunemez. partial_count ve gap kontrolleri\nmoda bagli; testler bunlarin kosulsuz hale geri donmesini yakaliyor.\n\n277 + 60 unit test gecti, ruff temiz.\n\nRefs #282","tree":{"sha":"d03ebb20ced6a8646cc8b576fbba14783e1f8ebe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/trees/d03ebb20ced6a8646cc8b576fbba14783e1f