OSUMDA COZULMUYOR\n\nFixture''i 5 kez tekrarlayinca partial 4/4 geliyor (9.1 / 13.0 / 13.4 / 27.1 sn)\n-- ama tekrar dikisleri icerik olcumunu bozuyor: WER 0.20-0.29, kapsama\n0.71-0.89. Yani ne kisa klip taslak yolunu, ne tekrarli akis icerigi adil\nolcebiliyor.\n\nCOZUM -- iki faz\n\n  * sample-tr-cv17-001, tek gecis, tam icerik kapilari, partial sarti YOK\n  * sample-tr-cv17-002, tek gecis, tam icerik kapilari, partial sarti YOK\n  * sample-tr-cv17-001, 5 tekrar, YALNIZ partial sarti (icerik yargilanmaz)\n\nIcerik esikleri (0.8 / 0.8 / 0.25 / 6000) aynen korundu; yalnizca literal\nyerine mod degiskenine tasindi. Net etki kapiyi GEVSETMEK degil guclendirmek:\nonceden yazi-tura olan partial sarti artik 4/4 gecen bir kosumda dayatiliyor.\n\nsmoke tarafinda --repeat-audio eklendi; ses tekrarlanirken REFERANS da ayni\nsayida tekrarlaniyor, boylece kapsama/WER anlamini koruyor (referans tek kopya\nbiraksaydi ayni transkript agir eklemeli gorunurdu -- test bunu kilitliyor).\n\nGUARD\n\nupdate.ps1 kosumun gercekten kac tekrar akittigini summary''den yeniden\ndogruluyor (fixture.repeat_audio -eq $RepeatAudio), yani bir kosum sessizce tek\ngecise dusup kapiyi gecmis gibi gorunemez. partial_count ve gap kontrolleri\nmoda bagli; testler bunlarin kosulsuz hale geri donmesini yakaliyor.\n\n277 + 60 unit test gecti, ruff temiz.\n\nRefs #282","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZojhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgMUQAHQpaRILmA4Sc8so8gIwOLat\nAzR/uV+KnKTDqmL2FUl+2ytsSXnMxsbab/ImQA4gX9WUL8Rgw03Zpj+bPZ3qkOMl\nQfl6L3WdNDoiEizXQOoSVr6CcAc6DHj6fvgyq2OlQzYE/eSMTGdWeLHKbFToGGdt\nonhyo9jcUYZd0H8Lg9lPyLj121KQDcwR+WgmT294sxKcJY85pA4MoUescpfM8zrQ\nBg4NycOepAEjc5xQQWLT+ckMAHqMU6oUO+HgLFZuSHJC/ZN3HInX6+kFiK3iN1x9\nre80jcPj04aO/6/FMEEEduxP/ZFViQk6P/fAx/N8erY3s2s3uAnWn+cRWrYFaXI9\njlTIFB8bqA1oS96JCGvhxWNXs+eRSLyFli4a8avgjCWC8fq8D7t0CtXIUqHRUgxF\nC8UfSHZ+layNONs9+aT7HUWzaHJaWRbHZMupiMC+tUcFMjgjkMcWfCZ+xDdMJ4O+\n+afR/Gu4VeNIFtsnOuPS27V2gYo2buK7vxaMRN5LqnxWG4t9yFA89KSkt3QhRJzY\n+vFqfQ+Ahx7otp3lLHd7OT0uiLXOUKs3AFkSEVBx3EFmPY8J+AYfkHAR/vUXOTZt\nSs7Ko5b04tiKS9ynywruC2tPCVmaqzK/qsLKk7rhzWALBw+RnyMtLGEzExvcypbI\ncxIJWxDcxWi0pbGl1Kq9\n=l41w\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-26T22:23:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ai/commit/bcfe1bc916ee6b3b90cd98e33379c202d8a06429","node_id":"C_kwDOSut_MtoAKGJjZmUxYmM5MTZlZTZiM2I5MGNkOThlMzMzNzljMjAyZDhhMDY0Mjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ai/commit/399de5682ecac3993b972559cbda79fcf0a25322","sha":"399de5682ecac3993b972559cbda79fcf0a25322","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/399de5682ecac3993b972559cbda79fcf0a25322"}],"sha":"bcfe1bc916ee6b3b90cd98e33379c202d8a06429","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/bcfe1bc916ee6b3b90cd98e33379c202d8a06429"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/399de5682ecac3993b972559cbda79fcf0a25322/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T20:32:19Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T20:32:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(live-stt): pinlenmis model dogrulamasi Windows scandir semantigiyle calisiyor (#288)\n\nBelirti: yeni launcher aciliyor, uvicorn baglaniyor, ama her iki model de\non-yuklemede saniyeler icinde dusuyor:\n\n    role=live  attempt=1  RuntimeError  elapsed_sec=2.5\n    role=final attempt=1  RuntimeError  elapsed_sec=16.5\n\nZaman asimi DEGIL (#286 butcesinin cok altinda), VRAM DEGIL (nvidia-smi 0 MiB\nkullanim / 7948 MiB bos), artefakt bozuk DEGIL: ayni dizinden\nWhisperModel(..., device=\"cuda\", compute_type=\"int8\") hem kullanici hem SYSTEM\nbaglaminda 13-14 saniyede yukleniyor.\n\nKOK NEDEN\n\n_stream_model_directory_sha256 bir takas-karsiti (anti-swap) korumasi\nuyguluyor: dizini listelerken kaydettigi stat ile, acilan tanimlayicinin\nos.fstat()''ini karsilastiriyor. Kaydedilen stat os.scandir() girdisinden\ngeliyordu.\n\nWindows''ta os.scandir()''in arkasindaki dizin-numaralandirma API''si ne birim\nseri numarasini ne dosya indeksini tasir. Denetim PC''de olculdu:\n\n    field      scandir  fstat\n    st_dev     0        2659991151\n    st_ino     0        2251799815012715\n    st_size    2257     2257\n    st_mtime_ns  ayni\n    st_ctime_ns  ayni\n\nYani kimlik karsilastirmasi HER dosya icin esitsiz cikiyor ve dogrulama\n\"pinned streaming model file mutated during verification\" ile dusuyor.\nSertlestirilmis model runtime''i Windows''ta hicbir zaman model yukleyemezdi.\n\nAyni yol icin os.lstat() her iki alani da dolduruyor (olculdu: fstat ile\nesit), bu yuzden yol-uzerinden yeniden stat alinarak koruma ZAYIFLATILMADAN\nduzeltildi.\n\nLinux''ta scandir d_ino tasidigi icin fark yapisal olarak gorunmez; bu yuzden\ntest platform farkini taklit ediyor, beklemiyor.\n\nIKINCI DUZELTME -- teshis edilebilirlik\n\nCocuk surec her hatada yalniz istisna SINIFINI bildiriyordu, bu yuzden hata\nsupervisor''dan opak sekilde geciyordu:\n\n    RuntimeError: ValueError\n\nYukleme (load) hatasi bu surece henuz hicbir ses ulasmadan olusur; mesaji\ntranskript icermez, dolayisiyla cikarim hatalarini sinif-adiyla sinirlayan\nKVKK siniri orada gecerli degil. Artik yalniz load yolunda 200 karakterle\nsinirli bir mesaj tasiniyor; cikarim yolu aynen sinif-adi.\n\nTESTLER\n\ntests/unit/test_model_directory_verification.py: os.scandir Windows gibi\ndavranacak sekilde (st_dev=0, st_ino=0) taklit edilir.\n\n  1) digest hesaplanabiliyor\n  2) digest, taklitli ve taklitsiz ayni cikiyor (pin degeri degismiyor)\n  3) eslesen tree digest ile dogrulama geciyor\n  4) GERCEK takas hala yakalaniyor -- os.fstat inode''u degistirildiginde\n     ValueError bekleniyor; boylece \"sikayeti susturmak\" ile \"duzeltmek\"\n     ayirt ediliyor\n\nDuzeltme geri alindiginda 1-3 uretimdeki tam hatayla dusuyor.\n\n275 unit test gecti, ruff temiz, mypy temiz.\n(test_ws_contract.py toplama hatasi bu degisiklikten once de mevcut.)\n\nRefs #282","tree":{"sha":"1ab7caf56164362c2e64d9dffcd74d13af9dfa0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/trees/1ab7caf56164362c2e64d9dffcd74d13af9dfa0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/commits/399de5682ecac3993b972559cbda79fcf0a25322","verification":{"payload":"tree 1ab7caf56164362c2e64d9dffcd74d13af9dfa0e\nparent 985efc02543ca7e7d478062de23984eb9759c570\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1785097939 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785097939 +0300\n\nfix(live-stt): pinlenmis model dogrulamasi Windows scandir semantigiyle calisiyor (#288)\n\nBelirti: yeni launcher aciliyor, uvicorn baglaniyor, ama her iki model de\non-yuklemede saniyeler icinde dusuyor:\n\n    role=live  attempt=1  RuntimeError  elapsed_sec=2.5\n    role=final attempt=1  RuntimeError  elapsed_sec=16.5\n\nZaman asimi DEGIL (#286 butcesinin cok altinda), VRAM DEGIL (nvidia-smi 0 MiB\nkullanim / 7948 MiB bos), artefakt bozuk DEGIL: ayni dizinden\nWhisperModel(..., device=\"cuda\", compute_type=\"int8\") hem kullanici hem SYSTEM\nbaglaminda 13-14 saniyede yukleniyor.\n\nKOK NEDEN\n\n_stream_model_directory_sha256 bir takas-karsiti (anti-swap) korumasi\nuyguluyor: dizini listelerken kaydettigi stat ile, acilan tanimlayicinin\nos.fstat()''ini karsilastiriyor. Kaydedilen stat os.scandir() girdisinden\ngeliyordu.\n\nWindows''ta os.scandir()''in arkasindaki dizin-numaralandirma API''si ne birim\nseri numarasini ne dosya indeksini tasir. Denetim PC''de olculdu:\n\n    field      scandir  fstat\n    st_dev     0        2659991151\n    st_ino     0        2251799815012715\n    st_size    2257     2257\n    st_mtime_ns  ayni\n    st_ctime_ns  ayni\n\nYani kimlik karsilastirmasi HER dosya icin esitsiz cikiyor ve dogrulama\n\"pinned streaming model file mutated during verification\" ile dusuyor.\nSertlestirilmis model runtime''i Windows''ta hicbir zaman model yukleyemezdi.\n\nAyni yol icin os.lstat() her iki alani da dolduruyor (olculdu: fstat ile\nesit), bu yuzden yol-uzerinden yeniden stat alinarak koruma ZAYIFLATILMADAN\nduzeltildi.\n\nLinux''ta scandir d_ino tasidigi icin fark yapisal olarak gorunmez; bu yuzden\ntest platform farkini taklit ediyor, beklemiyor.\n\nIKINCI DUZELTME -- teshis edilebilirlik\n\nCocuk surec her hatada yalniz istisna SINIFINI bildiriyordu, bu yuzden hata\nsupervisor''dan opak sekilde geciyordu:\n\n    RuntimeError: ValueError\n\nYukleme (load) hatasi bu surece henuz hicbir ses ulasmadan olusur; mesaji\ntranskript icermez, dolayisiyla cikarim hatalarini sinif-adiyla sinirlayan\nKVKK siniri orada gecerli degil. Artik yalniz load yolunda 200 karakterle\nsinirli bir mesaj tasiniyor; cikarim yolu aynen sinif-adi.\n\nTESTLER\n\ntests/unit/test_model_directory_verification.py: os.scandir Windows gibi\ndavranacak sekilde (st_dev=0, st_ino=0) taklit edilir.\n\n  1) digest hesaplanabiliyor\n  2) digest, taklitli ve taklitsiz ayni cikiyor (pin degeri degismiyor)\n  3) eslesen tree digest ile dogrulama geciyor\n  4) GERCEK takas hala yakalaniyor -- os.fstat inode''u degistirildiginde\n     ValueError bekleniyor; boylece \"sikayeti susturmak\" ile \"duzeltmek\"\n     ayirt ediliyor\n\nDuzeltme geri alindiginda 1-3 uretimdeki tam hatayla dusuyor.\n\n275 unit test gecti, ruff temiz, mypy temiz.\n(test_ws_contract.py toplama hatasi bu degisiklikten once de mevcut.)\n\nRefs #282","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZm7TCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7wEQAJNWxMjkYG3ip2Bl27HWKVO1\nLcpUgp4ooYtn1YrSmKwuR/JDdaC/1DkE7FIBeDWnmDT0Wr8ka1g5ioy7z+ffR1yf\np/gklPQwxa/E/svDDL4B5goAHsSWjeRIdhjktxpLYgnMPE4raPY29pMuZzrBeJe8\n9a2bOOxVK9LomlauQWogSlQMLX3T3Pn3+zeGhgOdoU0VozsuknJCT5ECYpjy0QWG\ns5Vd+qelLEvu/czrOU2VPCQoUOCJLfkFk5XVdjWU8ztnRnZCE4D5b+AHbcBZ9Zf2\nNEGAYc9Y+PJhF1z0ecRq/WuQjAIa6EP4qZTsqT8Rtt9VCgO0SR75FIJG7rU/Zf3L\nt8TSzcbNUc1/8rv9SYAtdmxm5VGghc9fGydC5IfKa50nT0jcTFftZFJFkExjChvt\niiD3SixWVWEdBGpXmDnC8h1LCAxgtprjDFgI7xJRfaEbjdq6EnUKrkzSW5QEzvx0\nXjEjLrztQodAiVDAiZGZ5MaJ6ktMTgCMbJONiQEVj7zonx/yocVQc1ujvT40pkG7\nb+Q3PX1y6gjaMeitX+3mJkVvwxOwMJLJETZBuV155im1cKDEbUI9RUFKinalByVf\nthwDwHAkC9H6XeUrxqRlhOzkwJlREWDCViLrXhsfyaZfobT/4TyxZjspXjKM/Ehf\nZbSVdnHHR7WNphK9DQaY\n=E9IR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-26T20:32:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ai/commit/399de5682ecac3993b972559cbda79fcf0a25322","node_id":"C_kwDOSut_MtoAKDM5OWRlNTY4MmVjYWMzOTkzYjk3MjU1OWNiZGE3OWZjZjBhMjUzMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ai/commit/985efc02543ca7e7d478062de23984eb9759c570","sha":"985efc02543ca7e7d478062de23984eb9759c570","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/985efc02543ca7e7d478062de23984eb9759c570"}],"sha":"399de5682ecac3993b972559cbda79fcf0a25322","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/399de5682ecac3993b972559cbda79fcf0a25322"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/985efc02543ca7e7d478062de23984eb9759c570/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T19:32:22Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T19:32:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(gpu-host): kabul testi LocalSystem''in ornek XML''ini okuyabiliyor (#287)\n\nBelirti: c97fe7e deploy''u ~60 saniyede reddedildi, rollback da dustu, runtime\nFENCE''lendi (iki task Disabled, servis DOWN). Servis log''unda hicbir satir yok\n-- yani uygulama hic baslatilmadi; kapi cok daha erken.\n\nLedger sebebi: restart-failed-task-contract.\n\nKOK NEDEN\n\nKabul testi task XML''ini schtasks /Query /XML ile okuyup principal''i\ndogruluyor:\n\n    if ([string]$principal.UserId -notin @(\"SYSTEM\",\"S-1-5-18\") -or\n        [string]$principal.LogonType -ne \"ServiceAccount\" -or ...\n\nWindows Task Scheduler varsayilan degerini tasiyan elemanlari YAZMAZ ve\nS-1-5-18 icin LogonType''i hicbir zaman yazmaz: LocalSystem''in interaktif\noturumu yoktur, ServiceAccount tek anlamidir. Canli host''ta olculdu:\n\n    <Principal id=\"Author\">\n      <UserId>S-1-5-18</UserId>\n      <RunLevel>HighestAvailable</RunLevel>\n    </Principal>\n\nSet-StrictMode altinda eksik eleman `$principal.LogonType` erisimini\nFIRLATTIRIYOR. Yani kod \"principal-invalid\" verdictine bile ulasamiyor:\n\n    Reason=''The property ''LogonType'' cannot be found on this object.''\n\nSonuc: install.ps1''in URETTIGI principal, kabul testi tarafindan okunamiyordu.\n\nNEDEN CI YAKALAMADI\n\ntests/windows/.../test-live-stt-restart-acceptance.ps1 fixture''i XML''i elle\nyaziyor ve LogonType''i ACIKCA ekliyor -- Windows''un SYSTEM icin uretmedigi bir\nsekil. Kurgu gercegi yansitmadigi icin okuyucu yesil kaliyordu. (#283''teki\nharf-durumu ve #284''teki cift git.exe ile ayni sinif: gercek ariza yuzeyi\ntestin gordugu yuzeyde yok.)\n\nCOZUM\n\nPrincipal cocuklari SelectSingleNode ile okunuyor; eksik eleman dokumante\nedilmis varsayilani olarak degerlendiriliyor. Guvenlik niyeti AYNEN korunuyor:\n\n  - eksik LogonType yalnizca LocalSystem icin ServiceAccount sayilir\n  - baska bir kimlikte eksiklik zimni servis girisi DEGILDIR -> fail\n  - acik ama yanlis LogonType -> fail\n  - eksik RunLevel = LeastPrivilege -> fail\n\nKANIT -- gercek canli task''lar\n\n    once : Valid=False Reason=''The property ''LogonType'' cannot be found...''\n    sonra: Valid=True  (platform-ai-live-stt + platform-ai-meeting-ai)\n\nYeni test durumlari Windows''un gercek seklini kullaniyor ve dort fail-closed\nyolunu ayri ayri kilitliyor.\n\nRefs #282","tree":{"sha":"07773a513c6db3a28c439604164e7fb1a7a7adc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/trees/07773a513c6db3a28c439604164e7fb1a7a7adc6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/commits/985efc02543ca7e7d478062de23984eb9759c570","verification":{"payload":"tree 07773a513c6db3a28c439604164e7fb1a7a7adc6\nparent c97fe7e4d39140e4b3fcbaddfe6b556bd3e5729c\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1785094342 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785094342 +0300\n\nfix(gpu-host): kabul testi LocalSystem''in ornek XML''ini okuyabiliyor (#287)\n\nBelirti: c97fe7e deploy''u ~60 saniyede reddedildi, rollback da dustu, runtime\nFENCE''lendi (iki task Disabled, servis DOWN). Servis log''unda hicbir satir yok\n-- yani uygulama hic baslatilmadi; kapi cok daha erken.\n\nLedger sebebi: restart-failed-task-contract.\n\nKOK NEDEN\n\nKabul testi task XML''ini schtasks /Query /XML ile okuyup principal''i\ndogruluyor:\n\n    if ([string]$principal.UserId -notin @(\"SYSTEM\",\"S-1-5-18\") -or\n        [string]$principal.LogonType -ne \"ServiceAccount\" -or ...\n\nWindows Task Scheduler varsayilan degerini tasiyan elemanlari YAZMAZ ve\nS-1-5-18 icin LogonType''i hicbir zaman yazmaz: LocalSystem''in interaktif\noturumu yoktur, ServiceAccount tek anlamidir. Canli host''ta olculdu:\n\n    <Principal id=\"Author\">\n      <UserId>S-1-5-18</UserId>\n      <RunLevel>HighestAvailable</RunLevel>\n    </Principal>\n\nSet-StrictMode altinda eksik eleman `$principal.LogonType` erisimini\nFIRLATTIRIYOR. Yani kod \"principal-invalid\" verdictine bile ulasamiyor:\n\n    Reason=''The property ''LogonType'' cannot be found on this object.''\n\nSonuc: install.ps1''in URETTIGI principal, kabul testi tarafindan okunamiyordu.\n\nNEDEN CI YAKALAMADI\n\ntests/windows/.../test-live-stt-restart-acceptance.ps1 fixture''i XML''i elle\nyaziyor ve LogonType''i ACIKCA ekliyor -- Windows''un SYSTEM icin uretmedigi bir\nsekil. Kurgu gercegi yansitmadigi icin okuyucu yesil kaliyordu. (#283''teki\nharf-durumu ve #284''teki cift git.exe ile ayni sinif: gercek ariza yuzeyi\ntestin gordugu yuzeyde yok.)\n\nCOZUM\n\nPrincipal cocuklari SelectSingleNode ile okunuyor; eksik eleman dokumante\nedilmis varsayilani olarak degerlendiriliyor. Guvenlik niyeti AYNEN korunuyor:\n\n  - eksik LogonType yalnizca LocalSystem icin ServiceAccount sayilir\n  - baska bir kimlikte eksiklik zimni servis girisi DEGILDIR -> fail\n  - acik ama yanlis LogonType -> fail\n  - eksik RunLevel = LeastPrivilege -> fail\n\nKANIT -- gercek canli task''lar\n\n    once : Valid=False Reason=''The property ''LogonType'' cannot be found...''\n    sonra: Valid=True  (platform-ai-live-stt + platform-ai-meeting-ai)\n\nYeni test durumlari Windows''un gercek seklini kullaniyor ve dort fail-closed\nyolunu ayri ayri kilitliyor.\n\nRefs #282","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZmDGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArwQQAE5sRaAldQ7IfhFmf1k1hGFp\nkprUzdOIMJjJTI8Ot5HW3+rkELifsv8W2ncvOMPR4TqMeDzCmjR91I7+AMsZrslh\nDm+OI7Cvf3sh9oWneA256rq9l+o73IdJY/jGp2lm+JVix8TheGS2lnxZ9w9R6vav\n3vcZVNGjOD5FIFPwvZVieJzqyI8l9VqWFWl1Kiv0ADFdFIO843eT0R/IEfI5TMVU\nrDLFkuGRA13Mh9QyiqWPnaV5MBAR1hsn5Noi1FyXCejuHmz8pynTFLSBAunxb+QU\n/iEJQ38W8MMSYOMx6ElTa9UVeBkTfevIt4+zMpLzPttR9s41a1XQ4LbiCxs7Nu+b\nHle/p5AHYdT+Lr5xtbqGMU5SxOue6/6pgYE3fxXK7M7eyLCHDeC+qQ0jBX2RVmPk\n4Zd4HMcGsp3odCH4iLofbYZlKapnIauFTJTjfzW7W9r31ddjrRp93fF8OI5+18Qg\n5OPZppMSufuwrxBvNumHC2XvkF89yYHTM4dD0JRUNhzziWNn5wqx8koBZczX5KPs\nlyFvRqylNvkcA0hnpFBDHCxx7ltKddTeLse1ti1IxF3Jwc0PpLVecQqSYQ8kgM9L\nHFA+ilYO3cJ1wmFJQjpd6HiyxCPfyPa+N8T0sWT7fi4HPig5KxS43dq5OVqZAiSF\njCx4/pnAvf0Mp5xbXgD9\n=/Cdb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-26T19:32:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ai/commit/985efc02543ca7e7d478062de23984eb9759c570","node_id":"C_kwDOSut_MtoAKDk4NWVmYzAyNTQzY2E3ZTdkNDc4MDYyZGUyMzk4NGViOTc1OWM1NzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ai/commit/c97fe7e4d39140e4b3fcbaddfe6b556bd3e5729c","sha":"c97fe7e4d39140e4b3fcbaddfe6b556bd3e5729c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/c97fe7e4d39140e4b3fcbaddfe6b556bd3e5729c"}],"sha":"985efc02543ca7e7d478062de23984eb9759c570","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/985efc02543ca7e7d478062de23984eb9759c570"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/c97fe7e4d39140e4b3fcbaddfe6b556bd3e5729c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T19:19:13Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T19:19:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(live-stt): final model preload butcesi olculen yukleme suresine gore ayarlandi (#286)\n\nBelirti: 2a2d828 deploy''u kabul testinde reddedildi, otomatik rollback da\ndustu, runtime FENCE''lendi (iki task Disabled, 8200/8300 sessiz, servis DOWN).\n\nOnemli olan: launcher bu kez BASARIYLA ACILDI. git cozumlemesi (#284), model\nkok dogrulamasi ve manifest okumasi (#283), task action sozlesmesi (#285) --\nhepsi gecti, uvicorn 8200''e baglandi, live model 15.8 sn''de yuklendi. Duşen\ntek sey final modelin on-yuklemesiydi.\n\nKOK NEDEN -- olculen deger\n\nGPU host (RTX 4070 Laptop, 8 GiB), pinlenmis large-v3-turbo (model.bin\n1.54 GiB), spawn edilen worker''a yukleme:\n\n    2026-07-26 19:38:14  role=final preloaded  elapsed_sec=160.6\n    2026-07-26 21:03:52  role=final preloaded  elapsed_sec=167.9\n    2026-07-26 21:30:47  role=final FAILED     elapsed_sec=180.1  WorkerTimeoutError\n\nButce 180 sn idi -- olculen yukleme suresinin yaklasik %7 uzerinde. Sıradan\nvaryans (zaten yuklu live modelin VRAM baskisi, CUDA context init, soguk sayfa\nonbellegi) bu araligi asiyor. Yani esik yanlis yerdeydi; kod degil.\n\nNEDEN \"biraz artir\" YETMEZ -- asimetrik risk\n\nOn-yukleme zaman asimi burada yumusak bir hata degil: fail-closed readiness\nnedeniyle deploy reddediliyor; reddedilen bir deploy''un rollback''i de duserse\nruntime fence''leniyor ve SERVIS KAPANIYOR (bu oturumda iki kez yasandi).\nBuna karsilik fazla buyuk bir tavanin tek maliyeti, gercekten takilmis bir\nyuklemeyi fark etmenin gecikmesi. Bu yuzden butce olculen maksimumun ~2 kati.\n\n    LiveSttModelLoadTimeoutSec  180 -> 360\n\nOkuma bütçesi turetilmis bir tavandir, serbest parametre degil; dosyanin\nsonundaki guard zorluyor:\n\n    2 rol * ((2 deneme * (360 + 2*2)) + 1 backoff) + 150 + 60 = 1668\n    LiveSttReadinessDeadlineSec 960 -> 1800    (1668 <= 1800 OK)\n\nREGRESYON GUARD -- sihirli sayi yerine turetilmis degismez\n\nEski test `\"LiveSttReadinessDeadlineSec = 960\"` literalini ariyordu; bu, model\nyukleme butcesinin olculen sureye dogru geri cekilmesini yakalamaz. Yeni test\ndegerleri sozlesmeden ayristirip aritmetigi YENIDEN HESAPLIYOR ve su ucunu\ndogruluyor:\n\n  1) load timeout >= 2 * olculen en yavas on-yukleme (167.9 sn)\n  2) acceptance worst case <= readiness deadline (launcher aksi halde firlatir)\n  3) readiness deadline <= config.py''daki pydantic `le` siniri -- cunku\n     update.ps1 runtime''in bildirdigi preload_budget_sec''in sozlesmeyle TAM\n     esit olmasini istiyor; sinir asilirsa servis review''da degil ACILISTA\n     reddederdi\n\nEski 180/960 degerlerine karsi test dusuyor:\n\n    AssertionError: 180 not greater than or equal to 335.8\n\n78 unit test gecti.\n\nRefs #282","tree":{"sha":"cb1a6bbf34f08c8477680769690a9ebb31aa1d6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/trees/cb1a6bbf34f08c8477680769690a9ebb31aa1d6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/commits/c97fe7e4d39140e4b3fcbaddfe6b556bd3e5729c","verification":{"payload":"tree cb1a6bbf34f08c8477680769690a9ebb31aa1d6d\nparent 2a2d82877e55fdd27e8c39c2abb79fd2d52a7c98\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1785093553 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785093553 +0300\n\nfix(live-stt): final model preload butcesi olculen yukleme suresine gore ayarlandi (#286)\n\nBelirti: 2a2d828 deploy''u kabul testinde reddedildi, otomatik rollback da\ndustu, runtime FENCE''lendi (iki task Disabled, 8200/8300 sessiz, servis DOWN).\n\nOnemli olan: launcher bu kez BASARIYLA ACILDI. git cozumlemesi (#284), model\nkok dogrulamasi ve manifest okumasi (#283), task action sozlesmesi (#285) --\nhepsi gecti, uvicorn 8200''e baglandi, live model 15.8 sn''de yuklendi. Duşen\ntek sey final modelin on-yuklemesiydi.\n\nKOK NEDEN -- olculen deger\n\nGPU host (RTX 4070 Laptop, 8 GiB), pinlenmis large-v3-turbo (model.bin\n1.54 GiB), spawn edilen worker''a yukleme:\n\n    2026-07-26 19:38:14  role=final preloaded  elapsed_sec=160.6\n    2026-07-26 21:03:52  role=final preloaded  elapsed_sec=167.9\n    2026-07-26 21:30:47  role=final FAILED     elapsed_sec=180.1  WorkerTimeoutError\n\nButce 180 sn idi -- olculen yukleme suresinin yaklasik %7 uzerinde. Sıradan\nvaryans (zaten yuklu live modelin VRAM baskisi, CUDA context init, soguk sayfa\nonbellegi) bu araligi asiyor. Yani esik yanlis yerdeydi; kod degil.\n\nNEDEN \"biraz artir\" YETMEZ -- asimetrik risk\n\nOn-yukleme zaman asimi burada yumusak bir hata degil: fail-closed readiness\nnedeniyle deploy reddediliyor; reddedilen bir deploy''un rollback''i de duserse\nruntime fence''leniyor ve SERVIS KAPANIYOR (bu oturumda iki kez yasandi).\nBuna karsilik fazla buyuk bir tavanin tek maliyeti, gercekten takilmis bir\nyuklemeyi fark etmenin gecikmesi. Bu yuzden butce olculen maksimumun ~2 kati.\n\n    LiveSttModelLoadTimeoutSec  180 -> 360\n\nOkuma bütçesi turetilmis bir tavandir, serbest parametre degil; dosyanin\nsonundaki guard zorluyor:\n\n    2 rol * ((2 deneme * (360 + 2*2)) + 1 backoff) + 150 + 60 = 1668\n    LiveSttReadinessDeadlineSec 960 -> 1800    (1668 <= 1800 OK)\n\nREGRESYON GUARD -- sihirli sayi yerine turetilmis degismez\n\nEski test `\"LiveSttReadinessDeadlineSec = 960\"` literalini ariyordu; bu, model\nyukleme butcesinin olculen sureye dogru geri cekilmesini yakalamaz. Yeni test\ndegerleri sozlesmeden ayristirip aritmetigi YENIDEN HESAPLIYOR ve su ucunu\ndogruluyor:\n\n  1) load timeout >= 2 * olculen en yavas on-yukleme (167.9 sn)\n  2) acceptance worst case <= readiness deadline (launcher aksi halde firlatir)\n  3) readiness deadline <= config.py''daki pydantic `le` siniri -- cunku\n     update.ps1 runtime''in bildirdigi preload_budget_sec''in sozlesmeyle TAM\n     esit olmasini istiyor; sinir asilirsa servis review''da degil ACILISTA\n     reddederdi\n\nEski 180/960 degerlerine karsi test dusuyor:\n\n    AssertionError: 180 not greater than or equal to 335.8\n\n78 unit test gecti.\n\nRefs #282","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZl2xCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhIkQAF4mlcGjInZqkm8w0ugzEDwj\