abb79fd2d52a7c98","sha":"2a2d82877e55fdd27e8c39c2abb79fd2d52a7c98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/2a2d82877e55fdd27e8c39c2abb79fd2d52a7c98"}],"sha":"c97fe7e4d39140e4b3fcbaddfe6b556bd3e5729c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/c97fe7e4d39140e4b3fcbaddfe6b556bd3e5729c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/2a2d82877e55fdd27e8c39c2abb79fd2d52a7c98/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T19:01:46Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T19:01:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(gpu-host): task action sozlesmesi dagitilan AppEnv''i tasiyabiliyor (#285)\n\nBelirti: deploy kabul testi restart asamasinda duserken ledger''a sunu yazdi:\n\n    automatic-rollback-failed-restart-failed-task-contract\n\nBu yalniz ileri deploy''u degil ROLLBACK''i de dusuruyordu, yani basarisiz her\ndeploy runtime''i fence''liyordu (iki task Disabled, 8200/8300 sessiz).\n\nKOK NEDEN\n\nrestart-acceptance.ps1 her iki task''i da Get-GpuHostTaskActionContract''tan\ngeciriyor. Canli denetim PC''de olculdu (2026-07-26):\n\n    platform-ai-live-stt    : Valid=False   (Execute ciplak ''powershell.exe'')\n    platform-ai-meeting-ai  : Valid=False   (ciplak-izinle BILE gecersiz)\n\nmeeting-ai''nin gecersizligi ayri ve daha ciddi bir sebepten: ayristirici\ntoken''lari saydiktan sonra `if ($index -ne $tokens.Count) { return $result }`\ndiyor, ama dagitilan action `-AppEnv test` tasiyor. Sozlesmede o token icin\nYER YOK.\n\nNEDEN \"kanoniklestirip gecmek\" YANLIS OLURDU\n\nstart-meeting-ai.ps1 kendi yorumunda diyor ki:\n\n    # The Scheduled Task action is the authoritative deployed environment.\n    # Runtime config may confirm it, but must never downgrade it.\n\nve onayli runtime config farkli bir ortam beyan ederse baslangicta firlatiyor:\n\n    \"Meeting-ai runtime config environment does not match the launcher.\"\n\nParametre varsayilani ise \"stage\". Dolayisiyla -AppEnv''i dusurup action''i\n\"kanoniklestirmek\", test olarak dagitilmis bir host''u sessizce stage''e cevirir;\nruntime config test dedigi icin launcher HIC ACILMAZ. Yani sozlesme,\nlauncher''in kendi yetki modeliyle celisiyordu: action yetkili kaynak ilan\nedilmis ama o bilgiyi ifade edemiyor.\n\nCOZUM\n\nSozlesme meeting-ai icin optional `-AppEnv <test|stage|prod>` tasiyor. Deger\nkumesi launcher''in ValidateSet''iyle ayni tutuluyor. live-stt bunu kabul\netmiyor. Token yoksa davranis aynen eskisi gibi (launcher varsayilani).\n\nKANIT — gercek canli task action''lari, yeni sozlesme\n\n    platform-ai-live-stt    : Valid=True   AppEnv=''''\n    platform-ai-meeting-ai  : Valid=True   AppEnv=''test''\n\nYani dagitilan gerceklik artik oldugu gibi tanimlanabiliyor; migrate/restart\nyolu onu yeniden yazmadan koruyor.\n\nYeni sozlesme iddialari gercek Windows PowerShell 5.1.26100.8875 uzerinde\nkosuldu ve gecti (round-trip: CanonicalArguments == uretilen arguman).\n\nKAPSAM DISI (bilerek)\n\ninstall.ps1''e -AppEnv parametresi EKLENMEDI. Taze kurulumun davranisi bu PR\nile degismiyor; degistirmek bu host''ta dogrulanamayan bir taze-kurulum\nsemantigi olurdu. Mevcut host''un action''i zaten -AppEnv test tasiyor ve artik\nsozlesmeden geciyor.\n\nRefs #282","tree":{"sha":"9e32e36b13eab9c0fc14f9645bf3c37d287a86ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/trees/9e32e36b13eab9c0fc14f9645bf3c37d287a86ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/commits/2a2d82877e55fdd27e8c39c2abb79fd2d52a7c98","verification":{"payload":"tree 9e32e36b13eab9c0fc14f9645bf3c37d287a86ca\nparent e8d566e9ac61f6a346b9de70d0e1ff24d2844ac8\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1785092506 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785092506 +0300\n\nfix(gpu-host): task action sozlesmesi dagitilan AppEnv''i tasiyabiliyor (#285)\n\nBelirti: deploy kabul testi restart asamasinda duserken ledger''a sunu yazdi:\n\n    automatic-rollback-failed-restart-failed-task-contract\n\nBu yalniz ileri deploy''u degil ROLLBACK''i de dusuruyordu, yani basarisiz her\ndeploy runtime''i fence''liyordu (iki task Disabled, 8200/8300 sessiz).\n\nKOK NEDEN\n\nrestart-acceptance.ps1 her iki task''i da Get-GpuHostTaskActionContract''tan\ngeciriyor. Canli denetim PC''de olculdu (2026-07-26):\n\n    platform-ai-live-stt    : Valid=False   (Execute ciplak ''powershell.exe'')\n    platform-ai-meeting-ai  : Valid=False   (ciplak-izinle BILE gecersiz)\n\nmeeting-ai''nin gecersizligi ayri ve daha ciddi bir sebepten: ayristirici\ntoken''lari saydiktan sonra `if ($index -ne $tokens.Count) { return $result }`\ndiyor, ama dagitilan action `-AppEnv test` tasiyor. Sozlesmede o token icin\nYER YOK.\n\nNEDEN \"kanoniklestirip gecmek\" YANLIS OLURDU\n\nstart-meeting-ai.ps1 kendi yorumunda diyor ki:\n\n    # The Scheduled Task action is the authoritative deployed environment.\n    # Runtime config may confirm it, but must never downgrade it.\n\nve onayli runtime config farkli bir ortam beyan ederse baslangicta firlatiyor:\n\n    \"Meeting-ai runtime config environment does not match the launcher.\"\n\nParametre varsayilani ise \"stage\". Dolayisiyla -AppEnv''i dusurup action''i\n\"kanoniklestirmek\", test olarak dagitilmis bir host''u sessizce stage''e cevirir;\nruntime config test dedigi icin launcher HIC ACILMAZ. Yani sozlesme,\nlauncher''in kendi yetki modeliyle celisiyordu: action yetkili kaynak ilan\nedilmis ama o bilgiyi ifade edemiyor.\n\nCOZUM\n\nSozlesme meeting-ai icin optional `-AppEnv <test|stage|prod>` tasiyor. Deger\nkumesi launcher''in ValidateSet''iyle ayni tutuluyor. live-stt bunu kabul\netmiyor. Token yoksa davranis aynen eskisi gibi (launcher varsayilani).\n\nKANIT — gercek canli task action''lari, yeni sozlesme\n\n    platform-ai-live-stt    : Valid=True   AppEnv=''''\n    platform-ai-meeting-ai  : Valid=True   AppEnv=''test''\n\nYani dagitilan gerceklik artik oldugu gibi tanimlanabiliyor; migrate/restart\nyolu onu yeniden yazmadan koruyor.\n\nYeni sozlesme iddialari gercek Windows PowerShell 5.1.26100.8875 uzerinde\nkosuldu ve gecti (round-trip: CanonicalArguments == uretilen arguman).\n\nKAPSAM DISI (bilerek)\n\ninstall.ps1''e -AppEnv parametresi EKLENMEDI. Taze kurulumun davranisi bu PR\nile degismiyor; degistirmek bu host''ta dogrulanamayan bir taze-kurulum\nsemantigi olurdu. Mevcut host''un action''i zaten -AppEnv test tasiyor ve artik\nsozlesmeden geciyor.\n\nRefs #282","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZlmaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAleMQAJpmcGVSJnXSaB7YJMA+LoEZ\n6ksvBJY9qpHv7ljV93gd20BCojKOBzYoWP0aot6IQ9Hzp1mhmrG3ghu99yVpvcXS\nsT7oxv+xVrjJaJB8cEottE/JnDlmhLqOpikyHp3+p4C5F2o09DqQWihbPyYngxwr\n8X//neQeDfpepTwi7WEdk1R/OuYRK3pgoPDDUtgRiQ0ch5pZEoErK6d7qS+alLCx\nqvPd3GQxwoP3t8Of9L4WTDB9kGWyqxXoZH1VJHjAADVdll7ygIlHsyVDu6pEj1fY\nROYadWiDW39wwihZFx0MODxQhhrIAvUQcangTeLMch1R2HYSn/SOeRcbSaXN8PBj\nD6vtJ7VPWuQpmIUD7u7Ve4P/jDqY9IEtu8Bl5oNo29DzemMrpuMeP8pShFEOiRI3\nMAlDMU4LSUfAAk1J6s3lkw/HrvxN+yvayG1uqrO