pi.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/e8d566e9ac61f6a346b9de70d0e1ff24d2844ac8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T18:47:23Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T18:47:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(gpu-host): launcher git.exe cozumlemesi tek eslesmeye indirildi (#284)\n\nBelirti: live-stt launcher her aciliste 170. satirda oluyordu:\n\n    CommandNotFoundException: The term ''C:\\Program Files\\Git\\cmd\\git.exe\n    C:\\Program Files\\Git\\bin\\git.exe'' is not recognized...\n\nDosya diskte var, Test-Path True donuyor, Get-Command git calisiyor -- ama\nlauncher yine de acilmiyordu. Bu yuzden #280 (taslak arizasi duzeltmesi)\ncanliya alinamiyordu.\n\nKOK NEDEN\n\nGit for Windows git.exe''yi HEM cmd\\ HEM bin\\ altina kuruyor ve ikisini de\nmakine PATH''ine ekliyor. Dolayisiyla:\n\n    Get-Command git.exe -CommandType Application   -> 2 CommandInfo\n    $gitCommand.Source                             -> 2 elemanli Object[]\n    & $gitExe ...                                  -> dizi $OFS ile tek bir\n                                                      bosluklu komut adina\n                                                      donusuyor\n\nDenetim PC''de olculdu (2026-07-26):\n\n    type   : System.Object[]\n    count  : 2\n    srcVal : [C:\\Program Files\\Git\\cmd\\git.exe][C:\\Program Files\\Git\\bin\\git.exe]\n\nCOZUM\n\nAyni dosya agacinda dogru deyim zaten vardi -- meeting-ai-runtime-env.ps1:833\nPython yorumlayicisini `| Select-Object -First 1` ile tekillestiriyor. Launcher\nayni deyime hizalandi. Duzeltilmis ifade gercek host''ta dogrulandi:\n\n    resolved: C:\\Program Files\\Git\\cmd\\git.exe\n    exit    : 0\n    commit  : 512e9cc0fe4368d3cc91759dcd48756e54c2ad63  (40-hex OK)\n\nAYNI SINIFTAN IKINCI HATA (varsayimsal degil)\n\ninstall.ps1:153 `(Get-Command python).Source` ile yorumlayici yolunu cozup\nScheduled Task action''ina KALICI olarak yaziyordu. Ayni host''ta olculdu:\n\n    python match count: 2\n\nYani ilk kurulumda gorev action''ina bosluk-birlesik, calistirilamaz bir yol\nyazilabilirdi; bir launcher hatasindan daha genis etki alani. O da tekillestirildi.\n\nREGRESYON GUARD\n\ntest_get_command_executable_resolutions_are_singular deploy/gpu-host icindeki\nTUM ps1 dosyalarini tarar: bir Get-Command sonucu .Source''a besleniyorsa\n`Select-Object -First 1` ile tekillestirilmis olmali. Yalniz varlik-sinamalari\ncogul kalabilir (dogruluk degeri disinda kullanilmiyorlar).\n\nTest origin/main''e karsi IKI hatayi da yakaliyor:\n\n    AssertionError: Lists differ:\n      ''install.ps1: $pythonExe = (Get-Command python -ErrorAction Stop).Source''\n      ''start-live-stt.ps1: $gitCommand = Get-Command git.exe -CommandType ...''\n\n58 unit test gecti.\n\nHer iki hata da Linux test host''unda YAPISAL olarak gorunmez (tek git.exe, tek\npython), bu yuzden sozlesme dizin geneli metinsel olarak zorlanmaktadir.\n\nRefs #282","tree":{"sha":"52e688ee678b09d042621c12c555f609123a4fe8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/trees/52e688ee678b09d042621c12c555f609123a4fe8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/commits/e8d566e9ac61f6a346b9de70d0e1ff24d2844ac8","verification":{"payload":"tree 52e688ee678b09d042621c12c555f609123a4fe8\nparent 26ff94b68f4ce9cb63bb86aadc284e384b6d16f4\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1785091643 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785091643 +0300\n\nfix(gpu-host): launcher git.exe cozumlemesi tek eslesmeye indirildi (#284)\n\nBelirti: live-stt launcher her aciliste 170. satirda oluyordu:\n\n    CommandNotFoundException: The term ''C:\\Program Files\\Git\\cmd\\git.exe\n    C:\\Program Files\\Git\\bin\\git.exe'' is not recognized...\n\nDosya diskte var, Test-Path True donuyor, Get-Command git calisiyor -- ama\nlauncher yine de acilmiyordu. Bu yuzden #280 (taslak arizasi duzeltmesi)\ncanliya alinamiyordu.\n\nKOK NEDEN\n\nGit for Windows git.exe''yi HEM cmd\\ HEM bin\\ altina kuruyor ve ikisini de\nmakine PATH''ine ekliyor. Dolayisiyla:\n\n    Get-Command git.exe -CommandType Application   -> 2 CommandInfo\n    $gitCommand.Source                             -> 2 elemanli Object[]\n    & $gitExe ...                                  -> dizi $OFS ile tek bir\n                                                      bosluklu komut adina\n                                                      donusuyor\n\nDenetim PC''de olculdu (2026-07-26):\n\n    type   : System.Object[]\n    count  : 2\n    srcVal : [C:\\Program Files\\Git\\cmd\\git.exe][C:\\Program Files\\Git\\bin\\git.exe]\n\nCOZUM\n\nAyni dosya agacinda dogru deyim zaten vardi -- meeting-ai-runtime-env.ps1:833\nPython yorumlayicisini `| Select-Object -First 1` ile tekillestiriyor. Launcher\nayni deyime hizalandi. Duzeltilmis ifade gercek host''ta dogrulandi:\n\n    resolved: C:\\Program Files\\Git\\cmd\\git.exe\n    exit    : 0\n    commit  : 512e9cc0fe4368d3cc91759dcd48756e54c2ad63  (40-hex OK)\n\nAYNI SINIFTAN IKINCI HATA (varsayimsal degil)\n\ninstall.ps1:153 `(Get-Command python).Source` ile yorumlayici yolunu cozup\nScheduled Task action''ina KALICI olarak yaziyordu. Ayni host''ta olculdu:\n\n    python match count: 2\n\nYani ilk kurulumda gorev action''ina bosluk-birlesik, calistirilamaz bir yol\nyazilabilirdi; bir launcher hatasindan daha genis etki alani. O da tekillestirildi.\n\nREGRESYON GUARD\n\ntest_get_command_executable_resolutions_are_singular deploy/gpu-host icindeki\nTUM ps1 dosyalarini tarar: bir Get-Command sonucu .Source''a besleniyorsa\n`Select-Object -First 1` ile tekillestirilmis olmali. Yalniz varlik-sinamalari\ncogul kalabilir (dogruluk degeri disinda kullanilmiyorlar).\n\nTest origin/main''e karsi IKI hatayi da yakaliyor:\n\n    AssertionError: Lists differ:\n      ''install.ps1: $pythonExe = (Get-Command python -ErrorAction Stop).Source''\n      ''start-live-stt.ps1: $gitCommand = Get-Command git.exe -CommandType ...''\n\n58 unit test gecti.\n\nHer iki hata da Linux test host''unda YAPISAL olarak gorunmez (tek git.exe, tek\npython), bu yuzden sozlesme dizin geneli metinsel olarak zorlanmaktadir.\n\nRefs #282","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZlY7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlx0QAFuwoc92hGIh9l7XUEAoqMYz\nu7hkXA8YdCiFLpBzQfNx1IHeNVmBrDUe3BunlccygkHu2183h/f/jwUeQM8ydJCd\n+3lckQaMH3enfSngjcRxZN6uIPEEoPjYzcbyARoEgQaZ7Zzdhf7qsVa6v6DSFXLg\nIMbR/JVcocP2oYAOUc9US5FJioZuGJ4LObdxpI3b3eFWyt1YQsGv2cJDdF87+vqo\nklaNvPMIzII03Z5LnQffmeMZ/OdsnJ7jQlrilsWNsoplHI8lwC74RJX6fyC21QfB\nyvxCCL/kdm3QoqRJPqJa/RmcxblrchmThEIVDeSTMqaqE/jAYhaBzbMBnPlUbYyf\npX8fkEA2pa/titXxB+UTaRmiT4QbBwcTFEjMYUoVnCSjtoB6H9z0iIWs1I7o3Bkw\n0O/I34bwIETG8179H32FOgbxsAIDZJmEJgKfUn0zPhdPy6iZ7K0CFvKx5dtX4yGd\nDwh6rlffC4NRBe620H7izkOtykIRa2pm6unFxv6QmOS9EeFQqCE1jKQyswfMgrl8\n0boGDGIO4E1KIydYJqOGLB27JKpxV3gHk8CQPIpsEtuqSUAyEYXO4UZcAg7FBARH\nAJ4HBIfSJw4k6xl4RJmGnbpiUZ1LlmH50EwM3I9QdQL5IbaHsBbbrsDL9UCxkoMO\nX042qr/3oOcwPzYHmCiM\n=iDQG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-26T18:47:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ai/commit/e8d566e9ac61f6a346b9de70d0e1ff24d2844ac8","node_id":"C_kwDOSut_MtoAKGU4ZDU2NmU5YWM2MWY2YTM0NmI5ZGU3MGQwZTFmZjI0ZDI4NDRhYzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ai/commit/26ff94b68f4ce9cb63bb86aadc284e384b6d16f4","sha":"26ff94b68f4ce9cb63bb86aadc284e384b6d16f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/26ff94b68f4ce9cb63bb86aadc284e384b6d16f4"}],"sha":"e8d566e9ac61f6a346b9de70d0e1ff24d2844ac8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/e8d566e9ac61f6a346b9de70d0e1ff24d2844ac8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/26ff94b68f4ce9cb63bb86aadc284e384b6d16f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T18:28:23Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T18:28:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(gpu-host): model manifest sıralaması Windows''ta harf-durumuna takılıyor (#282) (#283)\n\n* fix(live-stt): bir taslak arizasi artik canli oturumu oldurmuyor\n\nBelirti: canli transkript yolu 22-26 Temmuz arasi 4 gun oluydu. /ws/stream\nel sikismasi `ready` yerine kalici olarak {\"type\":\"loading\"} donuyordu; bu\n39 karakter + WS cerceve basligi ~43 bayt, ve canli baglantilarda olculen\n\"101 upgrade, ~43 bayt transfer, 10.0-10.6 sn''de olum\" imzasinin tam\nkarsiligi. Istemci OPEN_TIMEOUT_MS = 10 sn bekliyor, ready gelmiyor, kopuyor.\n\nKOK NEDEN\n\ninfer_live_partial() supervised backend''de HER taslak hatasinda `raise`\nediyordu:\n\n    except Exception as exc:\n        ...\n        if isinstance(live_service, SupervisedLiveWhisperService):\n            raise          # <- tum WS oturumu oluyor\n        return             # <- inline yolun DOGRU davranisi\n\nTaslak tavsiye niteligindedir; gercegi final pass tasir ve o kendi\nworker''inda saglikli kalir. Oturumu dusurmek, final''in rahatca yazabilecegi\nsesi atiyor ve hicbir seyi duzeltmiyor.\n\nZincir: final pass (large-v3-turbo, 6 sn pencere) GPU''yu doyururken taslak\n(medium int8, her 700 ms) bir kez butcesini asiyor -> oturum oluyor ->\nsupervised timeout worker''i oldurup yeniden doguruyor -> yeni surec modelsiz\n-> sonraki cagri 85 sn''lik soguk yuklemeye giriyor -> o pencerede baglanan\nher istemci 10 sn''de vazgeciyor. Surekli yeniden baglanan bir istemci\nfilosu altinda pencere hic kapanmiyor.\n\nCOZUM\n\nTaslak arizasi artik oturumu bitirmiyor: gecis atlanir, final akmaya devam\neder. Tekrarlayan arizalar da bedava degil -- her supervised timeout worker''i\noldurup yeniden dogurdugu icin, taslak temposunda yeniden denemek bir yavas\ngecisi yeniden-yukleme firtinasina cevirir. Bu yuzden ardisik arizalar bir\ndevre aciyor: taslaklar cooldown boyunca hic denenmiyor (threadpool, servis\nkilidi ve worker''a dokunulmadan), tek bir basarili gecis devreyi kapatiyor.\n\n    DRAFT_FAILURES_BEFORE_CIRCUIT_OPEN = 3\n    DRAFT_CIRCUIT_COOLDOWN_SEC = 30.0\n\nSayac *ardisik* arizalari tutar; arada bir gelen yavas cikarim birikmez.\n\nKANIT\n\nArizanin canli yeniden uretimi (denetim PC, 2026-07-26): /ws/stream uzerine\n16 kHz float32 PCM''i 100 ms cerceveyle gercek-zaman hizinda, cumleler arasi\n0.8 sn duraklamayla akit. ~4 dakikada:\n\n    20:03:13  Draft pass error err_class=WorkerTimeoutError\n    20:03:13  WS stream error            -> sunucu oturumu 1000 (OK) ile kapatti\n\nAyni kosumda hafif yukte (turlar arasi 2.5 sn sessizlik) 84 sn / 8 tur /\n15 final / 0 hata: boru hatti saglam, kiran sey yogunluk.\n\nYeni test origin/main kaynagina karsi FAIL ediyor, duzeltmeyle PASS:\n\n    test_draft_timeout_keeps_stream_alive_and_opens_circuit\n      origin/main: ''draft_circuit_opened'' yok, oturum error ile bitiyor\n      duzeltmeyle: ready + hic error yok + devre aciliyor + denemeler duruyor\n\n271 unit test gecti, ruff check temiz, mypy temiz.\n\nKAPSAM DISI BIRAKILAN IKI SEY (bilerek, sessizce dusurulmedi)\n\n1) Sessiz seste halusinasyon. Ayni kosumda 4/4 tekrarlanabilir sekilde\n   \"Izlediginiz icin tesekkur ederim.\" ureten bir artefakt olculdu; yalniz\n   kisik klipte (RMS 0.0114), gurultuluda (RMS 0.1063) hic cikmiyor. Lexical\n   bir kalip EKLENMEDI: test_hallucination_filter_passes_real_speech bu\n   ibarenin gercek konusma sayilmasini bilerek kilitliyor ve hakli -- metin\n   tek basina belirsiz. Dogru ayrim no_speech_prob/RMS baglaminda; ayri\n   tasarim isteyen ayri is.\n\n2) `_invoke_locked` icinde sahipsiz kalmis tamamlanmis load yanitinin\n   kurtarilmasi. Denendi ve GERI ALINDI: yazilan test duzeltme olmadan da\n   geciyordu, cunku _terminate_and_restart kuyruklari da yeniden yaratiyor\n   ve bayat yanit hayatta kalmiyor. Faydasi gosterilemeyen degisiklik\n   gonderilmedi.\n\nRefs #279\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(gpu-host): model manifest ordering is case-sensitive on Windows\n\nStaging every GPU-host live-STT model failed with:\n\n    model-integrity-error: model integrity file entry is not canonical\n\n_relative_artifact_files ordered entries with sorted(root.rglob(\"*\")),\nwhich compares PurePath objects. On Windows that comparison is\ncase-INSENSITIVE, so a snapshot containing README.md and model.bin was\nwritten as (config.json, model.bin, README.md). The manifest reader\nenforces plain ASCII ascending order (\"R\" 0x52 < \"m\" 0x6D) and therefore\nrejected the manifest this same helper had just produced.\n\nEvery real Hugging Face snapshot ships a README.md, so this blocked the\nhardened ProgramData model runtime outright on the GPU host - and with it\nthe deploy of #280.\n\nOrdering now uses the POSIX text the contract actually validates.\n\nThe regression is structurally unreproducible on POSIX: PurePath lowercases\nfor comparison only on Windows (ntpath), so a POSIX test run passes with or\nwithout this change. The fixture gains a README.md entry and an explicit\nASCII-order assertion to pin the contract, but the load-bearing evidence is\nthe live GPU host, where staging failed before and succeeds after.\n\nRefs #282\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9dcf5258800d23bce9289a4ee087d0cae60b4d4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/trees/9dcf5258800d23bce9289a4ee087d0cae60b4d4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/commits/26ff94b68f4ce9cb63bb86aadc284e384b6d16f4","verification":{"payload":"tree 9dcf5258800d23bce9289a4ee087d0cae60b4d4c\nparent aa0515fba2e38169689739bec76f09ae2b00f7f3\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1785090503 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785090503 +0300\n\nfix(gpu-host): model manifest sıralaması Windows''ta harf-durumuna takılıyor (#282) (#283)\n\n* fix(live-stt): bir taslak arizasi artik canli oturumu oldurmuyor\n\nBelirti: canli transkript yolu 22-26 Temmuz arasi 4 gun oluydu. /ws/stream\nel sikismasi `ready` yerine kalici olarak {\"type\":\"loading\"} donuyordu; bu\n39 karakter + WS cerceve basligi ~43 bayt, ve canli baglantilarda olculen\n\"101 upgrade, ~43 bayt transfer, 10.0-10.6 sn''de olum\" imzasinin tam\nkarsiligi. Istemci OPEN_TIMEOUT_MS = 10 sn bekliyor, ready gelmiyor, kopuyor.\n\nKOK NEDEN\n\ninfer_live_partial() supervised backend''de HER taslak hatasinda `raise`\nediyordu:\n\n    except Exception as exc:\n        ...\n        if isinstance(live_service, SupervisedLiveWhisperService):\n            raise          # <- tum WS oturumu oluyor\n        return             # <- inline yolun DOGRU davranisi\n\nTaslak tavsiye niteligindedir; gercegi final pass tasir ve o kendi\nworker''inda saglikli kalir. Oturumu dusurmek, final''in rahatca yazabilecegi\nsesi atiyor ve hicbir seyi duzeltmiyor.\n\nZincir: final pass (large-v3-turbo, 6 sn pencere) GPU''yu doyururken taslak\n(medium int8, her 700 ms) bir kez butcesini asiyor -> oturum oluyor ->\nsupervised timeout worker''i oldurup yeniden doguruyor -> yeni surec modelsiz\n-> sonraki cagri 85 sn''lik soguk yuklemeye giriyor -> o pencerede baglanan\nher istemci 10 sn''de vazgeciyor. Surekli yeniden baglanan bir istemci\nfilosu altinda pencere hic kapanmiyor.\n\nCOZUM\n\nTaslak arizasi artik oturumu bitirmiyor: gecis atlanir, final akmaya devam\neder. Tekrarlayan arizalar da bedava degil -- her supervised timeout worker''i\noldurup yeniden dogurdugu icin, taslak temposunda yeniden denemek bir yavas\ngecisi yeniden-yukleme firtinasina cevirir. Bu yuzden ardisik arizalar bir\ndevre aciyor: taslaklar cooldown boyunca hic denenmiyor (threadpool, servis\nkilidi ve worker''a dokunulmadan), tek bir basarili gecis devreyi kapatiyor.\n\n    DRAFT_FAILURES_BEFORE_CIRCUIT_OPEN = 3\n    DRAFT_CIRCUIT_COOLDOWN_SEC = 30.0\n\nSayac *ardisik* arizalari tutar; arada bir gelen yavas cikarim birikmez.\n\nKANIT\n\nArizanin canli yeniden uretimi (denetim PC, 2026-07-26): /ws/stream uzerine\n16 kHz float32 PCM''i 100 ms cerceveyle gercek-zaman hizinda, cumleler arasi\n0.8 sn duraklamayla akit. ~4 dakikada:\n\n    20:03:13  Draft pass error err_class=WorkerTimeoutError\n    20:03:13  WS stream error            -> sunucu oturumu 1000 (OK) ile kapatti\n\nAyni kosumda hafif yukte (turlar arasi 2.5 sn sessizlik) 84 sn / 8 tur /\n15 final / 0 hata: boru hatti saglam, kiran sey yogunluk.\n\nYeni test origin/main kaynagina karsi FAIL ediyor, duzeltmeyle PASS:\n\n    test_draft_timeout_keeps_stream_alive_and_opens_circuit\n      origin/main: ''draft_circuit_opened'' yok, oturum error ile bitiyor\n      duzeltmeyle: ready + hic error yok + devre aciliyor + denemeler duruyor\n\n271 unit test gecti, ruff check temiz, mypy temiz.\n\nKAPSAM DISI BIRAKILAN IKI SEY (bilerek, sessizce dusurulmedi)\n\n1) Sessiz seste halusinasyon. Ayni kosumda 4/4 tekrarlanabilir sekilde\n   \"Izlediginiz icin tesekkur ederim.\" ureten bir artefakt olculdu; yalniz\n   kisik klipte (RMS 0.0114), gurultuluda (RMS 0.1063) hic cikmiyor. Lexical\n   bir kalip EKLENMEDI: test_hallucination_filter_passes_real_speech bu\n   ibarenin gercek konusma sayilmasini bilerek kilitliyor ve hakli -- metin\n   tek basina belirsiz. Dogru ayrim no_speech_prob/RMS baglaminda; ayri\n   tasarim isteyen ayri is.\n\n2) `_invoke_locked` icinde sahipsiz kalmis tamamlanmis load yanitinin\n   kurtarilmasi. Denendi ve GERI ALINDI: yazilan test duzeltme olmadan da\n   geciyordu, cunku _terminate_and_restart kuyruklari da yeniden yaratiyor\n   ve bayat yanit hayatta kalmiyor. Faydasi gosterilemeyen degisiklik\n   gonderilmedi.\n\nRefs #279\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(gpu-host): model manifest ordering is case-sensitive on Windows\n\nStaging every GPU-host live-STT model failed with:\n\n    model-integrity-error: model integrity file entry is not canonical\n\n_relative_artifact_files ordered entries with sorted(root.rglob(\"*\")),\nwhich compares PurePath objects. On Windows that comparison is\ncase-INSENSITIVE, so a snapshot containing README.md and model.bin was\nwritten as (config.json, model.bin, README.md). The manifest reader\nenforces plain ASCII ascending order (\"R\" 0x52 < \"m\" 0x6D) and therefore\nrejected the manifest this same helper had just produced.\n\nEvery real Hugging Face snapshot ships a README.md, so this blocked the\nhardened ProgramData model runtime outright on the GPU host - and with it\nthe deploy of #280.\n\nOrdering now uses the POSIX text the contract actually validates.\n\nThe regression is structurally unreproducible on POSIX: PurePath lowercases\nfor comparison only on Windows (ntpath), so a POSIX test run passes with or\nwithout this change. The fixture gains a README.md entry and an explicit\nASCII-order assertion to pin the contract, but the load-bearing evidence is\nthe live GPU host, where staging failed before and succeeds after.\n\nRefs #282\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZlHHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABkMQAEYuITmFh5UwsJ3Mqm8AwQ98\nm5S4+qbU9ZouVvByLLEGOcqw21FLuz/hK3oWAbIqOA2m1c4X35gSt