 boot anina tasindi.\n\n- app/main.py: daemon thread, model basina sure loglu\n- app/core/config.py: stream_preload_models (STT_STREAM_PRELOAD_MODELS), default true\n\nIki bilincli ozellik: bloklamiyor (health probe''lar cevap veriyor, yoksa supervisor servisi yukleme ortasinda oldurur) ve olduruc degil (hata loglanip geciliyor, WS yolu hala ensure_model cagiriyor).\n\ntests/unit/test_model_preload.py uc degismezi kilitliyor. conftest birim testlerde preload''i kapatiyor: bu izolasyon olmadan app acilisi paylasilan singleton''lara model yukleyip baska bir teste siziyordu — temiz origin/main''de suite yesil oldugu dogrulandi, yani kirilmaya bu degisiklik sebep oldu ve kaynaginda duzeltildi.\n\nSuite: 265 passed (261 baseline + 4 yeni). ruff temiz, mypy temiz.\n\nEslikci istemci fix: Halildeu/platform-desktop#83\n\nCross-AI: Implementer Claude (Anthropic); Codex kotasi Jul 26''ya kadar kapali, retro-review pending.\n\nRefs: Halildeu/platform-k8s-gitops#2761","tree":{"sha":"1062538c43f7f89b1c33549b6b5cc70b92725a3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/trees/1062538c43f7f89b1c33549b6b5cc70b92725a3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/commits/1af6d9cebb66fb0783fc814d1027802c469172cf","verification":{"payload":"tree 1062538c43f7f89b1c33549b6b5cc70b92725a3d\nparent 1eae9dc6d13bf27f490b4536479ef99fc976e64b\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1784666978 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784666978 +0300\n\nfix(live-stt): preload streaming models at boot (Faz 24 Bulgu 3-F) (#272)\n\nLazy model loading, istemci sabriyla kilitleniyordu: yukleme WS baglantisiyla tetikleniyor, soguk yukleme ~4 dakika suruyor, desktop 10. saniyede kopunca yukleme iptal oluyordu (servis logu: ''WS disconnected during model load''). Her deneme sifirdan basliyordu; model hicbir zaman tamamlanamiyordu.\n\nFix: her iki streaming modeli lifespan acilisinda yukle — maliyet kimsenin timeout''la beklemedigi boot anina tasindi.\n\n- app/main.py: daemon thread, model basina sure loglu\n- app/core/config.py: stream_preload_models (STT_STREAM_PRELOAD_MODELS), default true\n\nIki bilincli ozellik: bloklamiyor (health probe''lar cevap veriyor, yoksa supervisor servisi yukleme ortasinda oldurur) ve olduruc degil (hata loglanip geciliyor, WS yolu hala ensure_model cagiriyor).\n\ntests/unit/test_model_preload.py uc degismezi kilitliyor. conftest birim testlerde preload''i kapatiyor: bu izolasyon olmadan app acilisi paylasilan singleton''lara model yukleyip baska bir teste siziyordu — temiz origin/main''de suite yesil oldugu dogrulandi, yani kirilmaya bu degisiklik sebep oldu ve kaynaginda duzeltildi.\n\nSuite: 265 passed (261 baseline + 4 yeni). ruff temiz, mypy temiz.\n\nEslikci istemci fix: Halildeu/platform-desktop#83\n\nCross-AI: Implementer Claude (Anthropic); Codex kotasi Jul 26''ya kadar kapali, retro-review pending.\n\nRefs: Halildeu/platform-k8s-gitops#2761","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqX9tiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6moQAHxd8xzNFUlP04Pb7qcktL9g\nQVktNRbENxy7aVEuLXvRCQoviteBTJZK6R6I4St5YbLTNdnAcdM2bL8+ohnYJGwE\nvQ6x4HqhH78UR39wWkEQ4jokQCa58Zkn/X7suZtma55ZtmRs51y6Fsps9rBf7aJ8\nyIVpeYmBtYzZoAa6RSnFOnTUwyZ4rc7It/x4tCn2QKuIltCOEFLTh829i6H121i3\nt8D/GhFg5ud397xV/viv+2e0f4mNJDLoQxKj4FCLLBdTqJB9gFLNtS39PE2q8Qyb\noMxh3HhredF7rv9LelrXekqapDbU0GaNI4CfwNNIK+fQlNTRRrEfSfa9qs1wFh7X\nzsizYq5kwUwMlHhwDhqqtPqHPoUjtEaUFDetNpgATrHuJPmuiwtI/KVVwWtEAHdT\nhFDUBHZyAv4++gb+6a8yFUNJl4PlWV3Ko85moR3WR5m7H7kdLVbMw6GbbcMO6U/8\nR/lbgLo8XMGhDus5gNO4g3k0nmIK4f0KhUy01c1zDC0IjaNilXS008bZj4s4n4WG\nCFlRpnN39jBR1QXQA/nC2bCBcRmeafGdHRm5bg+haiRsQGFvksY/R0Fw37pOjep8\nk1aMA8LrB8oDahbzSGsRadz+Ubden5nQrU08iFDSOmgv0ET3OgAPUcNLLqOOMFFP\nhn2PcDi4tdjYhi31zPG5\n=ZCut\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-21T20:49:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_