ved_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/bcad860e15c097523a4fb41efab5b31b0f674f37/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T05:00:37Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T05:00:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(meeting-ai): İ2 SSE contract regression guard (static pins) (#271)\n\nAdds tests/unit/test_live_sse_contract.py — three static-introspection\npins that fail loudly when a refactor drifts a downstream consumer''s\ncontract:\n\n1. AnalyzeResponse MUST carry the fields the desktop hook + gitops\n   smoke render/grep (`is_partial`, `version`, `summary`, `decisions`,\n   `action_items`, `redaction_count`, `citations`, `summary_citations`,\n   `summary_grounding_status`, `grounding_policy`, `schema_version`).\n   Adding fields is fine; renaming/removing any of these triggers a\n   named-field diff.\n\n2. The two route URLs consumers build MUST exist:\n   - /analyze/live                        (audio-gw İ4 trigger + smoke)\n   - /analyze/live/stream/{meeting_id}    (desktop subscriber)\n\n3. FINAL_ANALYSIS_VERSION_SENTINEL is still defined and stays strictly\n   >= 2**31 - 1 so a late live publish cannot displace a final one via\n   version comparison.\n\nBehavioural coverage (publish, headers, 503) already lives in\ntest_api.py; this file is a contract-only guard that catches renames\nin <1s without needing the full TestClient stack.\n\n3 passed in 0.33s; ruff + mypy clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1728934c6525a2a75883f298b33b62d5cc14fe99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/trees/1728934c6525a2a75883f298b33b62d5cc14fe99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/commits/bcad860e15c097523a4fb41efab5b31b0f674f37","verification":{"payload":"tree 1728934c6525a2a75883f298b33b62d5cc14fe99\nparent 05e2ebcfec52fab037af0ff78efe4a8c92f4db99\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1784610037 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784610037 +0300\n\ntest(meeting-ai): İ2 SSE contract regression guard (static pins) (#271)\n\nAdds tests/unit/test_live_sse_contract.py — three static-introspection\npins that fail loudly when a refactor drifts a downstream consumer''s\ncontract:\n\n1. AnalyzeResponse MUST carry the fields the desktop hook + gitops\n   smoke render/grep (`is_partial`, `version`, `summary`, `decisions`,\n   `action_items`, `redaction_count`, `citations`, `summary_citations`,\n   `summary_grounding_status`, `grounding_policy`, `schema_version`).\n   Adding fields is fine; renaming/removing any of these triggers a\n   named-field diff.\n\n2. The two route URLs consumers build MUST exist:\n   - /analyze/live                        (audio-gw İ4 trigger + smoke)\n   - /analyze/live/stream/{meeting_id}    (desktop subscriber)\n\n3. FINAL_ANALYSIS_VERSION_SENTINEL is still defined and stays strictly\n   >= 2**31 - 1 so a late live publish cannot displace a final one via\n   version comparison.\n\nBehavioural coverage (publish, headers, 503) already lives in\ntest_api.py; this file is a contract-only guard that catches renames\nin <1s without needing the full TestClient stack.\n\n3 passed in 0.33s; ruff + mypy clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqXvz1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKn0QAC8kYQFVmVi9WxYF+t+DlcOj\nYVrWrsL6fecU2Zn7+sA8cT10VMeQoU56rhngmQtHDzex5JzS8E2PlkhQesgKf92C\nPqN51SIHSqFdbPjb0aVEPYrUy6Qyfc14cUdQv6fOnUCqO9AEL/WXn7wjLK4