mmits/05e2ebcfec52fab037af0ff78efe4a8c92f4db99"}],"sha":"bcad860e15c097523a4fb41efab5b31b0f674f37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/bcad860e15c097523a4fb41efab5b31b0f674f37"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/05e2ebcfec52fab037af0ff78efe4a8c92f4db99/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T23:25:57Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T23:25:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(meeting-ai): live analysis SSE relay — /analyze/live/stream/{meeting_id} (İ2) (#270)\n\nFaz 24 canlı analiz iterasyon 2 (Zeynep 2026-07-20 kapsam kararı, PR #268\nmerged the endpoint scaffold). This wires an ephemeral in-memory pub/sub\nbetween /analyze/live (producer) and a new HTTP SSE endpoint (consumer)\nso the desktop panel can render each partial analysis as it lands without\na meeting-service persistence round-trip.\n\nEphemeral (not persisted) is deliberate:\n  - meeting-service ingestion today is capability-bound + final-only; the\n    mimari uzatma to accept partials (capability binding + tombstone +\n    version-monotonic guard + DB migration) is a follow-up slice, not a\n    blocker for live viewing.\n  - The desktop use case is a live viewer — audit history goes through\n    the final /analyze call at recording end, unchanged.\n\nNew: `app/services/live_stream_hub.py` — LiveStreamHub\n\n  - Per-meeting subscriber sets keyed by meeting_id.\n  - Each subscriber owns a bounded asyncio.Queue (default 100 items).\n  - `publish` is non-blocking. On QueueFull it evicts the oldest item\n    (drop-oldest) so a stalled subscriber never slows the analyzer;\n    dropped items are counted for alerting.\n  - `publish` NEVER raises — a broadcast error MUST NOT surface as a 5xx\n    to the /analyze/live HTTP caller.\n  - Single-process, single-instance today (meeting-ai replicas=1). The\n    Redis-Streams upgrade path is documented in the module docstring;\n    subscribers/publishers do not change when we swap the impl.\n\nNew endpoint: `GET /analyze/live/stream/{meeting_id}` (SSE)\n\n  - text/event-stream + no-cache + X-Accel-Buffering: no (nginx bypass)\n  - Initial `: subscribed <n>` comment as an SSE-standard \"hello\".\n  - `event: analysis` frames carry AnalyzeResponse JSON (is_partial=true,\n    version=segment_seq for ordering on the client).\n  - `event: ping` every `live_stream_heartbeat_sec` (default 15s) — keeps\n    proxies warm and lets clients notice a peer-gone.\n  - Fail-fast 503 if the hub is not initialised (test-time or misconfig).\n\nWiring: `app/main.py` mounts LiveStreamHub on `app.state.live_stream_hub`\nduring lifespan startup. `/analyze/live` calls `hub.publish(...)` for\nevery result whose request carries a meeting_id (empty meeting_id → no\npublish, prevents cross-meeting leaks via a shared empty bucket).\n\nMetrics (Prometheus, no meeting_id label — UUID cardinality unbounded):\n  - mai_analyze_live_stream_subscribers (Gauge)\n  - mai_analyze_live_stream_published_total\n  - mai_analyze_live_stream_delivered_total\n  - mai_analyze_live_stream_dropped_total\n\nConfig (env prefix MAI_):\n  - live_stream_max_queue (default 100)\n  - live_stream_heartbeat_sec (default 15.0)\n\nTests:\n  - `tests/unit/test_live_stream_hub.py` — 10 tests: subscribe/unsubscribe,\n    zero-subscriber no-op, fan-out, meeting_id isolation, drop-oldest under\n    QueueFull, subscriber-count math, safe double-unsubscribe, publish\n    never-raises under a concurrent consumer race.\n  - `tests/unit/test_api.py` — 4 new tests: /analyze/live publishes to the\n    mounted hub with the response payload; a missing meeting_id does NOT\n    publish (no leaks); a broken hub is swallowed (analyze still 200);\n    the SSE endpoint returns 503 when the hub is missing.\n\nEnd-to-end SSE-over-HTTP validation is deferred to Faz D acceptance smoke\n(browser MCP + curl chain) — driving a keep-alive stream through\nstarlette.TestClient synchronously deadlocks on `iter_bytes` because the\nsync client cannot honour a read timeout the way an async client would;\nthe sensible split is class-level pub/sub tests + wiring tests here,\nprotocol-level tests in the smoke workflow.\n\nFollow-ups (not in this PR):\n  - İ3: platform-desktop SSE consumer (EventSource + IPC bridge to renderer)\n  - İ4: audio-gateway / recorder — cadenced /analyze/live trigger\n  - İ5: e2e smoke (browser MCP + curl SSE parse) + acceptance sign-off\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dc264a57b1e63ea7901085951f5cdc6ee417692b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/trees/dc264a57b1e63ea7901085951f5cdc6ee417692b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/commits/05e2ebcfec52fab037af0ff78efe4a8c92f4db99","verification":{"payload":"tree dc264a57b1e63ea7901085951f5cdc6ee417692b\nparent fae6643e3a250019e22e095fa2e8c50a5d72516d\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1784589957 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784589957 +0300\n\nfeat(meeting-ai): live analysis SSE relay — /analyze/live/stream/{meeting_id} (İ2) (#270)\n\nFaz 24 canlı analiz iterasyon 2 (Zeynep 2026-07-20 kapsam kararı, PR #268\nmerged the endpoint scaffold). This wires an ephemeral in-memory pub/sub\nbetween /analyze/live (producer) and a new HTTP SSE endpoint (consumer)\nso the desktop panel can render each partial analysis as it lands without\na meeting-service persistence round-trip.\n\nEphemeral (not persisted) is deliberate:\n  - meeting-service ingestion today is capability-bound + final-only; the\n    mimari uzatma to accept partials (capability binding + tombstone +\n    version-monotonic guard + DB migration) is a follow-up slice, not a\n    blocker for live viewing.\n  - The desktop use case is a live viewer — audit history goes through\n    the final /analyze call at recording end, unchanged.\n\nNew: `app/services/live_stream_hub.py` — LiveStreamHub\n\n  - Per-meeting subscriber sets keyed by meeting_id.\n  - Each subscriber owns a bounded asyncio.Queue (default 100 items).\n  - `publish` is non-blocking. On QueueFull it evicts the oldest item\n    (drop-oldest) so a stalled subscriber never slows the analyzer;\n    dropped items are counted for alerting.\n  - `publish` NEVER raises — a broadcast error MUST NOT surface as a 5xx\n    to the /analyze/live HTTP caller.\n  - Single-process, single-instance today (meeting-ai replicas=1). The\n    Redis-Streams upgrade path is documented in the module docstring;\n    subscribers/publishers do not change when we swap the impl.\n\nNew endpoint: `GET /analyze/live/stream/{meeting_id}` (SSE)\n\n  - text/event-stream + no-cache + X-Accel-Buffering: no (nginx bypass)\n  - Initial `: subscribed <n>` comment as an SSE-standard \"hello\".\n  - `event: analysis` frames carry AnalyzeResponse JSON (is_partial=true,\n    version=segment_seq for ordering on the client).\n  - `event: ping` every `live_stream_heartbeat_sec` (default 15s) — keeps\n    proxies warm and lets clients notice a peer-gone.\n  - Fail-fast 503 if the hub is not initialised (test-time or misconfig).\n\nWiring: `app/main.py` mounts LiveStreamHub on `app.state.live_stream_hub`\nduring lifespan startup. `/analyze/live` calls `hub.publish(...)` for\nevery result whose request carries a meeting_id (empty meeting_id → no\npublish, prevents cross-meeting leaks via a shared empty bucket).\n\nMetrics (Prometheus, no meeting_id label — UUID cardinality unbounded):\n  - mai_analyze_live_stream_subscribers (Gauge)\n  - mai_analyze_live_stream_published_total\n  - mai_analyze_live_stream_delivered_total\n  - mai_analyze_live_stream_dropped_total\n\nConfig (env prefix MAI_):\n  - live_stream_max_queue (default 100)\n  - live_stream_heartbeat_sec (default 15.0)\n\nTests:\n  - `tests/unit/test_live_stream_hub.py` — 10 tests: subscribe/unsubscribe,\n    zero-subscriber no-op, fan-out, meeting_id isolation, drop-oldest under\n    QueueFull, subscriber-count math, safe double-unsubscribe, publish\n    never-raises under a concurrent consumer race.\n  - `tests/unit/test_api.py` — 4 new tests: /analyze/live publishes to the\n    mounted hub with the response payload; a missing meeting_id does NOT\n    publish (no leaks); a broken hub is swallowed (analyze still 200);\n    the SSE endpoint returns 503 when the hub is missing.\n\nEnd-to-end SSE-over-HTTP validation is deferred to Faz D acceptance smoke\n(browser MCP + curl chain) — driving a keep-alive stream through\nstarlette.TestClient synchronously deadlocks on `iter_bytes` because the\nsync client cannot honour a read timeout the way an async client would;\nthe sensible split is class-level pub/sub tests + wiring tests here,\nprotocol-level tests in the smoke workflow.\n\nFollow-ups (not in this PR):\n  - İ3: platform-desktop SSE consumer (EventSource + IPC bridge to renderer)\n  - İ4: audio-gateway / recorder — cadenced /analyze/live trigger\n  - İ5: e2e smoke (browser MCP + curl SSE parse) + acceptance sign-off\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqXq6GCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAU+wQAAIq4jaoQggk4KdtwfhaAxyo\ndbqEzy62yxtKmPrJc3pDyBTOrB4nfrQDA1J3ZDuKVXB8aq38n220GadRoF4WJBUF\nUdYlYOrqsERAKHgW7GxvkVDKV1km6uKiCbOEcm1YZxEBoCRa5SgssIg2GQtg9nf4\nomk++Xz18ElFL4kFLEQ8GAoCRdh6Oftp/AcWXH0FT9wGTX4WCw/m1aEeduMWIha7\nDVLzM7LSkNP4Vj1piEk4O6Fo+uBEKGGqR4JygCxKcfZ6wp/NfITpzHXzcc/7IEok\nXSHid9IPalKCFgMGAB1DZF9OLNBHJkLO4YgfVD+WP0PYADngs5QrDX8Vf35Nx6K5\n5ZtJouts9sWJ8894czAIwnopJmkWxFdgxYFLmwZpLm8ob9E8QrzcijrCcF1gqywG\nN5Y9L2cvNiKOJgLBvZsxJT1wSYrT5uP53eKC1Laavp6laDfNjdRqpjvjofVdB0Ue\nJIKIWT8agqjAhz64BStKIBV+2QctKRPxgNfOIUypfON92I+SM9VqaNfFj+d4vNLk\n6CbZN/bWkQDPQWuGLH2ey4BHUTNNZk2biqfrAGKn4RK7KY5NECuqqJEN9aHpBdCS\nD/eYagQKQ87jcAQ2MU8wtsRTAuRRD9A3mV9hEuf67VAKijvhiJ18r6tYblYXOWcW\nVz7s09DoqCuBG+8vESqg\n=RE0V\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-20T23:25:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ai/commit/05e2ebcfec52fab037af0ff78efe4a8c92f4db99","node_id":"C_kwDOSut_MtoAKDA1ZTJlYmNmZWM1MmZhYjAzN2FmMGZmNzhlZmU0YThjOTJmNGRiOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ai/commit/fae6643e3a250019e22e095fa2e8c50a5d72516d","sha":"fae6643e3a250019e22e095fa2e8c50a5d72516d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/fae6643e3a250019e22e095fa2e8c50a5d72516d"}],"sha":"05e2ebcfec52fab037af0ff78efe4a8c92f4db99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/05e2ebcfec52fab037af0ff78efe4a8c92f4db99"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/commits/fae6643e3a250019e22e095fa2e8c50a5d72516d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T23:09:46Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T23:09:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(meeting-ai): /analyze/live endpoint scaffold (Faz 24 canlı analiz, Zeynep 2026-07-20 kapsam) (#268)\n\nZeynep 2026-07-20 kapsam düzeltmesi kabul edildi: canlı özet/karar/aksiyon\nüretimi Faz 24 acceptance kapsamında (opsiyonel iyileştirme değil, ürün\ngereksinimi). Değer önerisi: kayıt sonrası rapor değil, toplantı sırasında\nkatılımcının önünde teyit edilebilen çıktı; kayıt bitmesini beklemez.\n\nBu PR meeting-ai tarafında MVP scaffold — server-side endpoint + schema\nalanları. Meeting-service partial ingestion + desktop SSE + audio-gateway\ncanlı trigger ayrı PR''lar (sonraki iterasyon).\n\nDeğişiklik:\n\n- AnalyzeRequest: opsiyonel `segment_seq: int | None` alanı. Recorder''ın\n  monotonik segment sequence''i; server bunu /analyze/live yanıtında version\n  olarak thread eder ki incremental delivery''ler deterministik sıralanabilsin.\n  /analyze (final) tarafında ignore edilir.\n- AnalyzeResponse: `is_partial: bool = False` + `version: int = 0`.\n  is_partial=True /analyze/live yanıtı olduğunu, sonraki bir delivery''nin\n  supersede edeceğini gösterir. is_partial=False final /analyze yanıtı.\n  version = /analyze/live için segment_seq, final için sentinel (2^31-1;\n  bu scaffold''da rezervasyonu; caller/meeting-service enforcement ayrı PR).\n- /analyze/live endpoint: aynı analyzer + redaction guard + error map,\n  is_partial=True + version thread. Durable delivery **kasten atlandı** —\n  meeting-service partial ingestion path''i henüz yok; live payload''ı\n  final-only kolona yazsa authoritative final result''ı sessizce ezerdi.\n  Ingestion PR''ı AnalysisDeliveryRuntime + meeting-service''i is_partial\n  + version-monotonic guard ile genişletir.\n- Response header''ları: X-Analysis-Is-Partial + X-Analysis-Version — SSE\n  relay ve meeting-service ingestion body parse etmeden metadata görebilir.\n- /analyze regression guard: segment_seq gönderilse bile /analyze\n  is_partial=False + version=0 döner; live/final ayrımı endpoint''e göre.\n\nTest: 20/20 pass (mevcut 14 + yeni 6 canlı test).\n- Live is_partial=True + version thread''i (positive path)\n- Live default version=0 (segment_seq eksik)\n- Analyze regression (segment_seq ignore)\n- Live empty transcript 422 (validation invariant korunuyor)\n- Live too-large 413 (size cap live path''te bypass edilmiyor)\n- Live PII redaction (KVKK invariant live''da da korunuyor; partial olsa da\n  fan-out riski var)\n\nKVKK sınırı değişmez: aynı transcript + aynı rıza + aynı gateway →\nmeeting-ai yolu; redaction guard live''da da fail-closed çalışır.\n\nCross-AI attribution:\n- Implementer: Claude\n- Consultation mode: none (routine feature add, revertible, tested, 20/20\n  pass; wider Cross-AI consultation temporarily opt-in per gitops#2712/#2713).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9077f3234fda766f8080e9e848e32510ebde9082","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/trees/9077f3234fda766f8080e9e848e32510ebde9082"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ai/git/commits/fae6643e3a250019e22e095fa2e8c50a5d72516d","verification":{"payload":"tree 9077f3234fda766f8080e9e848e32510ebde9082\nparent cf582b35ca7fd46f1da582dfd6117a1ea883d661\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1784588986 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784588986 +0300\n\nfeat(meeting-ai): /analyze/live endpoint scaffold (Faz 24 canlı analiz, Zeynep 2026-07-20 kapsam) (#268)\n\nZeynep 2026-07-20 kapsam düzeltmesi kabul edildi: canlı özet/karar/aksiyon\nüretimi Faz 24 acceptance kapsamında (opsiyonel iyileştirme değil, ürün\ngereksinimi). Değer önerisi: kayıt sonrası rapor değil, toplantı sırasında\nkatılımcının önünde teyit edilebilen çıktı; kayıt bitmesini beklemez.\n\nBu PR meeting-ai tarafında MVP scaffold — server-side endpoint + schema\nalanları. Meeting-service partial ingestion + desktop SSE + audio-gateway\ncanlı trigger ayrı PR''lar (sonraki iterasyon).\n\nDeğişiklik:\n\n- AnalyzeRequest: opsiyonel `segment_seq: int | None` alanı. Recorder''ın\n  monotonik segment sequence''i; server bunu /analyze/live yanıtında version\n  olarak thread eder ki incremental delivery''ler deterministik sıralanabilsin.\n  /analyze (final) tarafında ignore edilir.\n- AnalyzeResponse: `is_partial: bool = False` + `version: int = 0`.\n  is_partial=True /analyze/live yanıtı olduğunu, sonraki bir delivery''nin\n  supersede edeceğini gösterir. is_partial=False final /analyze yanıtı.\n  version = /analyze/live için segment_seq, final için sentinel (2^31-1;\n  bu scaffold''da rezervasyonu; caller/meeting-service enforcement ayrı PR).\n- /analyze/live endpoint: aynı analyzer + redaction guard + error map,\n  is_partial=True + version thread. Durable delivery **kasten atlandı** —\n  meeting-service partial ingestion path''i henüz yok; live payload''ı\n  final-only kolona yazsa authoritative final result''ı sessizce ezerdi.\n  Ingestion PR''ı AnalysisDeliveryRuntime + meeting-service''i is_partial\n  + version-monotonic guard ile genişletir.\n- Response header''ları: X-Analysis-Is-Partial + X-Analysis-Version — SSE\n  relay ve meeting-service ingestion body parse etmeden metadata görebilir.\n- /analyze regression guard: segment_seq gönderilse bile /analyze\n  is_partial=False + version=0 döner; live/final ayrımı endpoint''e göre.\n\nTest: 20/20 pass (mevcut 14 + yeni 6 canlı test).\n- Live is_partial=True + version thread''i (positive path)\n- Live default version=0 (segment_seq eksik)\n- Analyze regression (segment_seq ignore)\n- Live empty transcript 422 (validation invariant korunuyor)\n- Live too-large 413 (size cap live path''te bypass edilmiyor)\n- Live PII redaction (KVKK invariant live''da da korunuyor; partial olsa da\n  fan-out riski var)\n\nKVKK sınırı değişmez: aynı transcript + aynı rıza + aynı gateway →\nmeeting-ai yolu; redaction guard live''da da fail-closed çalışır.\n\nCross-AI attribution:\n- Implementer: Claude\n- Consultation mode: none (routine feature add, revertible, tested, 20/20\n  pass; wider Cross-AI consultation temporarily opt-in per gitops#2712/#2713).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqXqq6CRC1aQ7uu5U