}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/colzphml","id":53256298,"login":"colzphml","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMjU2Mjk4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colzphml/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colzphml/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colzphml/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colzphml/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colzphml/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/colzphml","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colzphml/mfe_test/commits/acabdeb6e2c94905424ed7ac939b86fbfccc2fc5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T10:24:05Z","email":"colzphml@gmail.com","name":"colz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T10:24:05Z","email":"colzphml@gmail.com","name":"colz"},"message":"fix(apisix): deploy via plain manifest (data_plane standalone), drop Helm\n\nRoot cause: chart apisix 2.14.1 can''t set role: data_plane (required for working\nfile-standalone in apisix 3.16) and hardcodes a /status/ready readinessProbe that\nalways 503s in file-standalone (apache/apisix#12662). Replaced with k8s/apisix.yaml:\nrole: data_plane + config_provider: yaml, routes via ConfigMap (each needs id),\nTCP readiness probe on 9080.\n\nAlso:\n- backend runtime image eclipse-temurin:17-jre-alpine -> 17-jre (arm64 multi-arch)\n- host port 8080 -> 8090 (8080 taken by user''s structurizr)\n- Makefile: kubectl-based apisix, kubectl wait (rollout status lacks --all), deploy apps only\n- check-deps drops helm; README updated\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"68909e7d8e7dab0f89de42565c4fce8392dbe8b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colzphml/mfe_test/git/trees/68909e7d8e7dab0f89de42565c4fce8392dbe8b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colzphml/mfe_test/git/commits/acabdeb6e2c94905424ed7ac939b86fbfccc2fc5","verification":{"payl