com/users/junnhooong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junnhooong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/junnhooong","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/junnhooong/module-federation-example/commits/d4de4ba0eb8b2bb31ca96eb52ca8860aee6c8dc9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T05:49:21Z","email":"junhong.goh@kyndryl.com","name":"Jun Hong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T05:49:21Z","email":"junhong.goh@kyndryl.com","name":"Jun Hong"},"message":"Add Vite remotes and cross-build-tool Module Federation support\n\nThis commit extends the multi-framework example to demonstrate Module Federation working across different build tools (Rsbuild + Vite). Key additions include three new Vite-based remotes (React, Vue, Svelte on ports 3004-3006) that can be consumed by the existing Rsbuild shell alongside the original Rsbuild remotes.\n\nChanges:\n- Add React, Vue, and Svelte Vite remotes with @originjs/vite-plugin-federation\n- Update shell app to consume both Rsbuild and Vite remotes\n- Remove deprecated apps/rsbuild/host and apps/rsbuild/remote examples\n- Add comprehensive documentation (VITE-REMOTES.md, HMR-GUIDE.md, MIGRATION-TO-OFFICIAL-VITE-PLUGIN.md, VITE-COMPATIBILITY.md)\n- Update start-all.sh to launch all 6 remotes and shell\n- Add .mf directory to .gitignore for federation artifacts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"15c54dd018466074d92c1afc82e172c9f49cd647","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/junnhooong/module-federation-example/git/trees/15c54dd018466074d92c1afc82e172c9f49cd647"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/junnhooong/module-federation-example/git/commits/d4de4ba0eb8b2bb31ca96eb52ca8860aee6c8dc9","verification":{"payload":"tree 15c54dd018466074d92c1afc82e172c9f49cd647\nparent 373afc1b54a3e595c18f2c645fe35447a0139500\nauthor Jun Hong <junhong.goh@kyndryl.com> 1780465761 +0800\ncommitter Jun Hong <junhong.goh@kyndryl.com> 1780465761 +0800\n\nAdd Vite remotes and cross-build-tool Module Federation support\n\nThis commit extends the multi-framework example to demonstrate Module Federation working across different build tools (Rsbuild + Vite). Key additions include three new Vite-based remotes (React, Vue, Svelte on ports 3004-3006) that can be consumed by the existing Rsbuild shell alongside the original Rsbuild remotes.\n\nChanges:\n- Add React, Vue, and Svelte Vite remotes with @originjs/vite-plugin-federation\n- Update shell app to consume both Rsbuild and Vite remotes\n- Remove deprecated apps/rsbuild/host and apps/rsbuild/remote examples\n- Add comprehensive documentation (VITE-REMOTES.md, HMR-GUIDE.md, MIGRATION-TO-OFFICIAL-VITE-PLUGIN.md, VITE-COMPATIBILITY.md)\n- Update start-all.sh to launch all 6 remotes and shell\n- Add .mf directory to .gitignore for federation artifacts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAge9liQTCatPYLUUJQz8780VEvcW\nMKtofM00FvA/hPQTMAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQG4obviv063cuM1VHlPEHfpSI3BtajC405KarJECRXV/wruq7tZzHNgewvyzasd7pJ\n26PoIoT3HZ65PnLPF2QAM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-09T13:22:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16744550?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junnhooong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junnhooong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junnhooong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junnhooong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/junnhooong","id":16744550,"login":"junnhooong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzQ0NTUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junnhooong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junnhooong/received_e