.github.com/repos/junnhooong/module-federation-example/commits/373afc1b54a3e595c18f2c645fe35447a0139500/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T14:36:46Z","email":"junhong.goh@kyndryl.com","name":"Jun Hong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T14:36:46Z","email":"junhong.goh@kyndryl.com","name":"Jun Hong"},"message":"Add Module Federation 2.0 multi-framework example\n\nImplemented a complete Module Federation 2.0 setup demonstrating micro-frontend architecture across React, Vue, and Svelte frameworks.\n\nFeatures:\n- Shell app (React) orchestrating components from multiple framework remotes\n- React remote exposing interactive button component\n- Vue remote exposing counter component with React wrapper\n- Svelte remote exposing flippable card component with React wrapper\n- Shared dependencies configuration with eager loading\n- Type-safe TypeScript support across all apps\n- Standalone mode for each remote app\n- Helper script for easy multi-app startup\n\nTechnical improvements:\n- Fixed RUNTIME-006 error with eager shared dependencies\n- Created framework wrappers for Vue/Svelte integration in React shell\n- Updated .gitignore to ignore dist, node_modules, and generated types\n- Added comprehensive documentation (README.md, CLAUDE.md, apps/README.md)\n- Port configuration: Shell (3000), React (3001), Vue (3002), Svelte (3003)\n\nAlso includes existing Rsbuild and Modern.js implementation examples.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d68a95eb4a782b14c490760d79fc7981fcf04822","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/junnhooong/module-federation-example/git/trees/d68a95eb4a782b14c490760d79fc7981fcf04822"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/junnhooong/module-federation-example/git/commits/373afc1b54a3e595c18f2c645fe35447a0139500","verification":{"payload":"tree d68a95eb4a782b14c490760d79fc7981fcf04822\nparent 5db04dffca30ef6e09ae9c6c2af5a1d730e5e4ed\nauthor Jun Hong <junhong.goh@kyndryl.com> 1780411006 +0800\ncommitter Jun Hong <junhong.goh@kyndryl.com> 1780411006 +0800\n\nAdd Module Federation 2.0 multi-framework example\n\nImplemented a complete Module Federation 2.0 setup demonstrating micro-frontend architecture across React, Vue, and Svelte frameworks.\n\nFeatures:\n- Shell app (React) orchestrating components from multiple framework remotes\n- React remote exposing interactive button component\n- Vue remote exposing counter component with React wrapper\n- Svelte remote exposing flippable card component with React wrapper\n- Shared dependencies configuration with eager loading\n- Type-safe TypeScript support across all apps\n- Standalone mode for each remote app\n- Helper script for easy multi-app startup\n\nTechnical improvements:\n- Fixed RUNTIME-006 error with eager shared dependencies\n- Created framework wrappers for Vue/Svelte integration in React shell\n- Updated .gitignore to ignore dist, node_modules, and generated types\n- Added comprehensive documentation (README.md, CLAUDE.md, apps/README.md)\n- Port configuration: Shell (3000), React (3001), Vue (3002), Svelte (3003)\n\nAlso includes existing Rsbuild and Modern.js implementation examples.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAge9liQTCatPYLUUJQz8780VEvcW\nMKtofM00FvA/hPQTMAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQBgxGDOIC9/djLypxG0KLFlPqmtJHg+RfKBpbAonuuCAI6Ym41u7GR5dEQkFb2HGmF\nwy50vFoiy5WIyyZHS/2Qo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T23:29:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16744550?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junnhooong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junnhooong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junnhooong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junnhooong/gists{/gist_id}","gravat